		"&7- Pressing Alt+R sorts by ID&r "
	]
	quest.0CCFA64CA88D2D22.quest_subtitle: "Multiple Choices!"
	quest.0CCFA64CA88D2D22.title: "R Key Sorting"
	quest.0CFA26B3944AAF49.quest_desc: [
		"To enhance material properties, use the Starlight Charger for reinforcement."
		""
		"Set up a 7×7 area in open air, place charger in center, erect four 2-block-high pillars at corners. Blocks placed on pillar tops determine charging level:"
		"{image:kubejs:textures/gui/starlight_charger.png width:180 height:100 align:center}"
		""
		"Level 1: Carmot Steel Block, requires Fiery Gold Dust as catalyst."
		""
		"Level 2: Azure Orichalcum Block, requires Azure Silver Dust as catalyst."
		""
		"Level 3: Tyr Steel Block, requires Astral Powder as catalyst."
		""
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"After placement, wait about 15 seconds for charger to recognize environment. Device only works in open air at night and consumes energy."
		""
		"Higher-tier chargers can use lower-tier catalysts, but charging level follows catalyst's corresponding level."
	]
	quest.0CFA26B3944AAF49.quest_subtitle: "Material Infusion"
	quest.0D134B44D9F3BA01.quest_desc: [
		"&6Sturdy Shield Treaty"
		"&7Accelerated exterior inseparable from fragile nature.&r&cSoul shield stability halved"
		"&7Accelerated form's soul shield, timely rain turning danger to safety.&r&aIncreases soul shield capacity&r&aSoul shield recovery rate doubled"
	]
	quest.0D134B44D9F3BA01.quest_subtitle: "Act Alert"
	quest.0D134B44D9F3BA01.title: "Sturdy Shield Treaty"
	quest.0D1AFFB3C244802E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Portal Frame&r"
		"&7A functional block that assists mages in creating permanent portals.&r"
		"&7When first placed, the portal frame is just an empty shell, with only its frame having a collision box.&r"
		""
		"&7By casting the &bEnder Portal&r&7 spell on the portal frame using the &eCorrespondence Wand&r&7 or similar means, it can be transformed into a portal usable for teleportation. It can only connect to another portal frame that has also been enchanted with the Ender Portal spell to facilitate travel. Such portals have no distance limit and exist permanently.&r"
		""
		"&7Do not attempt to break this block after creating a portal, as it may cause the model to disappear while the block itself remains, until you connect it to another portal.&r"
		""
		"&7Players can dye an activated portal by consuming 1 dye of any color; the corresponding portal will also be dyed automatically.&r"
	]
	quest.0D1AFFB3C244802E.quest_subtitle: "Quick Travel"
	quest.0ED82FFAE99D2480.quest_desc: [
		"&eA cheap chemical product."
		"&6A better conventional choice than lava."
		""
		"⚡ Speed: 1.0x | ♨ Temperature: 2000 | ⏳ Consumption: 0.3"
		""
		"&aTip&r&7: &f♨ &r&7Temperature determines the material grade that can be processed, ⚡ Speed affects processing time, ⏳ Consumption represents fuel durability."
	]
	quest.0ED82FFAE99D2480.quest_subtitle: "Better Fuel"
	quest.0EEA8DDC455E7FCB.quest_desc: [
		"&7Observing &8Rot&r&7 spread (in controlled environment, of course), I noticed this metaphysical damage occasionally strong enough to leave scars on stone—thus named "
		"&6Scarred"
		"Stone"
		"&r"
		"&7"
		"."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Scarred Stone Research: Texture"
		"&7Scarred Stone is strange rock, somewhat similar to &8Rot&r&7. I detected granite, obsidian, diorite, andesite fragments, also much ordinary stone; fragments scattered chaotically, no pattern. It also doesn't respond to &bRelease Ritual&r&7."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Scarred Stone Research: Creation"
		"&7This stone's emergence seems purely random; I haven't verified specific trigger conditions. But roughly every ten &8Rot&r&7 spreads, this brutal transmutation carves a mass of Scarred Stone."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Scarred Stone Research: Strange Crystals"
		"&7Though unresponsive to &bRelease Ritual&r&7, it seems to have strange... growths? These growths themselves are crystals, yet behave like plants. I don't know their purpose. If I were &dbiomancer&r&7, this discovery might be once-in-a-lifetime."
	]
	quest.0EEA8DDC455E7FCB.quest_subtitle: "Twisted Rock"
	quest.0EF9389ADF9236E6.quest_desc: [
		"&6Magic Essence&r"
		"&7A consumable used to increase &bspell strength&r&7 and &bspell resistance&r&7. Each has 3 tiers and usage limits. Obtained by:&r"
		"&7Strength: Dropped by &eMagical Creatures&r&7, upgraded via &6rituals&r&7.&r"
		"&7Resistance: Obtained via &eCondensers&r&7, upgraded via &6rituals&r&7.&r"
	]
	quest.0EF9389ADF9236E6.title: "&6Magic Essence: Resistance&r"
	quest.0F731D1ED5DD01BC.quest_desc: [
		"&6Wind-Caress Treaty"
		"&7Wind also brushes face.&r&cGreater momentum increases knockback received"
		"&7Coordinate with wind to run.&r&aSprinting accumulates momentum"
	]
	quest.0F731D1ED5DD01BC.quest_subtitle: "Merge with Wind"
	quest.0F731D1ED5DD01BC.title: "Wind-Caress Treaty"
	quest.11047BEDA6023228.quest_desc: [
		"&6Mystic Orb&r"
		"&7Right-click to obtain a &eharp&r&7 and the &eLost Melody&r&7 accessory. Obtained via the &6Island Ritual&r&7. To use the Mystic Orb, you must complete all &belemental familiar&r&7 (except Bard familiar) taming progressions.&r"
		"&5Or directly perform the ritual synthesis to skip the complicated taming process."
	]
	quest.110C8BBFDBFBA375.quest_subtitle: "&cThis will clear your current difficulty settings. All mobs' health, attack multiplier, armor, and armor toughness will be ×8"
	quest.110C8BBFDBFBA375.title: "&c\"Unspeakable Monstrous Strength and Brutality\""
	quest.1117830BC3A66701.quest_desc: [
		"&6Cauldron Acceleration"
		"&7&bSoul Cauldron&r&7 has shortcomings: relatively slow. Gathering &eArcane Energy&r&7 to central item requires time. Not without reason; most substances can't withstand such fast energy flow, overloaded catalysts easily damaged."
		"&7"
		"&7However, heating catalyst mysteriously can reduce this repulsion while speeding gathering. This is precisely &bSoul Catalyst&r&7's purpose. But not perfect solution; instability often causes catalysts unnecessary &cdamage&r&7."
		"&7"
		"&7Each active catalyst around cauldron speeds gathering, up to eight accepted. However, destabilization risk increases proportionally with catalyst count, possibly causing catalysts extra unnecessary damage."
	]
	quest.1117830BC3A66701.quest_subtitle: "Heat Heating"
	quest.1117830BC3A66701.title: "Cauldron Acceleration"
	quest.11789A166C0520B4.quest_subtitle: "Familiar Summoning Ritual"
	quest.11838DA838ECEA4D.quest_subtitle: "Arcane Materials"
	quest.11C363982673E669.quest_desc: [
		"&7I experimented with various materials to create a scribing desk and found that runewood performed most effectively."
		""
		"When transcribing on its surface, the energy flow within the ink is more stable, significantly reducing the risk of rune distortion and energy dissipation—in short, the reliability of transcription is practically ensured."
	]
	quest.11C363982673E669.quest_subtitle: "Transcribing Spells"
	quest.11E9AE8529E6FBF2.quest_subtitle: "Hero of the Village"
	quest.12070A3305878F5D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Fluid Tank&r"
		""
		"&6Placement&r"
		"&7When Fluid Tanks are placed forming a rectangular prism with a square base (1*1*n, 2*2*n, or 3*3*n), adjacent tanks automatically merge into a single unit.&r"
		"&7The height 'n' of the tank structure can be up to 32 blocks. Tanks placed above this height will be considered a new, independent tank.&r"
		""
		"&6Storing Fluids&r"
		"&7Can store various fluids, with a capacity of 8 B (8000 mB, or 8 buckets) per block. Input and output require a &eKinetic Pump&r.&r"
		"&7In Creative mode, right-clicking the tank with a fluid-filled container (e.g., a bucket) directly injects the fluid. In Survival mode, use a &eFluid Spout&r combined with other fluid components for input.&r"
		"&7Right-click the tank with a Wrench to open or close its inspection window for viewing the internal fluid state.&r"
		"&7Fluid Tanks can be detected by Comparators, Item Detectors, and Stockpile Switches. The filter slot of an Item Detector can be marked using bucketed or bottled fluids.&r"
		""
		"&6As a Boiler&r"
		"&7When a &eSteam Whistle&r or &eSteam Engine&r is installed on the surface of a Fluid Tank structure, it transforms into a Boiler structure. The inspection window disappears, and a pressure gauge appears on each side.&r"
		"&7The Boiler provides steam to connected Steam Whistles or Steam Engines.&r"
		""
		"&8The edge of this manuscript page is drawn with a stacked tank structure, with simple gauges on the side. Below, scrawled in small text: Fills fully, sees clearly, and when needed, roars loud.&r"
	]
	quest.124EF6C94011C149.quest_desc: [
		"&6Strange Mushroom&r"
		"&7Right-click on a tamed familiar to grant it 1 stack of the '&cFury&r&7' effect (when attacked, there is a chance to consume 1 stack of '&cFury&r&7' to gain the '&cMind Stillness&r&7' status for several seconds). Each familiar can stack up to 10 layers. Dropped by &eMooshrooms&r&7 and shorn &eSwamp Villagers&r&7.&r"
	]
	quest.12C9785ECF565304.quest_subtitle: "Stage 0"
	quest.131FF32C0FF28CA8.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Defeat it to condense its boiling death authority into a scepter. That inactive heart is a specimen of extracted time's end... Defeating it will liberate the magical minerals of the entire world."
		""
		"&7Perhaps there exists a method? To seize its scepter without having to defeat it."
	]
	quest.131FF32C0FF28CA8.quest_subtitle: "Stage 0, unlocks Stage 1 after kill"
	quest.13AFD3688361872A.quest_desc: [
		"# &aGame Modification Content &r"
		""
		"### &eIce and Fire Adjustments &r"
		"&7- &fPixies no longer steal player items&a, can be safely kept &r"
		""
		"### &#FFBB1AKeep Inventory Adjustment &r"
		"&7- &fIf Keep Inventory is not enabled, death revival no longer restores to perfect condition. Death retains hotbar items and equipment,&r"
		""
		"### &eIron's Spells 'n Spellbooks Adjustments &r"
		"&7- &fMost spells now require &dlearning before use &r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"### &#FF9F9AItem Tooltip Adjustment&r"
		"&7- &fIf item tooltips are too long, use mouse wheel to scroll up/down to browse &r"
		""
		"### &#FF91EESign Adjustment&r"
		"&7- &fSigns placed on containers like chests can be modified by sneaking. Direct clicking will pass through the sign to click items inside the container &r"
		""
		"### &#C9FF74Entity Cleanup System &r"
		"&7- Config file path: &9kubejs/server_scripts/entity_clean.js &r "
		"&7- &fModpack comes with &6automatic cleanup system (disabled by default)&f, configurable in this file: "
		" &7▪ &fCleanup content "
		" &7▪ &fSwitch status &r "
		"&7- &fFor manual cleanup, use command: &b/rf entityclean &r"
	]
	quest.13AFD3688361872A.quest_subtitle: "Game Experience Modifications"
	quest.13AFD3688361872A.title: "Some Changes"
	quest.13C22895EB17EE88.quest_desc: [
		"&6Fluid Spout&r"
		""
		"&7A device dedicated to performing \"Filling\" processing, capable of the following operations:&r"
		"&7Filling container items (e.g., buckets, glass bottles) with fluids, effective for most mod fluids as well;&r"
		"&7Executing special filling recipes provided by the Create mod (e.g., wetting grass blocks, making Blaze Cake, etc.).&r"
		""
		"&6Usage Requirements&r"
		"&7Must receive fluid input via fluid components like fluid pipes; cannot be manually filled directly with a bucket.&r"
		"&7Can process items on a conveyor belt or depot below. When a processable item enters its work range, it plays a filling animation and consumes the corresponding amount of fluid. Each filling process takes 21 game ticks (1.05 seconds).&r"
		"&7When the Fluid Spout contains no fluid or insufficient fluid, it will halt processable items on the conveyor belt until fluid is replenished.&r"
		""
		"&8Let it drink its fill, then it can feed those below.&r"
	]
	quest.13C542FCBB189AEA.quest_subtitle: "Nameless Traveler"
	quest.13CCBB1FAF6834F4.quest_desc: [
		"&6Rune Wood Obelisk"
		"&7Soul infusion, its necessity and tediousness grow daily, simple as making pile of curse ash takes minutes."
		""
		"&7Acceleration method lies within &6Divine Gold&r&7. Placing up to four obelisks made from it around altar speeds process by &aquarter&r&7 each."
		""
		"&6Experience Crystal Obelisk"
		"&7Though itself not greatly useful for infusion, obelisk construction can be further utilized."
		""
		"&7Replacing Divine Gold with &eExperience Crystal&r&7, obelisk harmonizes with enchanted intellect, providing substantial enchantment power."
		"&7One such obelisk equals &bfive bookshelves&r&7."
	]
	quest.13CCBB1FAF6834F4.quest_subtitle: "Obelisk"
	quest.13CCBB1FAF6834F4.title: "Altar Acceleration"
	quest.13DF171E70CF449D.quest_desc: [
		"&oWith wind, or water, or even the most primitive manpower—in any case, it began to turn."
		"&r"
		"Connect gears, let them spin and clash, transmit stress, play the symphony—so the manuscript says."
		""
		"My confusions can all be resolved by &6pressing [W] to ponder&r. I believe the path ahead is unobstructed."
		""
		"&8However, any windmill with wool can move windlessly—is this also the wisdom of mechanics?&r"
	]
	quest.13DF171E70CF449D.quest_subtitle: "And then the gears began to turn..."
	quest.13DF171E70CF449D.title: "Gears' First Chime"
	quest.13FB94D18517171F.quest_desc: [
		"&6Mixing Basin&r"
		""
		"&7It is the most tolerant container in a mechanic's workshop, patiently holding various items and fluids, waiting for them to transform according to set recipes.&r"
		""
		"&6Internal Order&r"
		"&7The Mixing Basin has 18 item slots: the first 9 accept ingredients, the last 9 store products. Each item can stack up to one stack (64 items).&r"
		"&7Simultaneously, it has 4 fluid slots. Each fluid can hold up to &c1000 mb&7, with the total fluid volume not exceeding &c4000 mb&7. At any time, a single fluid will not exceed the 1000 mb limit.&r"
		"&7Items and fluids coexist peacefully here, without interference. Even lava and water can coexist safely—they do not interact within the Mixing Basin.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Input and Output Rules&r"
		"&7All six faces can accept or output items, but any automated input can only send &c1 to 16&7 items at a time. An exception is items entering as entities (dropped items), which can stack up to 64.&r"
		"&7Components like &eMechanical Arms&r and &eBrass Funnels&r can also input a maximum of 16 items, and Brass Funnels cannot set a specific quantity.&r"
		"&7Output is more lenient: Andesite Funnels output 1 item each time, while Brass Funnels and Mechanical Arms can output from 1 to 64 items as configured. Conveyor Belts and Fluid Spouts can also serve as inputs, letting items slide into the basin from the edge.&r"
		"&7Fluids must be transferred via a &eKinetic Pump&r or pipes connected to one. When pumping in, it prioritizes filling input slots; when pumping out, it prioritizes extracting from output slots. If output slots are empty and there is space, it will extract fluid from input slots—this requires special attention to avoid confusing recipes.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Filtering and Guiding&r"
		"&7There is a filter slot on the side of the Mixing Basin. Placing a single item, a &eFilter&7, or an &eAttribute Filter&7 specifies that it only produces marked products (fluids can be marked using bottled samples).&r"
		"&7When the side is unobstructed and there is an open container diagonally below, the Mixing Basin automatically generates an &eOutput Spout/Opening&7, attempting to send out products. This spout has a hidden output slot—if it contains an item, the Mixing Basin will stop working, a common reason for production lines mysteriously stalling.&r"
		"&7The spout holds the output of one recipe at a time. If a recipe produces multiple items, the first enters the spout slot, and the rest go into the Mixing Basin's output slots. Use a &eWrench&7 to adjust the spout's position or disable it. As long as the diagonal block below doesn't update, the spout won't reappear.&r"
		"&7Blocks that qualify as automatic output containers include: Mixing Basins, Depots, Conveyor Belts, Hoppers, Crushing Wheels, and most Create components, but vanilla hoppers are not included.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Recipe Processing Order&r"
		"&7When collaborating with devices like a &eMechanical Press&7 or &eMechanical Mixer&7, the Mixing Basin processes recipes in the following logic:&r"
		"&7If input slots have processable recipes: process pure item recipes first, then item-fluid mixed recipes, and finally pure fluid recipes.&r"
		"&7If input slots have no recipes: prioritize processing all recipes in item slots, then item-fluid mixes, and lastly pure fluids.&r"
		""
		"&7Other details: Items of the same type will try to stack in existing slots and won't easily occupy new slots. If all 9 output slots are full, all processing halts.&r"
		""
		"&8The edge of the page has a dark stain, as if someone pressed a grease-covered thumb here.&r"
	]
	quest.13FB94D18517171F.quest_subtitle: "A small square container, yet the heart of the entire factory"
	quest.142C80D05D6B1FDC.quest_subtitle: "Clear all adjusted difficulty settings, including Forsaken Child"
	quest.143A6CDB76F7A3DC.quest_subtitle: "Stage 0"
	quest.147DBFF8D9EC5476.quest_subtitle: "Illagers' Treasure"
	quest.14D4101B90CF5417.quest_subtitle: "Shouldn't you take a break now?"
	quest.14D4101B90CF5417.title: "One Hour Playtime"
	quest.14F646FF9C81DCA0.quest_desc: [
		"&6Spider Fang&r"
		"&7Used to craft &cToxic Reagent&r&7 and heal &cPlague Doctor&r&7 familiars. Dropped by &cCave Spiders&r&7.&r"
	]
	quest.14F646FF9C81DCA0.quest_subtitle: "Toxic"
	quest.159E4C31CF4AB181.quest_desc: [
		"&6Unforgiving Abyssal Maw Oath&r"
		""
		"&7Essence devoured originates from malice, thus craves erosion.&r"
		"&7-Abuse slowly decays received &call healing&r"
		""
		"&7Corrosive patterns engraved into malice soul-retention.&r"
		"&7-&6Malice Critical&r&7 will &8devour&r&7 affected creature's &8life essence&r"
		"&7-&8Devoured&r&7 essence &aheals&r&7 you based on damage amount&r"
	]
	quest.159E4C31CF4AB181.quest_subtitle: "Devour Everything"
	quest.159E4C31CF4AB181.title: "Unforgiving Abyssal Maw Oath"
	quest.15DDBCE29F4CEB4B.quest_subtitle: "Synthesis material, primarily used in crafting some advanced machinery and intelligent components."
	quest.162B974C78D8FB42.quest_subtitle: "First Signs"
	quest.16FD71D5EBCE3C6A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Train Controls&r"
		""
		"&7This is the \"helm\" of the train structure, allowing the conductor—or another entity—to control the movement of the entire mechanical construct.&r"
		""
		"&6Installation&r"
		"&7Each train structure must contain at least one set of Train Controls, firmly glued to the structure during assembly.&r"
		"&7If you want an entity to pilot it, place a &eSeat&7 or &eBlaze Burner&7 directly in front of the Train Controls.&r"
		"&7If you want the train to travel bidirectionally, you can install Train Controls at both ends of the structure.&r"
		""
		"&6Control Method&r"
		"&7After assembly is complete, two control levers will appear on the Train Controls. Right-click to enter control mode.&r"
		"&7Now, use movement keys (WASD) to control the train's movement. The speed bar in the interface shows real-time speed. This bar is divided into 18 segments and categorized into five stages.&r"
		"&7Speed automatically decreases when the train turns.&r"
		"&7You can store coal on the train to increase travel speed; fuel is consumed over time.&r"
		"&7Scrolling the mouse wheel adjusts the speed limit, visually indicated by the position of a brass slider.&r"
		"&7The arrow above the speed bar indicates the relative direction of the train's forward movement in your field of view.&r"
		"&7If the train is equipped with a whistle, pressing the sprint key (default Ctrl) will sound it.&r"
		""
		"&8The corner of this page is folded, with a simple sketch of train controls drawn in charcoal. Scribbled beside it: Hold tight, watch the road, remember to bring coal.&r"
	]
	quest.1739A8FBB4773234.quest_subtitle: "Fluid Converted to Blocks"
	quest.17695E30CD9EB522.quest_subtitle: "Surely no one would die over 100 times just to get this quest's reward, right?"
	quest.17DE5C30E0CA8765.quest_desc: [
		"# &bPerformance Optimization Recommendations &r"
		""
		"### &e Video Settings Suggestions &r"
		"&b▸ &6Render Distance: &r&l8&r "
		"&b▸ &6Max Shadow Distance: &r&l6&r "
		"&b▸ &6Simulation Distance: &r&l6&r "
		"&b▸ &6VSync: &r&cOff&r "
		"&b▸ &6Max FPS: &r&aUnlimited&r "
		"&b▸ &6Entity Render Distance: &r&975%&r "
		""
		"&7Other settings can remain default～ "
		""
		"### &3Notes &r"
		"&7- Fine-tune values based on device performance "
		"&7- Reduce render distance appropriately when encountering lag "
	]
	quest.17DE5C30E0CA8765.quest_subtitle: "Huh? Optimization isn't as good as imagined?"
	quest.182289427E06D427.quest_subtitle: "Auto-clicker's Good Partner"
	quest.182321BDA643635C.quest_desc: ["Storage network access efficiency now struggles to meet my demands; I need to seek faster data read/write solutions."]
	quest.182321BDA643635C.quest_subtitle: "Faster, Better, Stronger!"
	quest.18AC27B34367E1DD.quest_desc: ["When performing a sneak action, blocks can be instantly mined (This is a bug, but I think keeping it would make the game more interesting)."]
	quest.18AC27B34367E1DD.quest_subtitle: "Tunnel Digger"
	quest.18C5ACA6F816EDCB.quest_desc: [
		"&6Miniature Shield&r"
		"&7Right-click on a tamed familiar to grant it a low probability ability to &ablock&r&7 attacks, limited to 1 per familiar. Obtained via &eCondensers&r&7.&r"
	]
	quest.18D4FAD08F8837FD.quest_desc: [
		"&6Pandora's Box&r"
		"&7Allows simultaneous &asummoning/dismissal&r&7 of up to 10 familiars (obtained via crafting).&r"
	]
	quest.18D4FAD08F8837FD.quest_subtitle: "You opened Pandora's box..."
	quest.1954C7719D379871.quest_desc: [
		"&6Shield-Guard Device&r"
		""
		"&7Borrowing Soul-Stained Steel's multiphase superposition property, Shield-Guard Device has chance to completely absorb &eCatalyst&r&7 damage taken, while slightly stabilizing &aFocus Process&r&7. However, it does slow focus speed.&r"
	]
	quest.1954C7719D379871.quest_subtitle: "Face Storm"
	quest.1A4259700BD803E8.quest_desc: [
		"&6Andesite Funnel&r"
		""
		"&6Funnel and Item Entities&r"
		"&7When attached to a container, the Andesite Funnel defaults to output mode, pushing items from the container as item entities out of its front. Switched to input mode, it rapidly absorbs all item entities within its block space without speed limits. Right-click with a Wrench to toggle mode.&r"
		"&7In input mode, holding an item and right-clicking the funnel's front directly stores the item into its connected container.&r"
		"&7Consistent with common design, a redstone signal can lock the Andesite Funnel, stopping its operation.&r"
		""
		"&7Andesite Funnels can be installed above or below containers. When outputting upwards, items are ejected with some momentum. If not collected promptly, item entities will pile up above the funnel. Utilizing this characteristic enables &avertical upward transmission&r of items.&r"
		""
		"&6Regarding Vertical Orientation&r"
		"&7When the funnel mouth is oriented vertically up or down, it cannot be used as a purely vertical transport pipe. For pure vertical transport, consider using &eChutes&r or vanilla hoppers.&r"
		""
		"&6Funnel and Work Block Interaction&r"
		"&7When an Andesite Funnel is attached to the side of a block, and a specific work block exists directly below it, it directly exchanges items with that block. Using a Wrench to toggle mode in this case changes its appearance to '&eAndesite Belt Funnel&r'.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7Blocks that can directly interact this way include: &eDepot&r, &eWeighted Ejector&r, &eConveyor Belt&r, &eFluid Spout&r, &eMechanical Saw&r (only when facing upwards), &eTrain Station&r.&r"
		""
		"&7If an Andesite Funnel is placed on a conveyor belt, with its opening direction aligned with the belt's movement direction, it enters tunnel mode. Here, item input or output is entirely determined by the conveyor belt's transport direction.&r"
		"&7Tunnel-mode funnels default to a retracted form. Use a Wrench to switch them to an extended form. The extended form covers part of the conveyor belt below, usable for decoration, and its collision box changes accordingly.&r"
		""
		"&8Note on manuscript edge: It's flexible, but don't expect it to break fundamental rules.&r"
	]
	quest.1A58667FA2440598.quest_desc: [
		"&o&8Memory like weathered inscriptions."
		"&o&8Every attempt to recall feels like silver needles piercing the skull—"
		"&o&8After excruciating pain, only chaos remains."
		""
		"&o&8You examine your pack; every item signifies you're no ordinary passerby."
		""
		"&o&f\"Remember your oath.\""
		"&o&8—That voice grinds across the wasteland, piercing the soul,"
		"&o&8But the oath's content has crumbled with memory."
		""
		"&o&8Who are you?"
		"&o&8A fallen hero, or an oath-breaking traitor?"
		"&o&8A pawn discarded from the chessboard, or a blade cutting toward fate?"
		""
		"&o&8The answer lies beyond the mist,"
		"&o&8And your footsteps have shattered the silence—"
		"&o&fToward the abyss, or the throne."
	]
	quest.1A58667FA2440598.quest_subtitle: "Pack Your Bags"
	quest.1A58667FA2440598.title: "The Beginning of All Things"
	quest.1A8CEE0746A74FC4.quest_subtitle: "Stage 0"
	quest.1AA4DC70AD282F2B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Impurity Stabilizer&r"
		""
		"&7&8Evil Souls&r&7 actively approach weaknesses and the weak, craving slaughter. Impurity Stabilizer utilizes this property, providing substantial &apercentage tuning amplification&r&7 to cauldron's weakest attributes besides fuel usage rate and destabilization risk. However, side effects exist, adding slight burden to standard &etuning process&r&7.&r"
	]
	quest.1AA4DC70AD282F2B.quest_subtitle: "Strength from Weakness"
	quest.1AA82BAE61749007.quest_desc: [
		"&6Slaughter Rune&r"
		""
		"&7Slaughter Rune urges consciousness to pursue destruction, increasing wearer's &escythe proficiency&r&7 against injured targets. Rune seems effective against targets ≤50% health, increasing scythe damage to them by about two-fifths.&r"
	]
	quest.1AA82BAE61749007.quest_subtitle: "Pulse Promoting Destruction"
	quest.1AB5165BCAD5820E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Searing Rune&r"
		""
		"&7Searing Rune urges consciousness to share its radiance with surroundings, consequences not considered; doubles &efire damage&r&7 caused by wearer.&r"
	]
	quest.1AB5165BCAD5820E.quest_subtitle: "Pulse Promoting Burning"
	quest.1AC360E218A91528.quest_desc: [
		"&aDue to extreme optimization, crashes may occur probabilistically when starting the game. If you don't want such situations and can accept disabling some optimization items:"
		"&r"
		"Disable:"
		"&7ImmediatelyFast (for 1.18 to 1.21.4; disable ImmediatelyFast's hud_batching, font_atlas_resizing, and fast_text_lookup, otherwise may cause crashes;) &r"
	]
	quest.1AC360E218A91528.quest_subtitle: "Restart to Apply"
	quest.1AC360E218A91528.title: "Stuck?"
	quest.1BD8D56B55550058.quest_desc: [
		"&6Reaper Treaty"
		"&7Breaking bonds entraps in &cdilemma&r&7.&r&cWeapons forbidden by oath deal 90% less damage&r&cWeapons forbidden by oath quickly break when used"
		"&7Soul signs treaty with scythe, arcane chains tightly connect both.&r&aScythe attacks have chance to trigger chain strikes"
	]
	quest.1BD8D56B55550058.quest_subtitle: "Master Scythe Blade"
	quest.1BD8D56B55550058.title: "Reaper Treaty"
	quest.1C22E01E9591DC36.quest_subtitle: "FRIENDSHIP ENDS HERE"
	quest.1C22E01E9591DC36.title: "10 Player Kills"
	quest.1C3C513FE9686B55.quest_subtitle: "I might need to find something to eat before dark"
	quest.1C3C513FE9686B55.title: "Any Food x12"
	quest.1CBEB689E8C2B677.quest_desc: [
		"&6Research: Void Slate"
		"&7After passing through &dCrying Well&r&7, &bSoul Stone&r&7 transformed into substance I call "
		"&8Void"
		"Slate"
		"&r"
		"&7"
		". Though physical properties similar to Soul Stone, it seems lacking soul... yet its interaction with Arcane Energy remains identical to Soul Stone."
		"&7"
		"&7Perhaps this is Soul Stone's state before acquiring &dSoul Energy&r&7? Cannot confirm its soul interaction pattern, nor transfer this property like creating &6Soul-Stained Steel&r&7. Only theory: complete absence of Arcane Energy, not even slightest trace, somehow possesses unique Arcane Energy. What energy would this be?"
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Reexamination: Void Slate"
		"&7Complete absence of Arcane Energy also has effect. Void Slate's essence should be clear—Soul Stone; Soul Stone attuned to &8Void&r&7 rather than Arcane Energy."
		"&7"
		"&7May still be Soul Stone's precursor, but possibly related otherwise... Its physical manifestation properties identical to Soul Stone. Differing properties entirely due to material's interaction target."
	]
	quest.1CBEB689E8C2B677.quest_subtitle: "Blank Slate, Perhaps the Precursor"
	quest.1D08BC5C6C98F4D7.quest_subtitle: "Legendary Hero Who Triggered 5 Raids?!?"
	quest.1D3C94736A0C19AA.quest_desc: ["Manage all configured auto-crafting schemes in your storage network, allowing item access and scheduling anytime."]
	quest.1D3C94736A0C19AA.quest_subtitle: "Assembly Line Work"
	quest.1D7C2FBD7B33CA7A.quest_subtitle: "Stage 1"
	quest.1E2987FBFD03DFEA.quest_desc: [
		"&6Gluttony Brooch&r"
		""
		"&7Sacrifice not limited to physical level, spiritual sacrifice also sacrifice. Gluttony Brooch deprives &csatiation&r&7, causing constant desire to eat despite sufficient consumption. In exchange, my shriveled abdomen gains an &abelt&r&7 slot.&r"
	]
	quest.1E2987FBFD03DFEA.quest_subtitle: "Endless Hunger"
	quest.1E5FC0856DAA4E01.quest_subtitle: "Hundred Slayer"
	quest.1E5FC0856DAA4E01.title: "Kill Champion Mobs ×100"
	quest.1EA661BBFE32AD97.quest_subtitle: "Swift Sword"
	quest.1EBAE1ABF6C57762.quest_desc: [
		"&7Indeed, permanent oaths simultaneously &8heavy burdens&r&7. Oaths powerful, but their &cnegative effects&r&7 follow like shadows."
		"&7Oaths can be reclaimed at &6Brazier&r&7, allowing choice of paid price."
		""
		"&7To reclaim oath, first prepare declaration materials at Brazier, ignite using &5Uncausality Flame&r&7."
		"&7This operation &crevokes&r&7 rather than declares oath. Other procedures identical to declaration; reclaiming simple soul's oath also requires weakening before ignition."
	]
	quest.1EBAE1ABF6C57762.quest_subtitle: "Cost Too High"
	quest.1EBAE1ABF6C57762.title: "Reclaim Oath"
	quest.1EBDC6E060A25C43.quest_desc: [
		"&6Memory Fragment&r"
		"&7Remnants of a familiar's forgotten past; they will guide you to places the familiar considers its &bhome&r&7.&r"
	]
	quest.1F38C534465F33BC.quest_desc: [
		"&6Fluid Pipe&r"
		""
		"&6Usage/How to Use&r"
		""
		"&6Transferring Fluids&r"
		"&7Requires a &eKinetic Pump&r&7 to provide pressure (power) for fluid transfer. By default, a Kinetic Pump can transfer fluid for a distance of &c16 blocks&r&7. After that, another Kinetic Pump is needed to transfer further.&r"
		"&7The pipe itself has no fluid transfer speed limit; transfer speed depends on the extraction speed.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7If the pipe opening is exposed, it consumes 1000 mB of fluid to generate a corresponding fluid block in the direction of the opening. (If the fluid has no block form, it only shows a leak effect and consumes at 1 mB/t.) It can also extract fluid blocks adjacent to the pipe opening in reverse.&r"
		"&7When extracting from infinite water sources, the pipe doesn't visibly deplete the source; the water block being extracted actually alternates between source and flow. If a single water block is extracted at a rate exceeding 200 mB/t (equivalent to using two Kinetic Pumps at 200 RPM each), the source replenishment rate cannot keep up with the pipe's extraction rate (using a Wrench to open the window shows the flow intermittently stopping). Beyond this point, the actual extraction speed no longer increases with pump speed.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7Furthermore, when using multiple pipes to extract from infinite water, ensure each water block being extracted is adjacent to at least two water source blocks that are not being extracted by other pipes. Otherwise, simultaneous extraction from multiple source blocks may cause the infinite water to fail or cause extraction speed fluctuations.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7When water contains kelp, the pipe cannot extract from that water block. Simply breaking the kelp won't restore the pipe; you must update the blocks in the pipe system (e.g., change block state, adjust pump speed, re-place pipe opening fluid, etc.) to resume extraction. Water in other waterlogged blocks can be extracted normally.&r"
		"&7Fluid Pipes can extract water and lava from &eCauldrons&r&7.&r"
		"&7Fluid Pipes can extract &eHoney&r&7 from &eBee Nests&r&7 or &eBeehives&r&7 filled with honey, unlocking the advancement [Automated Apiary].&r"
		"&7The pipe itself has no buffer. If a pipe already having fluid passing through is interrupted (pipe broken or fluid valve closed), the fluid in the severed section will disappear directly due to the flow process being reset. Suddenly switching the source fluid type can also cause this effect.&r"
		""
		"&6Effect on Entities&r"
		"&7When the fluid leaking from a pipe opening is a potion, it applies that potion effect to entities in front; milk removes potion effects from entities.&r"
		"&7Water particles leaking from a Fluid Pipe extinguish fire on entities and blocks; lava particles leaking from a Fluid Pipe ignite entities.&r"
		"&7Regardless of how much fluid an entity is sprayed with, the game always applies the full effect. This means players can use 1 mB of potion to give an entity the full potion effect.&r"
		""
		"&6Opening Inspection Window&r"
		"&7Right-click with a Wrench to open an inspection window on the pipe to observe the fluid passing through. Pipes with windows cannot bend. Right-click with a Wrench again to close.&r"
		""
		"&6Encasing&r"
		"&7Right-click with a &eCopper Casing&r&7 to encase it; the Copper Casing is not consumed in the process.&r"
		"&7After encasing, the pipe's opening direction(s) and number of openings are locked and will no longer automatically connect to newly placed pipes nearby.&r"
		""
		"&6Fluid Interaction Reactions Inside Pipe&r"
		"&7When two fluids meet inside a pipe, the pipe is destroyed, and a block is generated based on the fluid types. (Specific reaction table omitted)&r"
	]
	quest.1F71B459B51B8E4B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Intricate Component&r"
		""
		"&7Intricate Component draws power from fractal-like chaotic intricate essence, as name suggests. When installed, fuel dependency rises, focus speed decreases, but &eCauldron&r&7 may produce double output in single &6Focus Cycle&r&7.&r"
	]
	quest.1F71B459B51B8E4B.quest_subtitle: "Abundant Wealth"
	quest.1F9695B95D863E7B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Delicate Brooch&r"
		""
		"&7Brooch symbolizes sacrifice. But regarding others' views, such sacrifice may be abstract, ambiguous, even absurdly comical. Necklace form not greatly different from belt; depriving concepts of fashion and decency allows wearing belt's &apower&r&7 on neck.&r"
	]
	quest.1F9695B95D863E7B.quest_subtitle: "Cautious Trade"
	quest.1FB3D1FAE9A88C39.quest_desc: [
		"&6Engineer's Journal&r"
		"&7An unexpected find during the journey—a manual, seemingly the legacy of some mechanic.&r"
		"&7According to the manuscript, mastering the skills within would allow one to become a mechanic. This means I could build my own production lines, produce endless resources, access more synthesis methods, and extract resources from ores that furnaces cannot refine.&r"
		""
		"&7However, this is not a mandatory path for the journey. Becoming a mechanic offers almost no help to combat power. The original owner of this manuscript couldn't even create a faulty robot to aid in battle. The benefits gained from it are more like icing on the cake.&r"
		""
		"&7If interested, perhaps try delving into it. The starting point for everything seems to be a cheap material called &6Andesite Alloy&r&7.&r"
	]
	quest.1FB3D1FAE9A88C39.title: "Prologue of Gears"
	quest.1FB95C69AF3C83E3.quest_desc: [
		"&6Archmage Settlement&r"
		"&7Archmages traveled to the &6End&r&7 dimension to study the secrets of the endless void, so they needed a temporary residence. They decided to build temporary homes throughout the End to conduct their research and exploration.&r"
	]
	quest.1FB95C69AF3C83E3.title: "&6Archmage Settlement&r"
	quest.1FBA0FE6A13F8E70.quest_subtitle: "You will receive a beginner's gift pack"
	quest.1FBA0FE6A13F8E70.title: "&a\"Honey Sugar Masking Suffering at the Beginning\""
	quest.1FC7A319D738A388.quest_subtitle: "Classic Weapon"
	quest.2037EF7CC87E7974.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Normally can be used as a casting device; right-clicking the fluid outlet while connected to &aCasting Table&r and &aMold Slot&r allows fluid outflow operation."
		""
		"Can receive &credstone signals&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Can also directly import fluid into liquid containers"
		"{image:kubejs:textures/gui/productivemetalworks_kjs_1.png width:150 height:100 align:center fit:true}"
	]
	quest.2037EF7CC87E7974.quest_subtitle: "Export Fluid"
	quest.2075CDEF8E217AEA.quest_subtitle: "Who Are You?"
	quest.2075CDEF8E217AEA.title: "First Champion Mob Kill"
	quest.20EF8A85CD3EFF3A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Soul Focus"
		"&7Utilizing &dTwisted Stone&r&7 and &cTainted Stone&r&7 disparate properties, I created device capable of drawing and focusing &eArcane Energy&r&7. Placing compatible substrate then yields new substance through this process."
		"&7"
		"&7Most basic substrate is &6Alchemical Catalyst&r&7, resembling certain objects seen before. Infusing &eArcane Energy&r&7 plus trace mineral ash transforms it into new substance, but this process also &cdamages catalyst&r&7."
	]
	quest.20EF8A85CD3EFF3A.quest_subtitle: "Mysterious Replication"
	quest.20EF8A85CD3EFF3A.title: "Soul Focus"
	quest.21294371EDEA78C6.quest_desc: [
		"&7Security Cards are items bound to players via right-click"
		""
		"Right-click binds to player while opening configuration interface; sneak right-click resets security settings"
	]
	quest.21294371EDEA78C6.quest_subtitle: "Let Me Access!"
	quest.214D64602702D242.quest_desc: [
		"&6Suspicious Device&r"
		""
		"&7Arcane and occult indeed opposed, indeed can create opposition enhancements. However, in torrential flow of arcane toward occult's termination, only chaos produced, result... corruption-spreading explosion, and resulting rot. This entry serves warning, not recommendation.&r"
	]
	quest.214D64602702D242.quest_subtitle: "A Cautionary Tale"
	quest.215AB6260ED8DAAD.quest_desc: ["&7Try your luck?&r"]
	quest.215AB6260ED8DAAD.quest_subtitle: "Random Tier + Random Enchantment"
	quest.215AB6260ED8DAAD.title: "Random Enchanted Book Sales"
	quest.2190DB8F13415C43.quest_desc: [
		"&6Flame-Promoting Launcher"
		"&7&cEvolution Fire&r&7 extremely intense, destroys everything in path for own evolution and spread. Thus inevitably weapons based on it exist, indeed do."
		"&7"
		"&7Using pair of &6Lantern Tongs&r&7 created this "
		"&6Flame-Promoting"
		"Launcher"
		"&r"
		"&7"
		". Recalibrates &bAura Embers&r&7 to "
		"unlock"
		" them, transforming their gentle flames into explosive infernos, controlling them until launch ready."
		"&7"
		"&7Added safety layer because... don't want rebuild laboratory. These flames extremely explosive. Of course, obsidian etc. basic blast protection blocks them."
	]
	quest.2190DB8F13415C43.quest_subtitle: "Evolution Transcends All"
	quest.219F39116C48B242.quest_desc: [
		"&7If you want to store fluids rather than storing buckets together, need to use Fluid Storage"
		""
		"In terminal, right-click bucket to pour liquid into terminal interior; hold empty bucket right-click to fill bucket"
	]
	quest.219F39116C48B242.quest_subtitle: "Fluid Storage"
	quest.21DFA7D5BF06FF3A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Mirror of Truth&r"
		"&7Used to reveal disguised &dIllusionist&r&7 familiars. Obtained via &6rituals&r&7.&r"
	]
	quest.21F608E19AD6FDF6.quest_desc: ["Currently only some basic materials can be recycled and reused. With current technology, more complex structured materials cannot yet be disassembled. Perhaps higher disassembly skills can be learned in the future."]
	quest.21F608E19AD6FDF6.quest_subtitle: "Recycle"
	quest.221645B2BE16D7E1.quest_desc: [
		"&6Prospector Treaty&r"
		""
		"&7Greed Burns Body&r"
		"&7-Hit while bearing '&cGreed&r&7' status causes you engulfed by &cFlames&r&7&r"
		""
		"&7Benefit from flames.&r"
		"&7-Collecting &eprecious minerals&r&7 grants '&6Greed&r&7' status&r"
		"&7-'&6Greed&r&7' status gradually increases &aluck probability&r"
		"&7-Upon gaining '&6Greed&r&7' status, additionally restores one heart of &alost health&r"
	]
	quest.221645B2BE16D7E1.quest_subtitle: "Earth's Treasure"
	quest.221645B2BE16D7E1.title: "Prospector Treaty"
	quest.2227DDA9A63E5685.quest_subtitle: "Stage 0"
	quest.2254C590DE6A8100.quest_desc: [
		"&6Berserker Treaty"
		"&7Hurt self, also hurt others.&r&cRage subsides over time&r&cDamage received doubled"
		"&7Endless rage, eternal fury; pain brings rage, rage is power.&r&aDamage received becomes rage&r&aDealing damage continuously fires &cEvil Arcane&r&a barrages at enemies based on rage"
	]
	quest.2254C590DE6A8100.quest_subtitle: "An Eye for an Eye"
	quest.2254C590DE6A8100.title: "Berserker Treaty"
	quest.22AFF77169DC5A28.quest_desc: ["Compared to the previous ordinary bookshelves, these enchanted bookshelves have superior attributes and significantly enhance weapon enchantment effects."]
	quest.22AFF77169DC5A28.quest_subtitle: "More Fashionable Bookshelves"
	quest.22DBDBE68B6E1B4D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Weapon Enchanting&r"
		"&7You can imprint a spell scroll onto a weapon, allowing the player to cast that spell while holding the weapon. Note: This will override spells from this mod or right-click skills from other mods.&r"
		""
		"&6Robe Enchanting&r"
		"&7Players can also imbue certain robes added by mods (such as &cPlague Sorcerer Robes&r&7, &cBlood Cultist Robes&r&7, etc.) with spells in a similar manner. When wearing a robe imbued with a spell, the player can cast the imbued spell. However, &eWandering Mage Robes&r&7 and &eSpooky Pumpkin Robes&r&7 cannot be used for this.&r"
	]
	quest.2331CCFEF5A9EEE5.quest_desc: [
		"&6Solitary Druid Treaty&r"
		""
		"&7Unconstrained means discarding armor.&r"
		"&7-After taking damage, armor will burden you, growing &cthorns&r&7 to damage your soul&r"
		""
		"&7Wholeness means unconstrained.&r"
		"&7-Each empty armor slot grants five points of &earmor value&r&7 and two points of &earmour toughness&r"
		"&7-Each empty armor slot increases received &ahealing&r&7 by one quarter&r"
	]
	quest.2331CCFEF5A9EEE5.quest_subtitle: "Escape External Things"
	quest.2331CCFEF5A9EEE5.title: "Solitary Druid Treaty"
	quest.233B0326CCA639C7.quest_desc: [
		"&6Duration Doubling Rune&r"
		""
		"&7Duration Doubling Rune inhibits the process by which form decomposes substances, thereby extending duration of &apositive effects&r&7 within form.&r"
	]
	quest.233B0326CCA639C7.quest_subtitle: "Stagnating Evolving Things"
	quest.235321663034A6FB.quest_desc: [
		"# &8Teleportation Modification Instructions"
		""
		"### &cDisabling Teleportation Modification Guide"
		"&8If you really, really dislike this setting:"
		"&7- Go to modpack root directory "
		"&7- Find folder &8<Reverie Foundry>"
		"&7- Enter path &7kubejs\\server_scripts\\System\\command\\command_ban.js"
		"&7- Modify &ccommand_ban.js &7file to restore vanilla teleportation"
		""
		"### &eAlternative Teleportation Solutions"
		"&7- Use &a/tpa &7command for player-to-player teleportation"
		"&7- Other available teleportation commands:"
		" &8▪ &b/home &8- Teleport to home"
		" &8▪ &b/spawn &8- Teleport to spawn point"
		""
		"### &3Notes"
		"&7- Back up files before modification"
		"&7- /reload required after deletion to take effect"
		"&7- Only host modifications are effective"
	]
	quest.235321663034A6FB.quest_subtitle: "Encouraging players to use waystones instead of map right-click teleportation"
	quest.2358AB144E490565.quest_subtitle: "Familiar Summoning Ritual"
	quest.23B6D00570354BE3.quest_desc: [
		"&6Boiler&r"
		""
		"&7An advanced power generation structure that produces stress by heating water to generate steam. It yields massive amounts of stress and is a core power source widely used in mid-to-late game.&r  "
		"&7Stress Output: &c2048~294912 su&7  "
		"&7Speed Range: &c16~64 RPM&7  "
		""
		"&6Construction Method&r  "
		"&7Place a &eSteam Engine&7 or &eSteam Whistle&7 on any sized &eFluid Tank&7 structure. The tank will transform into a Boiler.&r  "
		""
		"&6Operating Conditions&r  "
		"&7The Boiler requires a continuous water supply and a heat source placed beneath it to operate.&r  "
		"&7Its efficiency is influenced by three properties: **Size**, **Water Level**, and **Heat**, each with 18 levels. Wear &eEngineer's Goggles&7 and look at the boiler to view specific properties.&r  "
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7Property      Calculation Method&r  "
		"&7📏Size       Depends on boiler volume (m³). Size Level = Total Volume / 4&r  "
		"&7💧Water Level Depends on water supply rate. One Kinetic Pump provides 1 mB/tick flow per 2 RPM. Water Level = Supply Rate (mB/tick) / 10, or Water Level = Kinetic Pump RPM / 20&r  "
		"&7🔥Heat        Depends on the total heat provided by all heat sources at its base. Details below.&r  "
		"&7The Boiler does not store water; the Water Level is calculated solely based on the intake rate. Water disappears upon entry. If the tank contained fluid before transforming into a boiler, it will be cleared upon transformation.&r  "
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Heat Source Types&r  "
		"&7Heat sources that can heat a Boiler include:&r  "
		"&7Heat Source Type  Source                                 Provided Heat&r  "
		"&7Passive Source    Blaze Burner (Off/Empty), Campfire, Fire, Magma Block, Lava, Stove (Farmer's Delight), etc. 0&r  "
		"&7Level 1 Source    Blaze Burner (Normal Burning)          1&r  "
		"&7Level 2 Source    Blaze Burner (Superheated Burning)     2&r  "
		"&7Passive sources can only put the boiler into a &cPassive State&7. In this state, the boiler outputs a fixed &c2048 su&7 stress; adding more passive sources does not increase efficiency. When higher-level sources are present, passive sources do not take effect.&r  "
		"&7The Boiler is heated only by sources directly beneath its bottom face.&r  "
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Power Output&r  "
		"&7The final level of the Boiler is determined by the **lowest value** among the Size, Water Level, and Heat properties.&r  "
		"&7Install &eSteam Engines&7 on the boiler and place an &eEncased Cogwheel&7 directly in front of the engine (second block). Stress will be output through the cogwheel.&r  "
		""
		"&6Stress Calculation&r  "
		"&7Except in the passive state, the stress output by a boiler is &cBoiler Level × 16384 su&7. Stress is evenly distributed to each Steam Engine.&r  "
		"&7A single Steam Engine can output a maximum of &c16384 su&7 stress. If total stress exceeds this, install multiple Steam Engines to avoid waste.&r  "
		"&7Installing a number of engines equal to the boiler level outputs all stress; exceeding this number does not improve efficiency.&r  "
		""
		"&6Speed Output&r  "
		"&7The speed (RPM) output by Steam Engines is determined by the boiler's operational state and the ratio between the number of engines and the boiler level, ranging from &c16 RPM to 64 RPM&7.&r  "
		""
		"&8This page of paper appears slightly curled, as if steamed.&r"
	]
	quest.24525BF493E3277C.quest_desc: ["Can import items to it, or export items from it; superior replacement for input terminals and output methods"]
	quest.24525BF493E3277C.quest_subtitle: "Import or Export Items/Fluids to/from RS Network"
	quest.24A6B77DD8DEA131.quest_desc: [
		"&7Scrolls, as single-use consumables, incur significant material waste and are economically inefficient."
		""
		"Fortunately, after repeated attempts, I found a way to preserve the spell formulas from scrolls. While not as readily available as scrolls, this greatly reduces the long-term cost of study and practice."
	]
	quest.24C387A38C376961.quest_subtitle: "You didn't get this quest's reward by farming deaths, did you? Surely not?"
	quest.24F8461D0711F786.quest_desc: [
		"&6Aberrant Stamina Rune&r"
		""
		"&7Aberrant Stamina Rune grants wearer hysterical speed; they will forever be able to move rapidly, even sprinting when &chunger value&r&7 too low to normally sprint.&r"
	]
	quest.24F8461D0711F786.quest_subtitle: "Escape Pursuing Things"
	quest.257E95B5ED03904D.quest_subtitle: "Better than Hoe"
	quest.25C5815C5583AA74.quest_desc: [
		"&bSanity Value Range [ -45 ~ 45 ]"
		""
		"&9When sanity falls below -45, if continuing to receive sanity damage, will accumulate Desolation Value."
		""
		"&9When sanity recovers, Desolation Value is offset first; sanity only increases after Desolation Value is cleared."
		""
		"&9When taking damage, Desolation Value provides additional vulnerability multiplier (up to 5x), decreasing Desolation Value by 5% after each injury."
		""
		"&bDeath clears all Desolation Value and resets sanity to zero."
		""
		"&6Sanity affects attack multiplier, floating between 0.8~1.2: higher sanity gives higher multiplier, and vice versa."
	]
	quest.25C5815C5583AA74.quest_subtitle: "Stay Sane?"
	quest.25C5815C5583AA74.title: "Sanity Value"
	quest.25CE20F4B934CF78.quest_subtitle: "Stage 0"
	quest.26FC3272EF9F44E8.quest_desc: [
		"&6Crystallized Berry&r"
		"&7Obtained by &bSniffers&r&7. Can be fed to your familiar to obtain &eMemory Fragments&r&7.&r"
	]
	quest.27B6C00949F92CCF.quest_desc: [
		"&7I seem to have discovered something peculiar: a form of magic hitherto unrecorded. Cannot call oneself a mage if abandoning opportunity to study magic."
		""
		"&7This mysterious school manipulates energy seemingly rooted in &6souls&r&7. More precisely, soul's energy, the will and pulse constituting each of us."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7So far, I've only described basics. But I discovered a method to separate soul's pulse and condense into substance; I call these "
		"&6Soul"
		"Crystals"
		"&r"
		"&7"
		". This is cornerstone of my research."
		""
		"&7Nature of condensed soul influences crystal's properties. Each soul unique, formed crystals diverse. I believe this crystal is research breakthrough."
	]
	quest.27B6C00949F92CCF.quest_subtitle: "Soul Magic"
	quest.27E19E564DC0F89F.quest_subtitle: "Familiar Summoning Ritual"
	quest.28A651F6B7D52DF2.quest_desc: [
		"&6Evil Witch Treaty"
		"&7Feel &crage&r&7, also evoke &crage&r&7.&r&cEnemies can detect you from twice the distance"
		"&7Treaty specializing in blending &crage&r&7 with &cpain&r&7.&r&aFirst strike against enemies accompanies &cevil arcane&r&a barrage"
	]
	quest.28A651F6B7D52DF2.quest_subtitle: "Fight Unceasingly"
	quest.28A651F6B7D52DF2.title: "Evil Witch Treaty"
	quest.291925E282FCB75C.quest_subtitle: "Probably a Ring"
	quest.292EE3446E29D4BA.quest_desc: [
		"&6Fulfillment Treaty"
		"&7Fullness requires health.&r&cNear hunger, armor value and armor toughness halved"
		"&7Wholeness means fullness.&r&aNear full satiation, armor value and armor toughness increased by one-fifth"
	]
	quest.292EE3446E29D4BA.quest_subtitle: "Pursue Satisfaction"
	quest.292EE3446E29D4BA.title: "Fulfillment Treaty"
	quest.297A862AB87A213C.quest_desc: [
		"&7After inquiring with local residents, I learned that a large number of undead have gathered in one area—this is highly unusual."
		""
		"Such phenomena typically only occur during large-scale magical disturbances. It seems necessary to investigate."
	]
	quest.29833D624EE0F60A.quest_subtitle: "&cWill disable natural sanity recovery (will not disable affix effects)"
	quest.29833D624EE0F60A.title: "&c\"Madness Seeps from the Corners of the Eyes\""
	quest.2A0C75F0BB1001BC.quest_desc: [
		"&6Precision Mechanism&r"
		""
		"&7An advanced internal component that requires multiple precise processing steps to create, commonly used in the assembly of complex machinery such as &eMechanical Arms&7.&r"
	]
	quest.2AE510FA75964EA2.quest_subtitle: "Arcane Materials"
	quest.2B4635BB16624A15.quest_desc: [
		"&7Using &6Rune Wood's&r&7 natural magic as foundation, I designed an altar for spell research foundation—&5Soul Altar&r&7. It's other side of equation, the use of arcane energy. Infusing items with &dArcane Energy&r&7, then using this energy to influence other infusion processes, is research starting point."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7When using altar, place item to be infused upon it while inserting appropriate &dArcane Energy&r&7. If other items needed for infusion, must place them on certain &6Rune Wood Item Pedestals&r&7. Item pedestals must be within four blocks of altar to function properly."
		""
		"{image:kubejs:textures/gui/malum_kjs1.png width:150 height:100 align:center fit:true}"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7After all Arcane Energy in place, energy within &6Crystals&r&7 begins flowing into central item. Other items to fuse also drawn in during this process. Once all absorption complete, infusion product forms. However, this process indeed &cquite slow&r&7..."
	]
	quest.2B4635BB16624A15.quest_subtitle: "Miracle Creation"
	quest.2B4635BB16624A15.title: "Soul Infusion"
	quest.2B8DFC4AE68FE112.quest_desc: [
		"&7I should now know what happens when living beings enter well, at least consequences for intelligent living beings."
		"&7"
		"&7I was too careless in experiment, then stumbled over reagent flask on ground... directly fell into well's dark substance. That I can still write these obviously represents &asurvival&r&7... though I probably won't repeat such test."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7I was vomited out by substance now confirmed liquid, just like items I threw in. Later tested with monsters and calves; they &cdid not&r&7 rebound, just disappeared into well, no reason waste resources testing further. Besides, my attention now entirely on what returned with me."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7As if I shattered a soul; my soul was only one present at time. This thought somewhat frightening, but all my physiological data still within acceptable range. Also returned with an &8black&r&7 &dSoul Crystal&r&7, which I collected. Is this omen of ninth type of Arcane Energy? If true, what form of pulse does it represent? Further research needed."
	]
	quest.2B8DFC4AE68FE112.quest_subtitle: "Mistake or Blessing?"
	quest.2B8DFC4AE68FE112.title: "Pitch Black Crystal"
	quest.2BA0CB58302C7BD4.quest_desc: [
		"&6Tidal Affinity Treaty"
		"&7Ocean's chains tightly bind your heart.&r&cCannot receive healing when separated from water"
		"&7Imprison oneself within ocean, remember tide's chanting call.&r&aWhen underwater, increases movement speed, attack speed, digging speed, damage resistance&r&aTide energy enhances above effects while granting constant life regen"
	]
	quest.2BA0CB58302C7BD4.quest_subtitle: "Merge with Sea"
	quest.2BA0CB58302C7BD4.title: "Tidal Affinity Treaty"
	quest.2BC4F19D1B343BF2.quest_desc: [
		"&7&mHow can someone's sanity solution expire when stored in a warehouse (annoyed)&r&r"
		""
		"Sold by cleric profession villagers, appearing in level 1, 3, and 5 trade options respectively as they level up."
	]
	quest.2BC4F19D1B343BF2.quest_subtitle: "Does Not Expire"
	quest.2C2C118EAFE0B1B7.quest_desc: [
		"&6Soul-Seeking Ash Bell&r"
		"&7Obtained via crafting, used to summon the boss &6Echo of Tyros - Primordial Firebearer&r&7.&r"
		"&7Hold and right-click to use; upon use, it will produce sound, special particles, and attempt to summon the Firebearer.&r"
		"&7If a &cBlazing Soul Rune&r&7 is nearby, the Soul-Seeking Ash Bell will be consumed, and the Firebearer will be summoned; if no Blazing Soul Rune is nearby, it will not be consumed, and a message '&cNo response received&r&7' will appear.&r"
		"&7After each use, as long as it is not consumed, there is a 3-second cooldown.&r"
	]
	quest.2C2C118EAFE0B1B7.quest_subtitle: "Ding Ding Ding"
	quest.2C5C9488AA4912AD.quest_subtitle: "For Casting Wires"
	quest.2CA02120B210EB2D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Blaze Burner&r"
		""
		"&6Acquisition&r"
		"&7Obtained by right-clicking a &cBlaze&r&7 or &cBlaze Spawner&r&7 with an empty Blaze Burner.&r"
		""
		"&6Usage/How to Use&r"
		""
		"&6Burning States&r"
		"&7The Blaze Burner requires fuel to operate. Players can feed it by right-clicking with fuel in hand.&r"
		"&7Feeding it ordinary fuel puts it into a Normal Burning state. The burn duration depends on the fuel's burn time in a vanilla &eFurnace&r&7. After normal burning ends, it enters the &cOff&r&7 state.&r"
		"&7Feeding it &6Blaze Cake&r&7 puts it into a Superheated Burning state. The blaze inside turns blue. One Blaze Cake maintains superheated burning for &c160 seconds&r&7. After superheated burning ends, it enters a 250-second Normal Burning state, then turns off.&r"
		"&7Using a &6Creative Mode Blaze Cake&r&7 on it toggles between burning modes and permanently maintains the current state.&r"
		"&7Throwing an &eEgg&r&7 at it puts it into a Normal Burning state for 4 seconds, with a chewing sound effect.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7The default maximum burn time for a Blaze Burner is &c500 seconds&r&7.&r"
		"&7However, when a single item's burn time exceeds the 500-second cap *and* the Blaze Burner is &cOff&r&7, that item's burn time will be applied instead of the 500-second maximum. For example: A Block of Coal provides 800 seconds of burn time.&r"
		"&7If the Blaze Burner is already burning, feeding it more ordinary fuel will not extend the burn time beyond the 500-second cap. For example: If the burner already has 200 seconds of burn time left, feeding it a Block of Coal will result in 500 seconds total, not 800.&r"
		""
		"&7The Blaze Burner can be fed by a &eMechanical Arm&r&7 or &eMechanical Piston&r&7. Both components automatically detect the burner's state and will not feed if fuel is sufficient.&r"
		"&7When using a Mechanical Arm to feed it, if the burner is in Superheated Burning and the arm has sufficient Blaze Cake input, it will not enter Normal Burning. The arm detects the burner's state and feeds before the superheated burn ends. Feel free to feed it.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Heating a Mixing Basin&r"
		"&7A Blaze Burner can provide heat to a Mixing Basin to complete recipes requiring higher heat levels: ‘&cMixing and Stirring&r&7’, ‘&cCompacting and Shaping&r&7’, or ‘&cAuto-Brewing&r&7’ recipes.&r"
		"&7Some Mixing Basin recipes require Normal Heating or Superheated Heating. Place the Blaze Burner below the basin and provide fuel to achieve the corresponding burning state. The burning state does not affect the execution of recipes requiring lower heat levels.&r"
		""
		"&6Heating a Boiler&r"
		"&7A Blaze Burner can be used to heat a Boiler.&r"
		"&7Normal Burning and Superheated Burning states provide &c1 point&r&7 and &c2 points&r&7 of heat, respectively. See Boiler for details.&r"
		""
		"&6As a Heating Medium for Blaze Heater&r"
		"&7The Blaze Burner modifies the air flow (wind) state of a &eBlaze Heater&r&7.&r"
		"&7When a Blaze Heater's air flow passes through a Blaze Burner, it changes to either &aBatch Smoking / Batch Blasting&r&7 air flow based on the burner's state.&r"
		"&7When the Blaze Burner is &cOff&r&7, the air flow operates in Batch Smoking mode.&r"
		"&7When the Blaze Burner is in Normal Burning or Superheated Burning, the air flow operates in Batch Blasting mode.&r"
		""
		"&6Redstone Comparator&r"
		"&7A Blaze Burner can be read by a Redstone Comparator and produce a redstone signal.&r"
		"&7When the burner is &cOff&r&7, the signal strength is 0.&r"
		"&7When in Normal Burning state, it produces up to 2 signal strength. If burn time is less than 5 seconds, signal strength is 1; if greater than 5 seconds, it's 2.&r"
		"&7When in Superheated Burning state, the signal strength is 3.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Driving Trains&r"
		"&7A Blaze Burner can drive a Train.&r"
		"&7To have a Blaze Burner drive a train, the player must fix it in front of the Train Controls on the train structure during assembly. After the train is assembled, right-click the Blaze Burner with a Train Schedule that has a route programmed. The blaze inside will then wear a hat and autonomously drive the train according to the schedule.&r"
		""
		"&6As a Storage Manager&r"
		"&7A Blaze Burner can act as a Storage Manager.&r"
		"&7When placed adjacent to a Schematicannon, the Blaze Burner becomes a Storage Manager and can be interacted with via right-click.&r"
	]
	quest.2D740B904DAEAB78.quest_desc: [
		"&6Familiar's Bed&r"
		"&7A familiar's bed is a block that familiars can use to &asleep&r&7 and &arecover health&r&7. A familiar will search for nearby beds when it needs healing.&r"
	]
	quest.2D740B904DAEAB78.quest_subtitle: "A Cozy Home"
	quest.2D7AB1B4FC01C3F8.quest_desc: [
		"&6Empathy Driver&r"
		""
		"&7Evil and holy are opposing forces; why not combine both? &eCauldron&r&7 equipped with Empathy Driver causes &8Evil Souls&r&7 to remember damage taken by &eCatalyst&r&7. After &eRepair Diffuser&r&7 performs repair, &bHoly Souls&r&7 will 'forgive' this damage, further repairing catalyst, enhancing all attributes for subsequent three &6Focus Cycles&r&7.&r"
	]
	quest.2D7AB1B4FC01C3F8.quest_subtitle: "Accept Hatred"
	quest.2DD51904F4629516.quest_desc: ["Need to start from black..."]
	quest.2DD51904F4629516.quest_subtitle: "Forge Foundation Stone"
	quest.2DE251239B528464.quest_desc: [
		"&6Arcane Cluster Crafting"
		"&7&dSoul Crystals&r&7 emit strange mysterious glow; enhancing this radiance? &6Lantern Tongs&r&7 well suited; hold tongs in one hand, Soul Crystal in other to create "
		"&eArcane"
		"Cluster"
		"&r"
		"&7"
		"."
		"&7"
		"&7These Arcane Clusters are pure arcane energy condensates, with small protective magic layer preventing overflow. Nearly useless in magic but very beautiful as lamp."
	]
	quest.2DE251239B528464.quest_subtitle: "Decorative Craft"
	quest.2F38AC908EC156D9.quest_desc: [
		"&6Destroying Preservation Contempt Oath&r"
		""
		"&7Oath coexists with malice protection, its power also weakened thereby.&r"
		"&7-Reduces &cmalice protection&r&7 capacity&r"
		""
		"&7Corrosive patterns engraved into malice soul-retention.&r"
		"&7-&6Malice Critical&r&7 triggers &esuccessive strikes&r&7 against target&r"
		"&7-&6Malice Conversion&r&7 increases number and power of accompanying &estrikes&r&7&r"
	]
	quest.2F38AC908EC156D9.quest_subtitle: "Dominate All Things"
	quest.2F38AC908EC156D9.title: "Destroying Preservation Contempt Oath"
	quest.2F9F57C42D9ECB48.quest_subtitle: "Arcane Materials"
	quest.2FE49A9C24350211.quest_subtitle: "Big Fork"
	quest.309D32324902DF18.quest_subtitle: "Food Value > 8"
	quest.309D32324902DF18.title: "Meal Recycling x10"
	quest.31259F6B81819141.quest_subtitle: "Can deal greater damage to enemies"
	quest.313E8F6035C2E842.quest_desc: [
		"&7Rune Tree is peculiar combination of magic and nature, quite common. Quite &6beautiful&r&7, but I value its &apracticality&r&7 more. Rune Tree saturated with &bmagic&r&7, thus can serve as &darcane&r&7 foundational material."
		""
		"&7This tree mainly appears in broad &2plains&r&7, also found in &2forests&r&7. Most notable feature is its &6leaves&r&7, whose color is bright &6orange-yellow&r&7."
	]
	quest.313E8F6035C2E842.quest_subtitle: "Magical Material"
	quest.314084A1E2474F20.quest_desc: [
		"&6Alchemical Cauldron&r"
		""
		"&7The alchemical cauldron has a light level of 3.&r"
		""
		"&6Primary Functions&r"
		"&7Brewing the liquid form of &bbottled materials&r&7&r"
		"&7Crafting &bspecific materials&r&7&r"
		"&7Brewing &evanilla potions&r&7&r"
		"&7Reverting &espell scrolls&r&7 into ink&r"
		"&7Enhancing &eink quality&r&7&r"
		"&7Brewing mod-exclusive &6elixirs&r&7&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7Note: Does not possess most vanilla cauldron properties (such as interacting with dripstone, filling with rain, washing dyed leather armor, etc.).&r"
		""
		"&6Interaction System&r"
		""
		"&6Storage Spaces&r"
		"&7The alchemical cauldron contains three storage spaces:&r"
		"&7&eWater Level&r&7: Four water levels, corresponding to different liquid heights in the cauldron&r"
		"&7&eMaterial Slots&r&7: Four material slots for placing various materials&r"
		"&7&ePotion Slots&r&7: Four potion slots for storing liquid products&r"
		""
		"&6Capacity Details&r"
		"&7Each water level stores one bottle of water (250mB); full water level stores one bucket of water (1B)&r"
		"&7Each potion slot can store one bottle of &eink&r&7, &epotion&r&7, &6elixir&r&7, or other special liquids&r"
		"&7Each material slot can store one material; materials will float or sink in the cauldron&r"
		""
		"&6Basic Operations&r"
		""
		"&6Placing Items&r"
		"&7Use a water bucket to raise the water level to four; one water bottle raises it by one level&r"
		"&7Using potions, elixirs, or special liquids occupies one potion slot&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7Placing materials includes:&r"
		"&7Vanilla &ebrewing ingredients&r&7"
		"&7&eInk upgrade&r&7 materials (copper ingot, iron ingot, gold ingot, amethyst shard, etc.)&r"
		"&7Mod &6elixir&r&7 materials (dragon's breath, ender pearl, amethyst cluster, contrition stone, etc.)&r"
		""
		"&6Collecting Items&r"
		"&7Right-click empty-handed: Take one item from a material slot&r"
		"&7Right-click with an empty bottle: Collect from a potion slot first; if potion slots are empty, collect a water bottle&r"
		"&7Automation support: Can be fed via hopper; observers detect state changes; dispensers automatically collect products&r"
	]
	quest.321B703A9E877386.quest_subtitle: "&eSome affixes will be invalidated, but new extreme affixes added (WIP)"
	quest.321B703A9E877386.title: "&e\"Listen Quietly to the Blasphemous Whispers from the Abyss\" (WIP)"
	quest.3280E06AA7147B28.quest_subtitle: "Can only be worn on arm"
	quest.330C44884F7FF5A2.quest_desc: ["Used as the forge's terminal; automation can be achieved by inputting items through hoppers, etc."]
	quest.330C44884F7FF5A2.quest_subtitle: "Smelting Metals"
	quest.330C44884F7FF5A2.title: "Smelting Controller"
	quest.332CE7AF2598E3F1.quest_subtitle: "&4Audience"
	quest.3368D9266C268467.quest_subtitle: "Familiar Summoning Ritual"
	quest.337B0F8208EA7383.quest_desc: [
		"&6Place Ink&r"
		"&7The quality of the ink determines the quality of the scroll.&r"
		""
		"&6Place Paper&r"
		"&7Writing a scroll consumes one piece of paper.&r"
		""
		"&6Place School Material&r"
		"&7&eSchool Materials&r&7 determine the spell school.&r"
		"&7After placing an &eSchool Material&r&7, available spells will be displayed. Some spells may appear as question marks; try using higher-quality ink to write them.&r"
		"&7The completed scroll will appear here. Note that only left-clicking to take it will consume the raw materials.&r"
	]
	quest.339C3EB0CB099097.quest_desc: [
		"&7So far, every &6Talisman&r&7 I've created has seen practical use. Naturally accompanied by side effects, forcing me to spend much time selecting suitable talismans. However, surely these talismans can isolate certain effects individually."
		"&7"
		"&7&6Rune Craft&r&7 begins here, specifically using &dBrooches&r&7 and &eRunes&r&7. Brooch exists only as base core; worn close to heart, symbolizing inherent pain cost in rune power."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7Rune Craft starts with inscribing &eRunes&r&7, operation requiring &bRune Workbench&r&7; should first create one. Simplest entry brooch is &dRune Brooch&r&7, can use it to wear runes I create."
	]
	quest.339C3EB0CB099097.quest_subtitle: "Heart-Piercing Needle"
	quest.339C3EB0CB099097.title: "Rune Craft"
	quest.3462310EEE3AC2DF.quest_desc: ["Will attempt to import items from container"]
	quest.3462310EEE3AC2DF.quest_subtitle: "Import Items/Fluids to RS Network"
	quest.34AFC6414A805C2D.quest_desc: ["Recovery methods: Eat Golden Apple, Enchanted Golden Apple, GoodApple"]
	quest.34AFC6414A805C2D.quest_subtitle: "&cYou lose maximum health with each death"
	quest.34AFC6414A805C2D.title: "&c\"Death is the Process of Abandoning Self\""
	quest.34D5717A03B609A1.quest_desc: [
		"&6Spell Proficiency Rune&r"
		""
		"&7Spell Proficiency Rune reflects imitated arcane energy, allowing me to charge &ewands&r&7 at double speed.&r"
	]
	quest.34D5717A03B609A1.quest_subtitle: "Create Destructive Things"
	quest.350A83A36269F87B.quest_desc: [
		"&7Finally, I created experimental substrate called "
		"&6Alchemical"
		"Mineral"
		"Dust"
		"&r"
		"&7"
		". Its texture under normal conditions resembles solid animal fat, but applying slight force reveals strong &aplasticity&r&7. This must be useful &6material&r&7."
	]
	quest.350A83A36269F87B.quest_subtitle: "Clay Number Two"
	quest.3531099CA2E8832A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Fishing Tide Rune&r"
		""
		"&7Fishing Tide Rune's ability similar to namesake ritual, grants wearer &bFishing Tide&r&7 effect at half potency, providing bonus equivalent to additional level of &eLure enchantment&r&7.&r"
	]
	quest.3531099CA2E8832A.quest_subtitle: "Bless Pulse"
	quest.35560F1953AD1C76.quest_subtitle: "Familiar Summoning Ritual"
	quest.35957B7E0ACF4060.quest_desc: [
		"&6Super Glue&r"
		""
		"&6Usage&r"
		"&7This sticky medium binds multiple blocks into a single entity, allowing dynamic structure components to recognize and assemble them as a unified &eContraption&7.&r"
		""
		"&6Binding Blocks&r"
		"&7Right-click a block to set the start point, then right-click a second block. All blocks within the rectangular space defined by the two points will be bound, and a 'Super Glue' entity will appear as a marker.&r"
		"&7There must be a continuous connection of solid blocks between the two selected points; otherwise, the highlight frame turns yellow, and binding cannot complete.&r"
		"&7Hold Super Glue and point at a block, then press Ctrl to highlight in blue all blocks already bound to that block.&r"
		"&7If Super Glue is in the off-hand, blocks placed from the main hand will automatically bind to the block you right-click.&r"
		"&7When printing a schematic containing Super Glue with a Schematicannon, ensure a chest contains Super Glue with sufficient durability beforehand; the cannon will automatically complete the binding.&r"
		""
		"&6Unbinding&r"
		"&7Hold Super Glue and left-click any block within a bound rectangle to delete that glue frame and unbind all associated blocks.&r"
		""
		"&8The edge of the manuscript has a small dried glue stain, with a scrawl beside it: Easy to stick together, not hard to take apart—just remember not to stick it to your own hand.&r"
	]
	quest.35957B7E0ACF4060.quest_subtitle: "Now Start Applying Glue"
	quest.359B24E94B66AFA3.quest_subtitle: "Stage 3"
	quest.35AEBBC251933E78.quest_subtitle: "Stage 2"
	quest.35FFD854DFF94776.quest_desc: [
		"&7To overcome limitations of wireless terminals losing connection over excessive distance..."
		""
		"Setting up Wireless Access Points to expand signal coverage range, constructing base station-like architecture, might be more feasible solution."
	]
	quest.35FFD854DFF94776.quest_subtitle: "WiFi"
	quest.360AE4AB3B482FAC.quest_desc: [
		"&nCrime and Reputation System&r"
		""
		"&6Core Mechanics"
		"&b1. &3Crime Levels&r"
		"Crimes are divided into three levels, affecting player-villager relations:"
		""
		"&aLight Crime&r: Slightly reduces reputation."
		""
		"&eMedium Crime&r: Significantly reduces reputation, &cIron Golems or Guards&r will attack player."
		""
		"&cHeavy Crime&r: Reputation drops to minimum, &4Iron Golems immediately attack player&r."
		""
		"&b2. &3Trigger Conditions&r"
		"Player must commit act within &9protected structure&r (default only villages)."
		"Villager or guard must &6witness&r crime (detection distance affected by player invisibility, sneaking, light)."
		"&7Villagers have limited "
		"intelligence"
		"; even if player placed block, breaking it is still considered theft."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&6List of Criminal Acts"
		"&b1. &3Block Destruction&r"
		"&aLight Crime&r: Destroying crops, hay bales, lanterns, campfires, etc."
		"&eMedium Crime&r: Destroying chests, barrels, workstations (like cartography table), beds."
		"&cHeavy Crime&r: Destroying bell."
		"&b2. &3Block Interaction&r"
		"&eMedium Crime&r: Opening chest or barrel (considered attempted theft)."
		"&b3. &3Killing Creatures&r"
		"&eMedium Crime&r: Killing passive animals (pigs, cows, chickens, etc.) or villager pets (cats, horses, etc.)."
		"&b4. &3Bed Related&r"
		"&aLight Crime&r: Evicting villager from bed."
		"&eMedium Crime&r: Occupying bed already claimed by villager."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&6Witnessing and Detection&r"
		"&bWitness Range&r"
		"Detection distance affected by:"
		""
		"&7Sneaking&r reduces detection probability."
		"&5Low light or invisibility potion&r can hide crimes."
		"&bWitness Reactions&r"
		"&cIron Golems and Guards&r attack players committing &eMedium&r or &cHeavy&r crimes (if witnessed)."
		"&aLight Crime&r only reduces reputation, does not trigger attacks."
		"&bOf course, you can also massacre in places where other villagers can't see"
	]
	quest.360AE4AB3B482FAC.quest_subtitle: "Reputation Value"
	quest.3611F55056F7105F.quest_desc: [
		"&#00AA00Gluttony - Corrosion&r&7"
		"&7When carrying the \"Gluttony\" effect, it is considered as applying &#00AA00Gluttony Nutrition&r&7 stacks.&r"
		"&#00FFAA[After consuming food]&r&7 Gain &#00AA00Gluttony Nutrition&r&7 stacks equal to the nutritional value of that food.&r"
		"&#00FFAA[Every 1.5 seconds]&r&7 &#00AA00Gluttony Nutrition&r&7 stacks decrease by 1 (minimum -20 stacks).&r"
		"&7"
		"&#00FFAA[Gluttony Nutrition > 40]&r&7 Grants yourself &#FFAA00Gluttony&r&7 (level equal to (Gluttony Nutrition - 50) / 2, lasting 2 seconds), &#FFAA00Regeneration I&r&7 (lasting 2 seconds), and &#FFAA00Mana Gluttony V&r&7 (lasting 4 seconds).&r"
		"&#00FFAA[Gluttony Nutrition > 30]&r&7 Grants yourself &#FFAA00Regeneration I&r&7 (lasting 2 seconds) and &#FFAA00Gluttony IV&r&7 (lasting 4 seconds).&r"
		"&#00FFAA[Gluttony Nutrition > 20]&r&7 Grants yourself &#FFAA00Regeneration I&r&7 (lasting 2 seconds) and &#FFAA00Mana Gluttony III&r&7 (lasting 4 seconds).&r"
		"&#00FFAA[Gluttony Nutrition > 10]&r&7 Grants yourself &#FFAA00Mana Gluttony II&r&7 (lasting 2 seconds).&r"
		"&#00FFAA[Gluttony Nutrition > 0]&r&7 Grants yourself &#FFAA00Mana Gluttony I&r&7 (lasting 2 seconds).&r"
		"&#00FFAA[Gluttony Nutrition > -10]&r&7 Grants yourself &#FF5555Weakness III&r&7 (lasting 2 seconds).&r"
		"&#00FFAA[Gluttony Nutrition ≥ -20]&r&7 Grants yourself &#FF5555Weakness 255&r&7 (lasting 2 seconds).&r"
		"&7"
		"&#00FFAA[When attacking]&r&7 If you have the &#FFAA00Gluttony&r&7 effect, increase the final damage of this attack by (1 + 0.5 × Gluttony level) times.&r"
		"&7"
		"&#00FFAA[After consuming food]&r&7 If you are in a \"Gluttony\" state, that food gains a &#FF00005-minute cooldown&r&7.&r"
	]
	quest.3611F55056F7105F.title: "Gluttony Corrosion"
	quest.364547BCDEFB8DDE.quest_desc: [
		"&6Portable Storage Interface&r"
		""
		"&7When a structure begins to rotate or slide, those golden interfaces fixed to the &eContraption&r&7 seem to awaken. As soon as they detect another similar 'face' within the correct distance and alignment, they pour out all items from their own container, following an invisible covenant of direction.&r"
		""
		"&6Making It Work&r"
		"&7This requires careful arrangement: The two interfaces must be &cfacing each other&r&7, spaced &cexactly 1 to 2 blocks&r&7 apart. Moreover, at least one of them must belong to a &eContraption&r&7—it is motion that gives meaning to this exchange.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7Do not be troubled by occasional slight misalignment during docking; the covenant of transfer remains valid.&r"
		""
		"&6Finer Control&r"
		"&7With an &eItem Detector&r&7 or &eStockpile Switch&r&7, you can know the contents of a dynamic container. A simple redstone signal can &alock&r&7 the interface in its block form, making it ignore passing peers—though outwardly, no change is visible.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7Finally, remember the principle of elegance: &cExcessive speed or rotation&r&7 can make this handshake hasty and fail. If the receiver is stationary, be sure to equip it with a &eHopper&r&7 or &eChute&r&7—it needs a 'hand' to catch the flowing gift.&r"
		""
		"&8This part of the manuscript has a rough sketch of two docked interfaces, annotated: They hate jolts but love to dance.&r"
	]
	quest.364547BCDEFB8DDE.quest_subtitle: "An interface used to exchange items, allowing containers on contraptions to interact with the outside world."
	quest.36713AC6F99D301E.quest_desc: [
		"&7Sometimes, substances also infused with &6soul's energy&r&7, though substance itself lacks soul."
		""
		"&7This is precisely foundation of &6Soul Magic&r&7—attaching souls to soulless things. &6Soul Stone&r&7 is mineral whose arcane properties surpass physical properties; refined has many uses in my studied magic. Strongly radiates &dmagical energy&r&7."
	]
	quest.36713AC6F99D301E.quest_subtitle: "Alien Phase"
	quest.36DC8D2564CAC70C.quest_desc: [
		"&7Deepslate Orichalcum is strange yet very useful metal. Physical appearance identical to &6gold&r&7, but properties &cgreatly differ&r&7."
		""
		"This ore can be found in underground &8deepslate layers&r&7, buried within veins full of &6gold ore&r&7."
	]
	quest.36DC8D2564CAC70C.quest_subtitle: "Fuse with Arcane Energy"
	quest.37AB4AF2D44BDEB1.quest_desc: [
		"&5I discovered a... structure&r&7. Its implications deeper than almost anything previously found; its existence proves someone already stepped into arcane research."
		""
		"&7I call this well "
		"&5Crying"
		"Well"
		"&r"
		"&7"
		", reason being it constantly emits &5sad aura&r&7, inside contains small pool of... &5substance&r&7."
		""
		"&7Cannot quite determine what substance, though doesn't look like liquid, certainly not solid physically either."
	]
	quest.37AB4AF2D44BDEB1.quest_subtitle: "&zImpulse to jump in"
	quest.37B8C9432DCC6DAD.quest_desc: ["&7Common sense says Nether-like places must have combustible materials; &cBlazing Quartz&r&7 is such substance. Similar to &8coal&r&7, even can make &etorches&r&7. Though relatively &7ordinary&r, its uses not few."]
	quest.37B8C9432DCC6DAD.quest_subtitle: "Ignite"
	quest.3801B9633700F23D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Fate Reconstruction Treaty&r"
		""
		"&7Burning stars make you wither.&r"
		"&7-&cFate Reconstruction&r&7 cooldown extremely long&r"
		"&7-During cooldown &cArcane Resonance&r&7 halved&r"
		"&7-Harvesting souls consumes &chunger value&r"
		""
		"&7Unbound might brought by Death itself.&r"
		"&7-&6Fate Reconstruction&r&7 can avoid death&r"
		"&7-&6Fate Reconstruction&r&7 accompanies brief &ainvulnerability&r&7, quickly triggering effects of &bHarvesting Souls&r&7&r"
	]
	quest.3801B9633700F23D.quest_subtitle: "Deceive Fate"
	quest.3801B9633700F23D.title: "Fate Reconstruction Treaty"
	quest.38092862F38315D2.quest_subtitle: "A utility tool for finding Ancient Cities."
	quest.3834AAC7BBB3BDAF.quest_desc: [
		"&6Vitality Rune&r"
		""
		"&7Vitality Rune urges form to heal itself, increasing &aall healing&r&7 received by wearer by about one-fifth.&r"
	]
	quest.3834AAC7BBB3BDAF.quest_subtitle: "Pulse Promoting Repair"
	quest.383E39098BBDE054.quest_subtitle: "Arcane Materials"
	quest.388B4D246EC83BC4.quest_desc: [
		"&6Life-Weaver Treaty"
		"&7All creatures deserve &acare&r&7.&r&cHealing aura impartial, not distinguishing friend from foe"
		"&7Rarely seen such &agenerosity&r&7: you share skin, will with others.&r&aConstant life regeneration&r&aHealing shared with nearby creatures"
	]
	quest.388B4D246EC83BC4.quest_subtitle: "Distribute All Things"
	quest.388B4D246EC83BC4.title: "Life-Weaver Treaty"
	quest.3890E1D60D9F389F.quest_desc: [
		"&6Defense Rune&r"
		""
		"&7Defense Rune urges form to hold firm, increasing wearer's &aarmor value&r&7 by about one-fifth.&r"
	]
	quest.3890E1D60D9F389F.quest_subtitle: "Pulse Promoting Steadfastness"
	quest.39980DF0631D9B6C.quest_desc: [
		"&6Rotting Ascetic Treaty&r"
		""
		"&7Your loyalty to corruption devastates your form.&r"
		"&7-&cSaturation and hunger value&r&7 cannot restore health&r"
		"&7-Oath only permits consuming &8rotten food&r&7; consuming food it forbids receives &cdamage&r"
		""
		"&7Rot becomes your best friend.&r"
		"&7-&6Gluttony&r&7 becomes &6Faith Test&r"
		"&7-&6Faith Test&r&7 increases received &ahealing&r&7, generating &blocusts&r&7 when healed&r"
		"&7-&6Faith Test&r&7 duration significantly longer&r"
		"&7-Consuming &8rotten food&r&7 restores health&r"
	]
	quest.39980DF0631D9B6C.quest_subtitle: "Seek Beauty in Dregs"
	quest.39980DF0631D9B6C.title: "Rotting Ascetic Treaty"
	quest.39AB32E04D04B64F.quest_subtitle: "Stage 1"
	quest.39F72CD10646574F.quest_desc: ["Finding specific enchantments among hundreds is like finding a needle in a haystack. Type-limited enchantment books significantly improve this—these books only have affinity for specific enchantment categories, making them excellent for obtaining target enchantments."]
	quest.39F72CD10646574F.quest_subtitle: "Practical Enchantments"
	quest.3A5D807E30DF3E8C.quest_desc: [
		"&7Regardless of profession, goals pursued, &credstone&r&7 essential aid."
		"&7Building &cpiston doors&r&7 not exclusive to engineers. Now I too contribute to redstone development: &5Soul Diode&r&7."
		"&7Engraving pulse of &eElemental Souls&r&7 into &6copper substrate&r&7 treated with &bSpiritfire&r&7 creates four interesting &credstone devices&r&7."
		""
		"&7These diodes convert redstone signal into &darcane inclination&r&7, allowing &eSouls&r&7 to shape outcome based on nature, then convert back to redstone signal."
		"&7&bSpiritfire&r&7 is transmission medium, &6copper&r&7 is conceptual anchor for &7machine&r&7 and &7logic&r&7."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Signal Delay Buffer"
		"&7Azure Water Soul seeks change, seeks adaptation."
		"&7If input signal, buffer transmits but with some "
		"&bsticky"
		"&r"
		"&7"
		" effect: continues emitting signal for a while after input removed."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Signal Interrupter"
		"&7Infernal Fire Soul seeks burning, seeks glory."
		"&7If input signal, interrupter transmits but with some "
		"&cslowness"
		"&r"
		"&7"
		" effect: diode holds signal, "
		"examines"
		" carefully, releases after some time."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Signal Charge Sustainer"
		"&7Ethereal Air Soul seeks soaring, seeks flying."
		"&7If input signal, sustainer transmits but requires "
		"&ewarm-up"
		"&r"
		"&7"
		" beforehand: output signal strength slowly increases to input signal."
		"&7If input removed, or weaker signal input, sustainer gradually decreases output signal similarly."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Signal Generator"
		"&7Earthen Earth Soul seeks steadfastness, seeks stability."
		"&7Regardless of input signal, generator similar to clock generator, regularly inverts input signal at steady rhythm, otherwise directly outputs."
	]
	quest.3A5D807E30DF3E8C.quest_subtitle: "Signal Modulation"
	quest.3A5D807E30DF3E8C.title: "Signal Crafting"
	quest.3A5DD56949CF4827.quest_desc: [
		""
		"{image:kubejs:textures/gui/key_reload.png width:150 height:40 align:center}"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Of course, due to some mod reasons, please set the <Key Combo> key group to B key yourself"
	]
	quest.3A5DD56949CF4827.quest_subtitle: "Modpack default key bindings are already configured. You just need to find Key Bindings and click (Reset All Keys)"
	quest.3BD86FD3D62946C6.quest_subtitle: "Better Bookshelves"
	quest.3BD86FD3D62946C6.title: "Advanced Bookshelf"
	quest.3C4F9B874C336EB6.quest_desc: [
		"# &cBUG Reporting Channels &r"
		""
		"### &eReporting Methods &r"
		"&6➤ &fOfficial group chat reporting"
		"&6➤ &fGitHub Issue submission"
		""
		"&6Cod will handle it as soon as possible if seen!!!"
		""
		"### &9Official Links &r"
		"&6▪ &bGitHub Issues: "
		"&fhttps://github.com/DrowningFish233/Reverie-Foundry/issues"
		"&6▪ &bMC百科 Page: "
		"&fhttps://www.mcmod.cn/modpack/907.html"
		""
		"### &3Notes &r"
		"&7- When reporting, please provide:"
		" &8• &fDetailed reproduction steps"
		" &8• &fRelevant screenshots/logs"
		" &8• &fModpack version information"
	]
	quest.3C4F9B874C336EB6.quest_subtitle: "Patch it up!"
	quest.3CCFC8763640AC83.quest_desc: [
		"&6Mechanical Arm&r"
		""
		"&6Moving Items&r"
		"&7The Mechanical Arm is the most flexible logistics method within the Create mod, capable of moving items between any two points within its working range.&r"
		"&7The Mechanical Arm requires gear-driven power. Faster speed increases its work rate. Its working range is approximately a sphere with a radius of &c5&r&7 blocks (3D space).&r"
		"&7The Mechanical Arm can move up to one stack of items at a time.&r"
		""
		"&6Placement&r"
		"&7Using the Mechanical Arm requires setting input and output targets. It will pick up items from inputs and place them at outputs. Method:&r"
		"&7Hold the Mechanical Arm, right-click the desired position. The first right-click sets it as an input (blue), the second right-click sets it as an output (yellow). Multiple inputs or outputs can be set. After setting, place the arm. Targets outside its working range are automatically removed. Left-click during setup to cancel.&r"
		"&7Note: The Mechanical Arm can only target '&eOpen Storage Spaces&r&7', such as Conveyor Belts, Depots, Chutes, etc. Vanilla containers like hoppers and chests cannot be targeted.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7All usable work targets include (red marks can only be outputs):&r"
		"&7Conveyor Belt, Chute (Smart Chute), Depot, Weighted Ejector, Mixing Basin, Mechanical Crafter, Millstone, Mechanical Hand, Powered Mechanical Saw, Jukebox, Train Station, Packager, Unpackager, Blaze Burner (empty), Crushing Wheel Controller, Composter, Respawn Anchor, Input-mode Create Funnel, Campfire (Soul Campfire).&r"
		"&7When placing the Mechanical Arm on the bottom face of a block, it can be inverted.&r"
		""
		"&6Distribution Method&r"
		"&7If the Mechanical Arm has multiple outputs, you can set its distribution method among them. Long right-click the panel on the side of the arm's base to configure.&r"
	]
	quest.3CDB29B0059175A8.quest_desc: [
		"&6Familiar Soul&r"
		"&7The core material for materializing a familiar into the world. This item is obtained by capturing a &8Lost Soul&r&7 with an empty bottle on the &6Origin Island&r&7. Bottled souls can be released back into the wild.&r"
	]
	quest.3CDB29B0059175A8.quest_subtitle: "Lost Souls"
	quest.3D29D3316A8362E6.quest_subtitle: "Primitive Craft"
	quest.3D65B82D6967E302.quest_desc: [
		"&7Disk Drives can be used as storage blocks, but require inserted disks as storage media when used"
		""
		"If no disk inserted, cannot use as storage space; can be considered computer USB drives."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&7Disk Interfaces are tools for reading/writing items stored on disk memory"
		""
		"Can self-regulate export/import via device UI, set blacklists, whitelists, etc... thereby exporting/importing various items and storing them within."
	]
	quest.3D65B82D6967E302.quest_subtitle: "Plug and Play"
	quest.3D65B82D6967E302.title: "Disk Storage"
	quest.3D854DF7007E1CB8.quest_desc: [
		"&eReward levels of loot increase with boss defeats."
		""
		"&7Due to some craftsmen's poor skills, sometimes there are wasteful acts—forcing materials unsuitable for components onto them."
		""
		"This causes loss of material characteristics. Fortunately not completely unusable; replace them to restore proper attributes."
	]
	quest.3D854DF7007E1CB8.quest_subtitle: "Legacy Equipment"
	quest.3DEBEF47CB42C180.quest_desc: [
		"As the calorific value of the used fuel increases, the temperature achievable during smelting will also rise accordingly."
		""
		"&eLeft side shows fuel types that can be used&r"
	]
	quest.3DEBEF47CB42C180.quest_subtitle: "Energy-Consuming Heating"
	quest.3FA1E5E68F50BA85.quest_desc: [
		"&7This device can monitor specific items in storage network in real-time. To select items you want monitored, empty-hand sneak right-click to open panel for adjustments"
		""
		"Empty-hand left-click item icon directly retrieves items; right-click deposits items"
	]
	quest.3FA1E5E68F50BA85.quest_subtitle: "Real-time Monitoring"
	quest.3FD3535AE922834F.quest_desc: [
		"&7The number of BOSSes defeated will increase the player's (personal) Tier Level."
		""
		"Consuming a \"&bGood Apple&r\" or killing the final BOSS can reduce the Tier by 1 level."
		""
		"&bTier affects:"
		"&7The rarity of items from Silent Equipment bags."
		""
		"&7Monster champion spawn rates and the chance of high-tier champions appearing."
	]
	quest.3FD3535AE922834F.quest_subtitle: "&zYou believe you are ready for the challenge, and most importantly, you feel Lady Luck is smiling upon you. It's time to begin your own adventure!"
	quest.3FD839536F2A224B.quest_desc: [
		"&ePure energy condensed from starlight."
		"&6Burns at astonishing speed, processing your needed materials extremely quickly."
		""
		"⚡ Speed: 1.5x | ♨ Temperature: 3000 | ⏳ Consumption: 0.4"
		""
		"&aTip&r&7: &f♨ &r&7Temperature determines the material grade that can be processed, ⚡ Speed affects processing time, ⏳ Consumption represents fuel durability."
	]
	quest.3FD839536F2A224B.quest_subtitle: "Rapid Combustion"
	quest.4015BC05F1AAD9EB.quest_subtitle: "For Casting Rods"
	quest.40C75417213642DC.quest_subtitle: "Stage 0"
	quest.41555B67D70627EB.quest_subtitle: "Who Can Kill Me!"
	quest.417E7341644D16C8.quest_desc: [
		"&6Rune Exhaustion Treaty"
		"&7Your soul has its carrying limit.&r&cEach rune equipped reduces received healing, armor value, armor toughness, magic resistance by one-twentieth"
		"&7Part of your soul becomes rune slots.&r&aGrants two rune slots"
	]
	quest.417E7341644D16C8.quest_subtitle: "Observe Ancient Covenant"
	quest.417E7341644D16C8.title: "Rune Exhaustion Treaty"
	quest.41E17B4557322ADD.quest_subtitle: "Long, Stabby, Stick"
	quest.4213B825EDC1B32D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Rune Brooch&r"
		""
		"&7Rune Brooch simplest, plainest brooch. Symbolizes additional cost's power, or bloodied hands holding thorny enlightenment. When worn, removes one &cring&r&7 power slot from my hands, grants &aability&r&7 to inscribe one rune in each palm.&r"
	]
	quest.4213B825EDC1B32D.quest_subtitle: "Power in Palms"
	quest.42F6170490C96218.quest_subtitle: "No More Rivals"
	quest.42F6170490C96218.title: "Kill Champion Mobs ×1000"
	quest.43B69EBAF5DCC756.quest_subtitle: "All-in-one Tool"
	quest.43DDDB9D9BA35A28.quest_desc: [
		"&7Oaths and sacrifices have power. Take &6brooch&r&7 as example: one thing exchanged for another."
		"&7Legends often tell stories of voluntary sacrifices gaining power. I designed scheme to semi-permanently set such treaties, or oaths, for souls via &5Soulbound Brazier&r&7."
		""
		"&7Brazier itself more like &denergy-conducting core&r&7 than machine—guides souls using &eDivine Gold lining&r&7 and &6Deepslate Orichalcum crystals&r&7."
		"&7After materials prepared, must ignite brazier with &bSpiritfire&r&7."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7Each oath requires offerings—&ccore item&r&7, additional &7raw materials&r&7, &dArcane Energy&r&7 needed to maintain oath—all placed directly into brazier; interact with brazier."
		"&7After igniting brazier, must seal covenant with own &4blood&r&7. No limit to number offering blood, as long as voluntary."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7Oaths can even be applied to simple souls, though they may not know how to utilize well."
		"&7Weakening creature before igniting brazier allows it to join oath."
		""
		"&7Souls seem able to hold maximum &ctwo oaths&r&7 simultaneously; extra ones ineffective."
		"&6Important to reiterate: oaths bound to soul itself, thus cannot be withdrawn without powerful means."
	]
	quest.43DDDB9D9BA35A28.quest_subtitle: "Exchange Cost for Power"
	quest.43DDDB9D9BA35A28.title: "Oaths, and Other Covenants"
	quest.4432A2327732E7FF.quest_desc: [
		"&7Rot, &cthings capable of breaking and damaging&r&7. Non-Directional Ritual's creations have many strange properties; I want to try classifying them."
		"&7"
		"&7Simple explanation: just another form of energy infecting world, but obviously incorrect. Rot harmless, at least inherently. It's just... &7substance."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Rot Research: Substance"
		"&7&bNon-Directional Ritual&r&7, as name implies, random process. Transmutes substances, but transmutation products fickle. So randomly produced powder just unrelated material fragments piled together, quite foul-smelling. Not recommended eating or farming with, otherwise harmless."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Rot Research: Vegetation"
		"&7Testing interaction between &8Rot&r&7 and bone meal observed two plants frequently appearing—&aRot Root Strands&r&7 and &aRot Pearl Clusters&r&7. Both useless, but seem able to grow on rot without water or light. Interesting."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Rot Research: Spread"
		"&7Rot doesn't spread on own, after all just randomly generated substance. But has &dsoul memory&r&7, reproducible pattern. If given &eArcane Energy&r&7 or effective fertilizer, rot randomly reproduces this pattern in surrounding area."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Rot Research: Resonance"
		"&7This reproduction precisely why extremely important for &bRelease Ritual&r&7. &bRelease Ritual&r&7 remembers brutality of its creation, &dresonates&r&7 with memory in rot, injecting its energy into things above rot."
	]
	quest.443DAEA62297C415.quest_desc: [
		"&6Origin Island&r"
		"&7This is a long-forgotten, isolated island in the vast ocean, containing &6secrets&r&7 about the origins of familiars. The only inhabitants on the island are tiny '&8Lost Souls&r&7'—they are early forms of familiars that failed to evolve into complete ones. These souls can be captured with empty bottles to perform new rituals. The ritual must be completed on the &epedestal&r&7 at the island's center.&r"
		""
		"&7To locate this island, you first need a &bSniffer&r&7. They can sometimes dig up &eCrystallized Berries&r&7. Alternatively, you can purchase berries from &dFloral Endermen&r&7. Feeding a crystallized berry to a tamed familiar will evoke its vague memories of birth and the past, which condense into &eMemory Fragments&r&7. Memory fragments are used similarly to Eyes of Ender, guiding you to the location of the Origin Island.&r"
	]
	quest.443DAEA62297C415.quest_subtitle: "Discover the Origin Island"
	quest.443DAEA62297C415.title: "Land of Origins"
	quest.446683FEB932319C.quest_desc: [
		"&6Twisted Unpredictable Rune&r"
		""
		"&7Twisted Unpredictable Rune doesn't enhance consciousness's abilities, but randomly twists its behavior, causing wearer's attack damage to randomly vary—sometimes hitting enemy's weak point exactly, doubling attack damage &a&r&7.&r"
	]
	quest.446683FEB932319C.quest_subtitle: "Pulse Promoting Corruption"
	quest.447E0F674624A5FA.quest_desc: [
		"&6Rose Quartz&r"
		"&7A pale red crystal formed by fusing Redstone with Nether Quartz.&r"
		"&7When holding Rose Quartz in the main hand and Sandpaper in the off-hand, polishing begins. Polishing consumes the Rose Quartz immediately; if the animation is interrupted, the item is returned. Upon completion, you obtain &ePolished Rose Quartz&7.&r"
	]
	quest.45A1C2B4E1B4D9BC.quest_desc: [
		"&6Rotting Gluttony Treaty&r"
		""
		"&7Corruption will eventually devour you.&r"
		"&7-Each level of &cUrgent Craving&r&7 adds &cdamage&r&7 received&r"
		"&7-Received &cpoison&r&7 damage doubled&r"
		"&7-&cHunger&r&7 damage brings &cpoison&r"
		""
		"&7Corruption becomes your strongest weapon.&r"
		"&7-&6Gluttony&r&7 becomes &6Urgent Craving&r"
		"&7-&6Urgent Craving&r&7 increases &escythe proficiency&r&7, generating &blocusts&r&7 when scythe deals damage&r"
		"&7-&6Urgent Craving&r&7 enhancement accelerates, higher cap&r"
	]
	quest.45A1C2B4E1B4D9BC.quest_subtitle: "Endless Eating"
	quest.45A1C2B4E1B4D9BC.title: "Rotting Gluttony Treaty"
	quest.46318C4037942B1E.quest_desc: [
		"Can provide 1500°C temperature, requires an Electric Furnace to function properly"
		""
		"&eNot just one per forge... multiple can be placed in the same furnace to provide fuel consumption"
	]
	quest.46318C4037942B1E.quest_subtitle: "Low-Temperature Heating"
	quest.46C1263DC7062475.quest_desc: [
		"&6Twisted Engine&r"
		""
		"&7Twisted Engine violates natural laws, practical applications require utmost caution. Twisted Engine rejects causality, occasionally instantly completing &6Focus Cycle&r&7 shortly after normal cycle ends, before next cycle begins.&r"
		""
		"&7Furthermore, chain activation of Twisted Engines grants all other attributes stackable &abenefits&r&7. But probably obvious: this operation significantly increases &cfuel consumption&r&7. Finally, also slightly increases tuning burden of standard &etuning process&r&7.&r"
	]
	quest.46C1263DC7062475.quest_subtitle: "Escape Linear Time"
	quest.47CF8DC4847AD311.quest_subtitle: "Stage 2"
	quest.486FF12887B452B7.quest_desc: [
		"&7If you want to prevent weapons from gaining bad enchantments, use Water-filtering Bookshelves"
		""
		"They completely eliminate the possibility of randomly obtaining such negative effects during enchanting."
	]
	quest.486FF12887B452B7.quest_subtitle: "Begone Evil Curses!"
	quest.48BEC55ECB0AC9A3.quest_desc: [
		"&6Portable Fluid Interface&r"
		""
		"&7A connecting component specifically for extracting or inputting fluids between moving contraptions.&r"
		""
		"&6Transferring Fluids&r"
		"&7When a Portable Fluid Interface faces another interface on a contraption, spaced 1 to 2 blocks apart, they automatically dock and begin fluid transfer.&r"
		"&7Requires a Kinetic Pump; transfer direction and speed are determined by the pump's rotation direction and speed.&r"
		"&7If the target interface is on a moving contraption, that contraption will be temporarily halted until the current transfer completes.&r"
		"&7Interfaces may shift slightly during docking, but this does not affect actual transfer.&r"
		"&7When a contraption moves or rotates too fast, the success rate of interface interaction drops significantly.&r"
		""
		"&6Redstone Locking&r"
		"&7A Portable Fluid Interface can be locked by a redstone signal. When locked, it will no longer halt contraptions and will not transfer fluids.&r"
		""
		"&8They hate bumps but love to dance together.&r"
	]
	quest.4923304658C6BF41.quest_desc: [
		"&eThe ultimate fuel; it seems wasteful to use it as fuel."
		"&6Combines lowest consumption, fastest speed, and highest temperature—nearly perfect."
		""
		"⚡ Speed: 3.0x | ♨ Temperature: 6000 | ⏳ Consumption: 0.1"
		""
		"&aTip&r&7: &f♨ &r&7Temperature determines the material grade that can be processed, ⚡ Speed affects processing time, ⏳ Consumption represents fuel durability."
	]
	quest.4923304658C6BF41.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate Fuel"
	quest.4939B8B2FE7A3B5D.quest_subtitle: "Stage 1"
	quest.496E4A2F2E407B7E.quest_subtitle: "Can this thing really kill?"
	quest.49840E89ACF73DAF.quest_subtitle: "Small Spoon"
	quest.4996E5CD9E56D25E.quest_subtitle: "Food Value > 8"
	quest.4996E5CD9E56D25E.title: "Meal Recycling x32"
	quest.4A1A9E32ABF05FD0.quest_subtitle: "Place marked items or fluids. When working normally, front cannot have any blocks (except fluids)"
	quest.4A4B782308B84A50.quest_subtitle: "Observation Window"
	quest.4A7080BE52CC6335.quest_subtitle: "Garden Tool"
	quest.4AC2F5D5FF711C0F.quest_desc: [
		"&6Resonance Tuner&r"
		""
		"&7&Ethereal Air&r&7 and &6Earthen Earth&r&7 usually don't interact; this non-interaction also has its uses. Resonance Tuner mitigates interaction of different forces in &eCauldron&r&7, greatly reducing or even completely removing &cdestabilization risk&r&7 by slowing processing speed.&r"
	]
	quest.4AC2F5D5FF711C0F.quest_subtitle: "Detuning Mitigation"
	quest.4AF740882E852DBF.quest_desc: [
		"&6Familiar House&r"
		"&7A familiar house is a block that can store up to 10 familiars. Familiars stored inside are &ainvulnerable&r&7 and typically do not attack other creatures (with some exceptions). The familiar house has two modes:&r"
		""
		"&7&bStorage Mode&r&7: Allows the player to freely &amove&r&7 familiars between their own familiars and those inside the house.&r"
		"&7&bRoaming Mode&r&7: Allows stored familiars to &aroam&r&7 within a configurable distance. In this mode, you can also enable or disable familiars' abilities while roaming. The familiar house block can only be broken by its &cowner&r&7, and only when it is in storage mode and contains no familiars.&r"
		""
		"&6Important Note&r&7: Only one familiar house block can be used within a 16-block radius.&r"
	]
	quest.4AF740882E852DBF.quest_subtitle: "Grand Villa"
	quest.4AFE778B9A79DA33.quest_subtitle: "Swift Footsteps"
	quest.4B3F9F49C0FF6B3B.quest_desc: ["Although the preparation process has been improved, the rarity of arcane essence ink—especially high-tier grades—remains undeniable."]
	quest.4B3F9F49C0FF6B3B.quest_subtitle: "Exquisite"
	quest.4B3F9F49C0FF6B3B.title: "Arcane Ink"
	quest.4B6AD3BEF9352961.quest_desc: [
		"&eA furnace that requires electricity connection to power devices."
		""
		"Compared to traditional smelting relying on fuel combustion, electric smelting is more convenient—only requiring electricity to process most materials."
	]
	quest.4B6AD3BEF9352961.quest_subtitle: "Electric Smelting"
	quest.4BA0280CD5AC4EB5.quest_subtitle: "More Noble Scissors...?"
	quest.4C412C5221E780D5.quest_desc: [
		"Compared to pattern bases, blueprints are more advanced component crafting tools. Being reusable without consumption, such tools are favored by craftsmen everywhere."
		""
		"&7If I could obtain one, weapon crafting would likely be much more convenient."
	]
	quest.4CA23D8F901BB6BD.quest_desc: [
		"&6Glass Brooch&r"
		""
		"&7Rune Brooch effective, but symbolic containers of power not limited to hands. Can also direct it to my blood via Glass Brooch, at cost of depriving part of &clife force&r&7, gaining &aability&r&7 to inscribe two runes on chest.&r"
	]
	quest.4CA23D8F901BB6BD.quest_subtitle: "Fragile Power"
	quest.4CC2D82F6A669265.quest_desc: [
		"&6Blazing Diode&r"
		""
		"&7Blazing Diode borrows powerful force of fiery-hot souls, reducing &cfuel requirement&r&7 of &eCatalyzers&r&7 around &eCauldron&r&7 while slightly accelerating &aFocus Process&r&7.&r"
	]
	quest.4CC2D82F6A669265.quest_subtitle: "Strongest Power"
	quest.4D2714BB06E019FF.quest_desc: [
		"&7Carefully contemplating properties observed in &dSoul Crystals&r&7, cannot help thinking structure itself also important. Testing this conclusion, created &8Mnemonic Matter&r&7 imitation for mimicking &cEvil Arcane Energy&r&7; condensed soul memory closest substance I could think of. Achieves precision of one part in hundreds of thousands."
		"&7"
		"&7Didn't expect it to explode before my eyes."
		"&7"
		"&7But explosions also useful, provided can control. So made another sample, but this time designed structure for pseudo-crystal—&6Soul Wood&r&7 and &6Soul-Stained Steel&r&7 mount to transmit energy outward. When focusing spells onto wand, resembles miniaturized ritual, though effects somewhat different."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7Melee attacking with wand... barely sufficient. Probably prefer scythe as first choice, but wand's efficacy not bad. Usually emphasize magic damage, less emphasis on physical damage, sometimes useful. Their true uniqueness manifests when I &ause&r&7 them."
		"&7"
		"&7Mnemonic Hex Wand condenses liquid evil arcane energy into spheres to launch, reminiscent of witch's hex. Takes time to activate, apparently cannot launch multiple times consecutively in short time, but each launch deals significant damage to target. Wand borrows my soul for charging, hence all wands on my person share unified bullet count."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7This method of creating imitation arcane energy met obstacles with other energies, perhaps material reasons. Mnemonic Matter's resonance with Evil Arcane Energy might stem from death required for creating Experience Crystals."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Bullet Capacity"
		"&7As far as I know, Soul Crystals contain limited energy... but only holds for arcane energy's peculiar non-physical substances. &6Bullet Capacity&r&7 enchantment allows wand to accumulate more energy in same physical space, each level storing approximately one more spell bullet. Wands with this enchantment cannot accept Rapid Reload."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Rapid Reload"
		"&7Wands can channel magic with physical form. Obviously, magic can flow out and in, consciously controlling flow not impossible. When melee attacking with wand enchanted with &6Rapid Reload&r&7, chance to replenish wand's energy reservoir, roughly refilling equivalent to one spell bullet. Wands with this enchantment cannot accept Bullet Capacity."
	]
	quest.4D2714BB06E019FF.quest_subtitle: "May Mages Fear My Might"
	quest.4D2714BB06E019FF.title: "Soul Wand"
	quest.4DBB3CA0C3949A66.quest_desc: [
		"&6Stormcaller Familiar&r"
		"&7Combat: Specializes in &elightning magic&r&7, can attack multiple targets simultaneously.&r"
		"&7Abilities:&r"
		"&7&aMaster of Charge&r&7: Can energize its owner for a period, increasing their speed and strength.&r"
		"&7&aCharged Creeper&r&7: Whenever it spots a creeper, it will follow and charge it.&r"
		"&7Spawn: Can be found wandering in &bmountains&r&7, seeking good spots to attract lightning.&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Archmage Familiar&r"
		"&7Combat: Specializes in &ebasic magic&r&7 of different schools.&r"
		"&7Abilities:&r"
		"&7&aTransmutation&r&7: Can transform &espell scrolls&r&7 on a pedestal into other scrolls of the same rarity, with a small chance to obtain higher rarity scrolls.&r"
		"&7&cEnder Nightmare&r&7: Endermen fear it and will flee upon sight.&r"
		"&7&aShulker Protection&r&7: Can counter shulker bullets.&r"
		"&7Spawn: Can be found learning in temporary laboratories located in the &6End&r&7.&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Necromancer Familiar&r"
		"&7Combat: Specializes in &cblood magic&r&7, including necromantic abilities to summon undead.&r"
		"&7Abilities:&r"
		"&7&cUndead Frenzy&r&7: Can cause nearby undead entities to become frenzied, attacking nearby entities chaotically.&r"
		"&7&cWithering&r&7: Can transform nearby skeletons into wither skeletons.&r"
		"&7Spawn: Can be found studying death in graveyards throughout the &8Soul Sand Valley&r&7.&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Conjurer Familiar&r"
		"&7Combat: Specializes in &8void magic&r&7 and unknown arts, able to summon shadow-born creations.&r"
		"&7Abilities:&r"
		"&7&aTrue Sight&r&7: Can grant its owner &anight vision&r&7 and immunity to blindness and darkness effects.&r"
		"&7&aDark Ritual&r&7: Can deactivate &cSculk Shriekers&r&7, allowing its owner to evade detection by Wardens.&r"
		"&7Spawn: Can be found studying dark arts in laboratories located in &cAncient Cities&r&7.&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Hunter Familiar&r"
		"&7Combat: Specializes in attacking enemies with &ebows&r&7, combined with swift movement.&r"
		"&7Abilities:&r"
		"&7&aWatcher&r&7: Can protect its owner from enemies targeting them, even if the owner is unaware.&r"
		"&7&aLoot Sniffer&r&7: The owner can right-click it while holding any item, causing it to search for entities that drop that item and mark them for the owner.&r"
		"&7Spawn: Can be found living in camps across &bforest&r&7 biomes.&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Druid Familiar&r"
		"&7Combat: Specializes in controlling enemies using &bnature magic&r&7.&r"
		"&7Abilities:&r"
		"&7&aOvergrowth&r&7: Can use bone meal on nearby crops.&r"
		"&7&aNature's Blessing&r&7: Can breed nearby animals.&r"
		"&7Spawn: Can be found protecting forests worldwide.&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Illusionist Familiar&r"
		"&7Combat: Specializes in &dillusion magic&r&7, controlling enemies through deception.&r"
		"&7Abilities:&r"
		"&7&aMagic Trick&r&7: When the owner's health is low, the Illusionist performs a magic trick, hiding the owner from enemies.&r"
		"&7&aDecoy&r&7: When its health is low, it disappears, leaving behind an explosive copy that taunts nearby enemies to attack it.&r"
		"&7&aPickpocket&r&7: When no one is looking and there are gold nuggets or emeralds on the ground, this little trickster will take them for itself.&r"
		"&7Spawn: Illusionists naturally spawn disguised as other Overworld familiars; use the &eMirror of Truth&r&7 to reveal them.&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Plague Doctor Familiar&r"
		"&7Combat: Specializes in &cpoison magic&r&7, causing enemies to die slowly through poisoning.&r"
		"&7Abilities:&r"
		"&7&cToxic Blood&r&7: Its owner and itself deal extra damage to poisoned entities. When the Plague Doctor familiar is attacked, it throws a poison bottle in retaliation.&r"
		"&7Acquisition: To obtain it, you must craft a bottle of &cToxic Reagent&r&7 and give it to a tamed Druid familiar.&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Blazing Familiar&r"
		"&7Combat: Specializes in &efire magic&r&7, burning enemies to death.&r"
		"&7Abilities:&r"
		"&7&cMolten Heart&r&7: When attacked, sets the attacker on fire for a duration.&r"
		"&7&aHeat Resistance&r&7: Grants its owner and itself immunity to fire.&r"
		"&7Spawn: Can be found wandering in hot places in the &cNether&r&7.&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Cleric Familiar&r"
		"&7Combat: Specializes in &asacred magic&r&7, primarily in a support role, but can also cast powerful holy spells to purify enemies.&r"
		"&7Abilities:&r"
		"&7&aRedemption&r&7: It attacks undead in sight, but if it sees a zombie villager, it uses holy power to cure and redeem it.&r"
		"&7Acquisition: To obtain a Cleric familiar, you must cast an &aPurification Spell&r&7 near an untamed Necromancer familiar.&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Bard Familiar&r"
		"&7Combat: Specializes in &dsound magic&r&7, attacking enemies with powerful melodies and aiding allies with supportive tunes.&r"
		"&7Abilities:&r"
		"&7&aMusical Nature&r&7: It plays melodies to make adventures more delightful.&r"
		"&7Acquisition: To obtain it, you must cast a &eSound Spell&r&7 near an untamed familiar to pique its interest in music.&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Frost Familiar&r"
		"&7Combat: Specializes in &bfrost magic&r&7, with a good balance between offense, defense, and mobility, along with decent control capabilities.&r"
		"&7Abilities:&r"
		"&7&aFrost Trail&r&7: It and its owner can freeze water underfoot to walk on it.&r"
		"&7&aFrost Heart&r&7: It and its owner are immune to freezing effects, including powder snow freezing.&r"
		"&7Spawn: Can be found wandering in &bsnowy biomes&r&7.&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Dragoon Familiar&r"
		"&7Combat: Specializes in &6ender magic&r&7, focusing on melee combat.&r"
		"&7Abilities:&r"
		"&7&eDragon's Breath&r&7: It can collect dragon's breath using glass bottles.&r"
		"&7&aDragon Heart&r&7: Its dragon heart allows it to regenerate health naturally.&r"
		"&7&aGuardian&r&7: When an allied familiar within melee range is attacked, it swaps positions with them and locks onto the attacker.&r"
		"&7Spawn: Spawns on &6Outer End Islands&r&7.&r"
	]
	quest.4DBB3CA0C3949A66.quest_subtitle: "So Cute"
	quest.4E7B1EFF01114F88.quest_desc: [
		"&6Steam Engine&r"
		""
		"&7The Steam Engine is an advanced power source that requires a &eBoiler&r&7 to generate power.&r"
		"&7Stress Output: &c0 ~ 16384 su&r"
		"&7RPM Output: &c16 ~ 64 RPM&r"
		""
		"&6Acquisition&r"
		"&7Crafting Table recipe.&r"
		""
		"&6Usage&r"
		""
		"&6Placement&r"
		"&7The Steam Engine must be installed on any face of a &eFluid Tank&r&7, which will then become a &6Boiler&r&7. For the Steam Engine to output power, place an &eEncased Cogwheel&r&7 directly in front of it (the second block). Right-click the Steam Engine with the cogwheel.&r"
		""
		"&6Outputting Stress from a Boiler&r"
		"&7The Steam Engine is used to output stress from a Boiler. The Boiler's stress generation mechanism is detailed under &6Boiler&r&7.&r"
		"&7Stress produced by the Boiler is evenly distributed to each Steam Engine on it. A single Steam Engine can output a maximum of &c16384 su&r&7 stress. Therefore, when total stress exceeds 16384 su, more Steam Engines are needed to output all stress; otherwise, excess stress is wasted. Installing a number of Steam Engines equal to the Boiler's level will fully output its stress.&r"
		"&7When the number of Steam Engines is already sufficient to output all stress, adding more does not increase efficiency.&r"
	]
	quest.4E826A5530F49919.quest_subtitle: "Stage 2"
	quest.4F5EEA7BC57F0B37.quest_desc: ["Can use Silk Touch, consuming 150 durability to remove a spawner,"]
	quest.4F5EEA7BC57F0B37.quest_subtitle: "Breeding Ground"
	quest.5007BB2101ED1D9C.quest_subtitle: "Familiar Summoning Ritual"
	quest.501A9D4E77A9D0EA.quest_subtitle: "Tear Soul"
	quest.501AB9740C6C4447.quest_desc: [
		"&6Strong Heart Rune&r"
		""
		"&7Strong Heart Rune doesn't provide healing like similar runes, but forces form to heal beyond limits, granting small amount of &aextra health&r&7.&r"
	]
	quest.501AB9740C6C4447.quest_subtitle: "Heal Whole Things"
	quest.5057DE8E48849E95.quest_desc: [
		"&6Brass&r"
		""
		"&7Molten copper and zinc meet in the furnace; cooled, they become this warm golden metal. It's somewhat soft, yet sufficient to shape the earliest forms of machinery.&r"
		""
		"&6Uses&r"
		"&7Hold it in hand and use it on a placed &eStripped Log&r&7 to cover it with a metallic sheen, transforming it into a sturdy &eBrass Casing&r&7—an indispensable starting point for many complex creations.&r"
		"&7Beside a &eStonecutter&r&7, it can be shaped into corresponding &eScaffolding&r&7 and structural parts, paving the way for taller constructions.&r"
		"&7On a &eCrafting Table&r&7, its forms become more refined: the agile joints of a &eBrass Hand&r&7, the guiding trajectory of a &eBrass Funnel&r&7, or the extension as a &eBrass Tunnel&r&7 allowing energy and matter to pass silently.&r"
		""
		"&8A small note on the manuscript edge: It is friendly enough that a beginner can start working with just a file and hammer. Of course, don't expect to make a sword from it.&r"
	]
	quest.5057DE8E48849E95.quest_subtitle: "An important metal material, often used in crafting advanced components."
	quest.5077E77C727BD6FD.quest_desc: ["Will attempt to output specific items to container"]
	quest.5077E77C727BD6FD.quest_subtitle: "Export Items/Fluids from RS Network"
	quest.50B7EEE2AA34EAFE.quest_desc: [
		"&6Equipment Repair&r"
		""
		"&7During journeys, weapons and equipment inevitably wear down. &eRepair Kits&r&7 can help you effectively maintain them.&r"
		""
		"&7* &eAnvil Repair&r&7: Utilizes materials more fully, restores more durability, but consumes experience.&r"
		"&7* &eRepair Kit Repair&r&7: No experience consumption, convenient operation, but slightly lower material utilization.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Repair Principles&r"
		"&7Repair involves two core concepts:&r"
		"&7* &eRepair Efficiency&r&7: Repair kits, equipment, or components may have this multiplier. When repairing, multiplies with material's durability value, affecting final repair amount.&r"
		"&7* &eRepair Value&r&7: Some materials possess this attribute; their own durability multiplies with it, making certain materials particularly suitable or unsuitable for repair.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Material Selection&r"
		"&7&cKey Principle&r&7: Must use materials &csame as equipment's main material&r&7 for repair.&r"
		"&7* &eAttribute Application&r&7: When repairing armor and shields, reference material's &bArmor Durability&r&7; when repairing other tools/weapons, reference &bRegular Durability&r&7.&r"
		"&7* &eEfficiency Impact&r&7: Some materials also have &bRepair Efficiency Modifier&r&7, affecting actual repair effect.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Repair Kit Details&r"
		"&7Kits come in multiple levels. Higher-level kits have &alarger capacity&r&7 and &ahigher repair efficiency&r&7.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Usage Method&r"
		"&71. &eFill Materials&r&7: Place a repair kit with one or more compatible materials in crafting grid to store materials into kit.&r"
		"&72. &ePerform Repair&r&7:&r"
		"&7 * Place &calready filled&r&7 repair kit with equipment needing repair in crafting grid to repair.&r"
		"&7 * Can also place &cadditional materials&r&7 with repair kit and equipment in crafting grid during repair. These extra materials will be directly consumed.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Important Notes&r&7:&r"
		"&7* Repair kits &aconsume materials as needed&r&7. For example, if repair only requires half an iron ingot, remaining half stays in kit.&r"
		"&7* But &cmaterials additionally placed in crafting grid during repair&r&7 will be &centirely consumed&r&7, even if exceeding repair needs.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Emptying Kit&r"
		"&7To empty repair kit, simply craft it with a stick. Note: This operation &cdestroys&r&7 all stored materials in kit, returning only an empty kit.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Anvil Repair&r"
		"&7Operation identical to vanilla: equipment left, compatible material right. Repair efficiency is 50%&r"
	]
	quest.50B7EEE2AA34EAFE.quest_subtitle: "Repair Your Tools"
	quest.50E57652755EC341.quest_desc: [
		"&aTier (0~50):&r&7Determines the maximum enchantment level the enchanting table can enchant, Maximum enchantment level = Tier × 2"
		"&r"
		"&cQuantization (0%~100%):&r &7Fluctuates your final enchantment level, making the final enchantment level within the range [2e(1-q), 2e(1+q)]"
		"(e is the tier value, q is the quantization value)"
		"&3Enchanting tables have a built-in 15% quantization. If the enchanting table tier is 50 and quantization is 90%, using the third row level to enchant any enchantable item results in a final enchantment level range of [10, 190] (levels)"
		""
		"&r&5Arcana (0%~100%):&r&7Determines the probability of \"rare enchantments\" appearing. When Arcana reaches 100%, some ordinary enchantments (like Sharpness) become rare."
		"&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&eQuantum Stability:&r&7Changes the minimum final enchantment level affected by quantum fluctuations. The minimum level is 1, and the corrected quantum range is \"[-q(1-r), +q], 0<q≤1\" (q is the quantization value, r is the calibration value). So if the enchanting table has 100% calibration, the final quantum range becomes [0, +q]."
		""
		"&r&bEnchantment Clues:&r&7Number of enchantments that can be previewed, default is 1&r"
	]
	quest.50E57652755EC341.quest_subtitle: "I Have a FOMO Station"
	quest.5125C8D0790C81BB.quest_desc: [
		"&6Roaring Wind Rune&r"
		""
		"&7Roaring Wind Rune's ability similar to namesake ritual, grants wearer &bRoaring Wind&r&7 effect at half potency, speeding &amovement speed&r&7 and &aattack speed&r&7.&r"
	]
	quest.5125C8D0790C81BB.quest_subtitle: "Swift Pulse"
	quest.5177469D5E64C1E3.quest_desc: [
		"&6Sanding with Sandpaper&r"
		""
		"&6Sanding Methods&r"
		"&7You can perform 'Sanding' in the following ways:&r"
		"&7Hold Sandpaper in one hand and the item to process in the other, then right-click;&r"
		"&7Hold Sandpaper and right-click a dropped item entity;&r"
		"&7Have a Mechanical Hand hold Sandpaper to sand, with the same effect as manual sanding.&r"
		"&7Each sanding action consumes 1 durability from the Sandpaper.&r"
		""
		"&6Sanding Copper Blocks&r"
		"&7Can perform surface treatment on vanilla copper blocks:&r"
		"&7If the copper block is waxed, it dewaxes it;&r"
		"&7If the copper block is oxidized, it reduces the oxidation level by one stage.&r"
		"&7The mechanism is identical to that of a vanilla axe.&r"
		""
		"&6Sanding Building Blocks&r"
		"&7Can transform certain vanilla building blocks (e.g., Stone Bricks, Andesite, etc.) into their corresponding 'Polished' variants.&r"
		""
		"&6Enchanting&r"
		"&7Sandpaper can be enchanted at an Enchanting Table or Anvil. Available enchantments include Unbreaking, Mending, and Curse of Vanishing.&r"
		"&8A tiny, scrawled note at the page edge: Would anyone really enchant this?&r"
	]
	quest.51BE2E9C9209091D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Flowing Grip Rune&r"
		""
		"&7Flowing Grip Rune's ability similar to namesake ritual, grants wearer &bFlowing Grip&r&7 effect at half potency, slightly extending &ablock interaction range&r&7 and &aitem pickup range&r&7.&r"
	]
	quest.51BE2E9C9209091D.quest_subtitle: "Extending Pulse"
	quest.51DA4C51263ADA18.quest_desc: [
		"&7One common task for apprentice mages is creating &bflames requiring no heat source or fuel&r&7."
		""
		"&7This tests &6magical mastery&r&7, often used to detect ability to circumvent natural phenomena."
		"&7Soul Magic can certainly create such miracles."
		""
		"&7Spiritfire flame's special feature lies in its affinity with &dcolor&r&7."
		"&7Just like dyeing &6leather&r&7, I can also dye &eSpiritfire&r&7."
		"&7Being a light source, dyeing dark colors &8reduces its brightness&r&7 rather than changing flame's &acolor&r&7."
	]
	quest.51DA4C51263ADA18.quest_subtitle: "Wind's Colors"
	quest.52FB65193EF182F4.quest_desc: [
		"&#FF5555Wrath - Corrosion&r&7"
		"&7When carrying the \"Wrath\" effect, it is considered as applying &#FF5555Stationary Timer&r&7.&r"
		"&#00FFAA[Every 1 second]&r&7 &#FF5555Stationary Timer&r&7 increases by 1 second.&r"
		"&#00FFAA[Stationary Timer ≥ 60 seconds]&r&7 Causes you to take damage equal to 10% of max health, and resets &#FF5555Stationary Timer&r&7 to 0.&r"
		"&#00FFAA[Upon being attacked]&r&7 If you have the &#FFAA00Wrath&r&7 effect, apply &#FF5555Glowing&r&7 (lasting 20 seconds) and &#FF5555Wrath Mark&r&7 (lasting 20 seconds) to the attacker.&r"
		"&#00FFAA[Upon hitting an attack]&r&7 If you have the &#FFAA00Wrath&r&7 effect and the target has &#FF5555Wrath Mark&r&7, add an extra 2 times the base damage as additional final damage to this attack; after successfully adding, remove the target's &#FF5555Wrath Mark&r&7 and &#FF5555Glowing&r&7 effects.&r"
		"&#00FFAA[Upon hitting an attack]&r&7 If you are not in a \"Wrath\" state, reset &#FF5555Stationary Timer&r&7 to 0.&r"
	]
	quest.533E6E13F1C9E939.quest_desc: [
		"&6Conveyor Belt&r"
		""
		"&7It is the flowing path in a mechanic's hands, responsible for transporting items between two points, or transmitting unseen rotational force.&r"
		""
		"&6Laying This Path&r"
		"&7You need at least two Encased Cogwheels facing the same direction as start and end points. Hold the Conveyor Belt and right-click the first cogwheel. A red particle trail will appear where you aim—it's asking for the endpoint. Only when the particles turn green does the other cogwheel accept the connection; right-click again, and the path is laid. If particles stay crimson, placement is wrong; if they vanish, the distance exceeds its limit.&r"
		"&7It can extend horizontally, vertically, or at a precise 45-degree slant, but the total length (including the end cogwheels) cannot exceed &c20 blocks&7 (or &c15 blocks&7 if diagonal).&r"
		""
		"&6Trimming and Modifying&r"
		"&7Hold a new Conveyor Belt and right-click the end of an existing belt (this won't consume the held item) to extend it forward by one block; the end cogwheel will migrate. To retract it, gently tap the end with a Wrench.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7If you use a Wrench in the middle of the belt, you can cut it—this usually consumes two cogwheels (unless in Creative mode). For two separate conveyor belts with compliant total length and consistent direction, holding a Conveyor Belt and clicking one endpoint will connect them, returning one belt and two cogwheels.&r"
		"&7You can also hold a cogwheel and right-click directly on an empty space in the middle of a belt to insert a new support point; use a Wrench to remove it.&r"
		""
		"&7It doesn't have to be dull metal. Using dye, you can color it any shade you want. To wash off this attire, a bucket of water or a water bottle is enough.&r"
		""
		"&8The margin of the manuscript has a drawing of a winding conveyor belt, with a note: The path is laid. Now, make things move.&r"
	]
	quest.53634A7FA785B1D3.quest_subtitle: "Sinking Into It"
	quest.53634A7FA785B1D3.title: "Seven Deadly Sins Corrosion"
	quest.536380EE035D7850.quest_subtitle: "Right-click an already placed eye on the door frame with any Eye of Ender Genesis to remove it"
	quest.5372150CD0958B7B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Crushing Wheel&r"
		""
		"&6Item Processing&r"
		"&7Designed specifically for executing '&cCrushing&r&7' type recipes. Items without a corresponding recipe are &cdestroyed&7."
		"&7Most '&cCrushing&r&7' recipes are identical to '&eMilling&r&7' recipes, so in function it can replace most &eMillstones&7."
		"&7Must be used in pairs, and the two wheels must rotate in a coordinated direction to work.&r"
		""
		"&6Entity Processing&r"
		"&7Active Crushing Wheels &cdamage&7 entities that enter their effective range (except players on Peaceful difficulty), and drop the crushed products at the output."
		"&7This damage ignores armor, Protection enchantments, and Resistance effects, but can be negated by Absorption."
		"&7For horizontally placed wheels, placing a block above them prevents suction; for vertical ones, you can place a Chute above the gap to avoid suction without affecting normal operation.&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&6Placement and Operating Mechanism&r"
		"&7When a pair of Crushing Wheels are correctly placed, if the single block space between them is unobstructed, an invisible block automatically generates: the &eCrushing Wheel Controller&7."
		"&7This block has collision volume, cannot be moved by pistons or contraptions, acts as an open container that absorbs and processes items, and supports logistics input and output."
		"&7It controls the behavior of the entire wheel pair. When the wheels are separated, this block disappears."
		""
		"&7A functional Crushing Wheel pair must satisfy:"
		"&7They are only &c1 block&7 apart, with nothing blocking the middle;"
		"&7Their wheel faces must be &cparallel&7.&r"
		""
		"&8This part of the manuscript has deep scratches, as if run over by wheel teeth. You can see this manuscript thanks to its owner having implemented a proper shutdown mechanism...&r"
	]
	quest.5372150CD0958B7B.quest_subtitle: "A processing component capable of crushing items."
	quest.5378D02C832E3260.quest_subtitle: "Food Value >= 14"
	quest.5378D02C832E3260.title: "Feast Recycling"
	quest.5394037EDC7769D9.quest_desc: [
		"&6Consecutive Shooting Treaty"
		"&7You cannot feign perfect accuracy.&r&cMissing shots eliminates all draw speed gains, instead reducing this attribute"
		"&7Precision is key.&r&aDealing ranged damage accelerates draw speed of most ranged weapons"
	]
	quest.5394037EDC7769D9.quest_subtitle: "Become Arrowhead"
	quest.5394037EDC7769D9.title: "Consecutive Shooting Treaty"
	quest.53C821423589F530.quest_subtitle: "Stage 1, unlocks Stage 2 after kill"
	quest.54207C49530C50BC.quest_desc: [
		"&6World Difficulty&r"
		"&7You may have noticed, or maybe not, that world difficulty changes aren't just simple name changes&r"
		"&7It affects mob spawn health, damage, etc.&r"
		""
		"&7&6Classic Mode&r&7: Default values&r"
		""
		"&7&6Expert Mode&r&7: &r"
		"&7Health Attack Armor ×&c1.2x&r"
		""
		"&7&6Master Mode&r&7: &r"
		"&7Health Attack Armor Armor Toughness Tracking Range ×&c1.5x&r"
		"{image:kubejs:textures/gui/difficuity_kjs.png width:180 height:50 align:center fit:true}"
		"&dSo... buddy... if you can't handle it, don't turn on high difficulty...&r"
	]
	quest.54207C49530C50BC.quest_subtitle: "Let's dedicate a chapter to difficulty here"
	quest.543F9E26F7586FFF.quest_subtitle: "Arcane Materials"
	quest.54DAB6324FA151F2.quest_desc: ["Obtain by throwing the Arcane Compendium into the Weeping Well"]
	quest.54DAB6324FA151F2.quest_subtitle: "Falling into Darkness"
	quest.54DCDB42738F0557.quest_desc: [
		"&6Inverted Heart Authority&r"
		""
		"&7Your soul is the world's soul. Your heart is the world's heart. Open heart, glimpsed by all, controlled by all.&r"
		"&7-Received &cmagic damage&r&7 quadrupled&r"
		""
		"&7Authority—treaty between your form and world's original.&r"
		"&7-Your soul opens to world; other souls seeing yours establish &econnection&r"
		"&7-Damage you receive and deal &bshares&r&7 with them&r"
	]
	quest.54DCDB42738F0557.quest_subtitle: "Forge Many Hearts into One"
	quest.54DCDB42738F0557.title: "Inverted Heart Authority"
	quest.54F1765FA7F3571B.quest_subtitle: "Rare Treasure"
	quest.551FB78D5B444E41.quest_desc: [
		"&6Arcane Restoration"
		"&7&bSoul Cauldron&r&7 has annoying quirk—it damages tools interacting with it. Even if cost inevitable when using cauldron, I'd rather pay in installments. I designed this instrument called "
		"&6Repair"
		"Pillar"
		"&r"
		"&7"
		" to repair tools when damaged."
		"&7"
		"&7Repair Pillar operation requires large amounts of &eArcane Energy&r&7 and suitable materials for repair. After items prepared, pillar searches nearby item stands, item pedestals, Soul Cauldrons for damaged items. Theoretically, should be able to repair items using only Arcane Energy... but currently just theory."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Repairing Tools"
		"&7Repair Pillar not only repairs catalysts. Many ordinary tools—even magical ones—can be repaired this way, no experience consumption, replacing intellect driving repair with &dSouls&r&7. Of course, this process still requires repair materials and restores about half durability."
		"&7"
		"&7If equipment's materials can resonate with &dSouls&r&7—directly or indirectly involving souls—then such repair methods' efficiency higher. Vast majority of tools and armor recorded in this book can restore three-quarters durability rather than half."
	]
	quest.551FB78D5B444E41.quest_subtitle: "Mysterious Repair"
	quest.551FB78D5B444E41.title: "Arcane Restoration"
	quest.553B4B865F0C526B.quest_desc: ["Want to remove curses from weapons? The properties of Prism Spiderwebs can strip away curse adhesion—though no one knows how it works."]
	quest.553B4B865F0C526B.quest_subtitle: "Remove Curses"
	quest.555729244B7C2153.quest_desc: [
		"&6Magic Essence&r"
		"&7A consumable used to increase &bspell strength&r&7 and &bspell resistance&r&7. Each has 3 tiers and usage limits. Obtained by:&r"
		"&7Strength: Dropped by &eMagical Creatures&r&7, upgraded via &6rituals&r&7.&r"
		"&7Resistance: Obtained via &eCondensers&r&7, upgraded via &6rituals&r&7.&r"
	]
	quest.555729244B7C2153.title: "&6Magic Essence: Strength&r"
	quest.55A1FBEF21D0FE68.quest_subtitle: "Stage 2"
	quest.55A79D65F67123C4.quest_desc: [
		"&6Sky-Tether Rune&r"
		""
		"&7Sky-Tether Rune's ability similar to namesake ritual, grants wearer &bSky-Tether&r&7 effect at half potency, increasing &ajump height&r&7, slightly reducing &agravity&r&7 effect, while minimally reducing &cfalldamage&r&7.&r"
	]
	quest.55A79D65F67123C4.quest_subtitle: "Lifting Pulse"
	quest.55BA0F294A5D2F55.quest_desc: ["Flowers imbued with magic will replenish the required energy when a spellcaster selects a spell but has insufficient mana."]
	quest.55BA0F294A5D2F55.quest_subtitle: "Auto Recovery"
	quest.568D517E18953F2F.quest_desc: [
		"&6Brewing Crimson Essence&r"
		""
		"&7When there is water in the cauldron, it will deal &cdamage&r&7 to creatures inside. If there is an empty potion slot, it will attempt to generate &cblood&r&7. Right-click with a glass bottle to collect &cCrimson Essence&r&7.&r"
	]
	quest.56B761C2894F3C2E.quest_desc: [
		"&7One simple application of Divine Gold is &6Soul Jars&r&7."
		""
		"&7Souls in original form massless; locking them under &eDivine Gold&r&7 good method for storage ignoring &bphysical limitations&r&7."
		""
		"&7These jars' capacity &anearly infinite&r&7, but they can only store &csingle type of soul&r&7."
	]
	quest.56B761C2894F3C2E.quest_subtitle: "Arcane Archive"
	quest.56B761C2894F3C2E.title: "Soul Storage"
	quest.56CB359C8D5426A3.quest_subtitle: "Abandon all hope, ye who enter here"
	quest.57045442B4763EC9.quest_subtitle: "Swimming Champion"
	quest.571979CF7DC3291C.quest_desc: [
		"&#FFD700Contempt - Corrosion&r&7"
		"&7When carrying the \"Contempt\" effect, it is considered as applying &#FFD700Contempt Count&r&7.&r"
		"&#00FFAA[Upon hitting an attack]&r&7 If you have the &#FFAA00Contempt&r&7 effect, increase &#FFD700Contempt Count&r&7 by 1 stack (lasting 5 seconds).&r"
		"&#00FFAA[Contempt Count ≥ 2 stacks]&r&7 Apply 1 level of &#FFD700Armor Break&r&7 to the target (lasting 30 seconds).&r"
		"&#00FFAA[Contempt Count ≥ 4 stacks]&r&7 Apply 2 levels of &#FFD700Armor Break&r&7 to the target (lasting 30 seconds).&r"
		"&#00FFAA[Contempt Count ≥ 6 stacks]&r&7 Apply 3 levels of &#FFD700Armor Break&r&7 to the target (lasting 30 seconds).&r"
		"&#00FFAA[Contempt Count ≥ 8 stacks]&r&7 Apply 4 levels of &#FFD700Armor Break&r&7 to the target (lasting 30 seconds).&r"
		"&#00FFAA[Contempt Count ≥ 10 stacks]&r&7 Apply 5 levels of &#FFD700Armor Break&r&7 to the target (lasting 30 seconds).&r"
		"&7"
		"&#00FFAA[Per stack of Contempt Count]&r&7 Increases your attack damage by 10%, but reduces attack speed by 5% (attack speed reduction max 50%).&r"
	]
	quest.5731A86EC589BF22.quest_desc: [
		"&7Are you tired of placing &bblocks&r&7 one by one?&r"
		"&7Don't worry! The &bBuilding Wand&r&7 can place multiple blocks at once!!!&r"
		""
		"&7Whether you're a &bmaster architect&r&7 with intricate designs or have simple building needs, it's highly recommended!&r"
	]
	quest.5731A86EC589BF22.quest_subtitle: "Artisan Skill"
	quest.57D76B1B33C57F9F.quest_desc: ["Though you've swum so long you probably don't need these, I'll still give them to you, because I don't know what else to give... how about some aquatic specialties?"]
	quest.57D76B1B33C57F9F.quest_subtitle: "Then let me ask you, why don't I just take a boat?"
	quest.58CA43B9AA0530E2.quest_subtitle: "Stage 2"
	quest.58DE58D4F8290C1C.quest_desc: [
		"&7This item was obtained by chance during my travels."
		""
		"However, with my current shallow understanding, I cannot yet comprehend the mysteries hidden within."
		""
		"&7If I wish to survive in such circumstances, I must acquire some reliable means. The knowledge sealed within this scroll may be the key."
	]
	quest.58DE58D4F8290C1C.quest_subtitle: "Novel Power"
	quest.58DE58D4F8290C1C.title: "Magic Scroll"
	quest.58FD71F9C065E1AC.quest_desc: ["&7Try your luck?&r"]
	quest.58FD71F9C065E1AC.quest_subtitle: "Random Spell + Random Tier"
	quest.593ABE7FAC454B34.quest_desc: [
		"&6Ailment Expulsion Rune&r"
		""
		"&7Ailment Expulsion Rune urges form to catalyze, transform, and change substances, aiming to accelerate processing and dispelling speed of &cnegative effects&r&7, overcoming them at beyond normal speed.&r"
	]
	quest.593ABE7FAC454B34.quest_subtitle: "Pulse Promoting Processing"
	quest.5A8ACB926DFAB615.quest_subtitle: "You will receive a beginner's gift pack"
	quest.5A8ACB926DFAB615.title: "&a\"Honey Sugar Masking Suffering at the Beginning\""
	quest.5A8B7CD00226572C.quest_subtitle: "Stage 1"
	quest.5AEF01E9FF0A0727.quest_desc: [
		"&bUpgraded version of Lead"
		""
		"&bLeft-click animals (invalid on other targets) to store them inside, right-click ground to release."
		""
		"&dNo one knows the internal construction principle of this rope... not even Endermen."
	]
	quest.5AEF01E9FF0A0727.quest_subtitle: "Poké Ball"
	quest.5B941F073DDCD277.quest_subtitle: "Consuming twisted products will increase sanity instead of decreasing it"
	quest.5B941F073DDCD277.title: "&a\"Sweet Dew Blooming Amidst Decay\""
	quest.5BDB153064430D05.quest_desc: [
		"&6Research: Aura Embers"
		"&7After passing through &dCrying Well&r&7, &eBlaze Powder&r&7 transformed into substance I call "
		"&6Aura"
		"Embers"
		"&r"
		"&7"
		". Ethereal golden flames, also solid tangible objects. Burns like charcoal, but its flames unrelated to combustion process."
		"&7"
		"&7Though such brilliant substance stands out among all materials obtained from well, it still follows similar pattern. Well strips certain components from input materials—impurities, material components, something more hidden—all possible. In this case, stripped seems everything except pure flame, output being embodiment of change."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Reexamination: Aura Embers"
		"&7Unlike previous conception, well doesn't strip things. Rather &creverses&r&7 them, replacing with void-like similar substances. Aura Embers probably purest example: all things not belonging to &cEvolution Essence&r&7 shrouded in void shadow, produced material &afar&r&7 more perfect than "
		"suited"
		"for"
		"certain"
		"use"
		"."
	]
	quest.5BDB153064430D05.quest_subtitle: "Essence of Evolution"
	quest.5C10F3B6A94BA227.quest_desc: [
		"&7In short, iron mundane. Tuning iron with &6Soul Stone&r&7 creates steel simultaneously in-phase and out-of-phase with world—&5Soul-Stained Steel&r&7."
		""
		"&7Anything made from &5Soul-Stained Steel&r&7 inherently possesses ability to shatter souls, no need for scythe's precise processing skills."
		""
		"&6But directly wearing armor made solely from Soul-Stained Steel quite dangerous, because my soul also affected. Need countermeasure."
	]
	quest.5C10F3B6A94BA227.quest_subtitle: "Smelt Reality"
	quest.5C6B5AC7571785F6.quest_desc: [
		"&6Speed Controller&r"
		""
		"&6Usage&r  "
		"&7Before use, place a &eLarge Cogwheel&7 on its top. Both the top Large Cogwheel and the drive shaft at the controller's bottom can serve as stress input or output.&r"
		""
		"&7Aim at the speed display interface on the controller's surface and long right-click to precisely adjust the output &aspeed&7 and &arotation direction&7.&r"
		""
		"&7If power is input from the bottom shaft, the controller regulates the top Large Cogwheel's speed and direction. If power is input from the top Large Cogwheel, the controller regulates the bottom shaft's output.&r"
		""
		"&7You can think of it as an automatic transmission—but note: When setting a high output speed, ensure the power source has sufficient &cstress capacity&7, or the system may overload.&r"
		""
		"&8This page of the manuscript is torn.&r"
	]
	quest.5C6B5AC7571785F6.quest_subtitle: "A transmission component that can maintain a constant speed."
	quest.5C83331F724444D7.quest_subtitle: "Arcane Materials"
	quest.5CF40BE797380E84.quest_desc: [
		"&7After many failed attempts, I successfully embedded &6Soul Stone&r&7 into weapon, stably &6harvesting Soul Crystals&r&7."
		""
		"&7Its elongated blade allows ample time for form's death before soul-crushing blow, granting it wide-range &csweeping attack&r&7 ability. Not as sharp as sword, but sufficient for my needs."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7What previously required careful laborious experiments, scythe accomplishes in seconds. Souls of monsters I kill shatter upon impact, sending some richly colored substance—&6Soul Crystals&r&7—to my hands. Finally, my research can formally begin."
	]
	quest.5CF40BE797380E84.quest_subtitle: "Harvest"
	quest.5CF40BE797380E84.title: "Any Scythe"
	quest.5D095029A0B8B414.quest_subtitle: "mcmod.cn"
	quest.5E01EC2AC8CE43F0.quest_desc: [
		"&6Graveyard&r"
		"&7This new structure belongs to the &8Soul Sand Valley&r&7, a land where &cdeath&r&7 reigns. &cNecromancers&r&7 are naturally drawn to such places, so you will surely find them here.&r"
	]
	quest.5E01EC2AC8CE43F0.title: "&6Graveyard&r"
	quest.5E3B1B0AB352F0F3.quest_subtitle: "Familiar Summoning Ritual"
	quest.5E69573B6AA70AFA.quest_desc: [
		"&6Acceleration Lining&r"
		""
		"&7Acceleration Lining utilizes components with excellent magic conduction in strange fabrics, greatly increasing &aFocus Speed&r&7 of &eCauldron&r&7 without any negative side effects.&r"
	]
	quest.5E69573B6AA70AFA.quest_subtitle: "Double Down"
	quest.5E69992403F40955.quest_subtitle: "Familiar Summoning Ritual"
	quest.5EEB1A77BA0D052D.quest_subtitle: "A utility tool for locating Weeping Wells."
	quest.5F1C1AA992472C3D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Heretical Rune&r"
		""
		"&7Heretical Rune disassembles magic, thereby &csilencing&r&7 enemies, similar to Erosion Scepter. This effect weakens their &eSoul Magic&r&7, effect itself stackable to completely suppress opponent's &cmagic ability&r&7.&r"
	]
	quest.5F1C1AA992472C3D.quest_subtitle: "Destroy Created Things"
	quest.5FFB29607E15D805.quest_desc: [
		"&6Defiance Treaty"
		"&7Magic transforms your perception of death: damage increasingly &cpainful&r&7.&r&cMaximum health reduced by one-fifth"
		"&7Unnatural recovery ability infused into form: eternal &agrowth&r&7 &adesire&r&7.&r&aHealth recovery from saturation doubled, tripled near death&r&aReceived healing increased by four-tenths"
	]
	quest.5FFB29607E15D805.quest_subtitle: "Defy Limitations"
	quest.5FFB29607E15D805.title: "Defiance Treaty"
	quest.6038063D7681AFB5.quest_subtitle: "Food Value >= 14"
	quest.6038063D7681AFB5.title: "Feast Recycling x32"
	quest.609ED89F7E454DCA.quest_desc: [
		"&eThe energy inside is exceptionally volatile."
		"&6Speed doubled, high temperature surging, a performance leap."
		""
		"⚡ Speed: 2.0x | ♨ Temperature: 4000 | ⏳ Consumption: 0.2"
		""
		"&aTip&r&7: &f♨ &r&7Temperature determines the material grade that can be processed, ⚡ Speed affects processing time, ⏳ Consumption represents fuel durability."
	]
	quest.609ED89F7E454DCA.quest_subtitle: "Over-limit Combustion"
	quest.60BAD1C5ADE6C33A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Research: Malicious Lead"
		"&7After passing through &dCrying Well&r&7, &eDeepslate Orichalcum&r&7 converts into &cMalicious Lead&r&7. Various arcane energies bound to gold mostly transformed into &cEvil Arcane Energy&r&7, this metal thus falling from alchemist's altar, becoming lowest material."
		"&7"
		"&7Arcane energy in metal also roughly halved. Because stripped by well, or transformed into something I haven't separated and identified? Both possible. This possibly related to &8Void Slate's&r&7 demonstrated arcane interaction ability..."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Reexamination: Malicious Lead"
		"&7Currently only have &cMalicious Lead&r&7 method to examine physical form of &8Shadow Crystals&r&7—precisely lost half arcane mass, what other reason possible?"
		"&7"
		"&7Separating microcrystals in &eDeepslate Orichalcum&r&7, separating evil crystals in &cMalicious Lead&r&7, neither yielded results yet. But before obtaining more materials, this best approach to study &8Shadow Arcane Energy&r&7 structure."
	]
	quest.60BAD1C5ADE6C33A.quest_subtitle: "Turn Marvelous into Decayed"
	quest.60C42244ED37BA5F.quest_desc: [
		"&7It seems this world is not as peaceful as I had anticipated. The strange forces emerging constantly are completely beyond my past understanding..."
		""
		"Perhaps it should be called 'magic'?"
		""
		"&7Fortunately, I still have a few scrolls in my pack, which may contain clues to guide my way forward."
	]
	quest.60C42244ED37BA5F.quest_subtitle: "Magical Creations"
	quest.61A037D46536F93D.quest_subtitle: "Arcane Materials"
	quest.61AD6CC3CE0AC9F4.quest_subtitle: "Global Options"
	quest.629600F80E05353F.quest_desc: [
		"&7When Security Manager added to storage network, default all players cannot access."
		""
		"Fallback Security Card defines permissions for players without corresponding security cards."
		""
		"&7Configuration interface same as security card."
	]
	quest.629600F80E05353F.quest_subtitle: "&mFallback Hidden Abili...Security...!"
	quest.62BC3698FC1100EF.quest_desc: [
		"&6Crude Knife&r"
		""
		"&7Crude knives are key for making first batch of pattern boards. They're not very durable but cheap.&r"
		""
		"&7First you need some &cCrude Tool Parts&r&7. They're crafted from cobblestone, dirt, and sticks.&r"
		""
		"&7Then craft your crude knife with cobblestone and crude tool parts.&r"
	]
	quest.62F882E969E15846.quest_subtitle: "For Casting Grains"
	quest.62FCCE8BC35F8C17.quest_desc: [
		"&7To compensate for limitations of single material performance, I developed the Recrystallizer."
		""
		"This device can fuse multiple input items, supporting up to four component combinations. Final crystallized material parameters vary based on input item types and proportions."
		""
		"&eComprehensive calculation based on main component (first item in placement) and each item's rarity."
	]
	quest.631BFAA4FFA96698.quest_desc: ["Can directly retrieve items from network to edit patterns"]
	quest.631BFAA4FFA96698.quest_subtitle: "Make Patterns"
	quest.633B88042B030B5E.quest_subtitle: "The long night... hardest to endure~"
	quest.63423F9C2A3931E5.quest_subtitle: "One Tree at a Time"
	quest.634CBFD54B22E624.quest_desc: [
		"&6Brass Funnel&r"
		""
		"&6Usage&r"
		"&7Its basic usage is almost identical to the Andesite Funnel. The core difference is that the Brass Funnel allows finer control: it supports &eitem filtering&7 and can set the &enumber of items transferred per operation&7.&r"
		"&7In output mode, look at its filter slot and scroll the mouse wheel to adjust the output quantity per operation, up to &c64 items&7.&r"
		""
		"&6Additional Notes&r"
		"&7The Brass Funnel can output up to one full stack per operation.&r"
		"&7When in downward-facing output mode, it only continues outputting if it detects no item entities in the block space below; if items are already piled there, it pauses.&r"
		""
		"&8It's smart enough to know when to stop.&r"
	]
	quest.646E435B163FDF29.quest_subtitle: "Arcane Materials"
	quest.64AC4146C392E8A6.quest_desc: [
		"&#CC88FFEnvy - Corrosion&r&7"
		"&7When carrying the \"Envy\" effect, it is considered as applying &#CC88FFEnvy Count&r&7.&r"
		"&#00FFAA[Upon hitting an attack]&r&7 If you have the &#FFAA00Envy&r&7 effect, transfer all status effects from the target to yourself (single effect transfer up to 200 ticks). After successful transfer, increase &#CC88FFEnvy Count&r&7 by a number of stacks equal to the number of transferred effects.&r"
		"&#00FFAA[Every 2 seconds]&r&7 &#CC88FFEnvy Count&r&7 stacks decrease by 1 (minimum 0 stacks).&r"
		"&7"
		"&#00FFAA[When dealing damage]&r&7 If you have the &#FFAA00Envy&r&7 effect, increase this damage by (&#CC88FFEnvy Count&r&7 × 3%) times, up to a maximum of 2 times.&r"
	]
	quest.651B146F0F9BEA1D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Mechanical Press&r"
		""
		"&6Pressing&r"
		"&7Processes item entities or items on a &eConveyor Belt/Depot&r&7.&r"
		"&7Primarily used to press metal ingots into &eMetal Sheets&r&7.&r"
		""
		"&6Shaping&r"
		"&7Processes items inside a &eMixing Basin&r&7.&r"
		"&7Used to craft products from multiple ingredients.&r"
		""
		"&6Auto-Compacting&r"
		"&7Processes items inside a &eMixing Basin&r&7.&r"
		"&7Used to execute &c4*4&r&7 or &c9*9&r&7 single-material crafting recipes.&r"
	]
	quest.65823964A5871AED.quest_desc: ["&dCompared to the previous generation product, this version appears much more stable, even containing some resistant creatures... handle as you wish.&r"]
	quest.65823964A5871AED.quest_subtitle: "Master Ball"
	quest.65B3DDCC5C5B7361.quest_desc: [
		"&6Mechanical Hand&r"
		""
		"&6Usage&r"
		"&7The Mechanical Hand has two operating modes: Use and Attack. Use a Wrench to toggle between them.&r"
		""
		"&6Use Mode&r"
		"&7The Mechanical Hand defaults to Use/Place mode, simulating player right-click behavior.&r"
		"&7In this mode, it can place blocks, operate doors, shear sheep, etc.—essentially perform any action achievable via right-click in Survival mode.&r"
		"&7When given tools or items, enchantments apply and durability is consumed; when given food, it can feed entities.&r"
		""
		"&6Attack/Break Mode&r"
		"&7Simulates player left-click behavior, including attacking entities and breaking blocks. When given weapons or tools, enchantments apply and durability is consumed.&r"
		"&7Entities killed by the Mechanical Hand are treated as player kills, dropping appropriate loot and experience.&r"
		"&7The Mechanical Hand's attacks are always fully charged, regardless of its operating speed.&r"
		""
		"&6Operation Mechanism&r"
		"&7When powered, the Mechanical Hand's forearm rhythmically extends and retracts, executing one use or attack action at full extension.&r"
		"&7The complete work cycle is: Extend → Use/Attack → Retract → Wait.&r"
		"&7The frequency is determined by its speed (RPM). Its effective operating speed range is &c4 RPM&7 to &c256 RPM&7; speed changes beyond this range do not affect efficiency.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7The Mechanical Hand's target is always the block or entity within the *second block* directly in front of it, unaffected by intervening blocks.&r"
		"&6The Mechanical Hand will stop working in the following situations:&r"
		"&7Item overflow;"
		"&7No power input;"
		"&7Holding an item in its item form of the target block;"
		"&7Holding a bucket of the target fluid;"
		"&7Receiving a redstone signal (if activated mid-cycle, it will finish the current cycle before stopping).&r"
		""
		"&6Item Storage and Access&r"
		"&7The Mechanical Hand has internal storage for one stack of items. Items can be input or output via logistics components.&r"
		"&7Place an item or filter in its filter slot to mark items forbidden from output.&r"
		"&7When performing actions that generate drops (shearing, breaking blocks, killing entities), the products go directly into its internal storage. If storage already contains items, it enters an overflow state.&r"
		""
		"&6Item Overflow State&r"
		"&7The Mechanical Hand enters an overflow state when:&r"
		"&7It stores more than one type of item;"
		"&7The internal item does not match the item set in the filter slot.&r"
		"&7In overflow state, it stops working. It must have the extra items removed via logistics components to resume.&r"
		"&7Placing the tool being used in the filter slot prevents it from being accidentally output.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Feeding/Breeding&r"
		"&7In Use mode, the Mechanical Hand can consume held food to feed entities or players. Fed entities enter breeding mode; players restore hunger and saturation, and gain status effects from the food.&r"
		""
		"&6Item Processing&r"
		"&7The Mechanical Hand must be placed above a Depot or Conveyor Belt to perform processing operations on items there. Specific applications are detailed in related instructions.&r"
		""
		"&6Contraptions&r"
		"&7A Mechanical Hand on a moving Contraption continues to function normally, but its held item is not displayed.&r"
		"&7Right-click a Mechanical Hand on a contraption to give items directly, or use a Wrench to toggle its mode.&r"
		"&7A Mechanical Hand on a contraption can automatically retrieve items from the contraption's storage and can also send overflow items back to that storage.&r"
		"&7When a deployed Schematic is placed in its filter slot, the Mechanical Hand will call blocks from the contraption's storage according to the schematic and place them. This feature can be used to build automation systems like '&e3D Printers&7'.&r"
		""
		"&8It can do what you do—just more stubborn, and more tireless.&r"
	]
	quest.65B599AA9888FBF2.quest_desc: [
		"&6Stellar Component&r"
		""
		"&7Activating harmonic crystals cast in star-core depths, Stellar Component unconditionally stabilizes fundamental framework of &eTuning Process&r&7, making its strength permanently enhanced."
	]
	quest.65B599AA9888FBF2.quest_subtitle: "Stellar Blessing"
	quest.660EAD8BBC2734CA.quest_desc: [
		" &#FFAA00Sloth - Corrosion&r&7"
		"&7Normal attack multiplier is &#00AA000.8 times&r&7, and you have &#00AA0035% damage reduction&r&7.&r"
		"&#00FFAA[Upon taking damage]&r&7 If you have the &#FFAA00Sloth&r&7 effect, accumulate the damage taken. When accumulated damage reaches (10 + 5 × Sloth level) points, enter the &#FFAA00\"Wake-up Anger\"&r&7 state (lasting 100 seconds), attack multiplier increases to &#00AA001.0~10.0 times&r&7, and reset accumulated damage.&r"
		"&#00FFAA[When tossing a coin]&r&7 If you are in the &#FFAA00\"Wake-up Anger\"&r&7 state, make the probability of the lowest value (1) the same as the probability of any other value.&r"
		"&#00FFAA[Upon hitting an attack]&r&7 If you are in the &#FFAA00\"Wake-up Anger\"&r&7 state, remove the &#FFAA00\"Wake-up Anger\"&r&7 state, and grant yourself &#FF5555Blindness III&r&7, &#FF5555Darkness III&r&7, &#FF5555Bad Omen III&r&7, &#FF5555Slowness III&r&7 (lasting 10 seconds) and &#FFAA00Resistance IV&r&7 (lasting 9 seconds).&r"
	]
	quest.660EAD8BBC2734CA.quest_subtitle: "Sloth Corrosion"
	quest.66481C79877E0ED7.quest_subtitle: "Food Value >= 14"
	quest.66481C79877E0ED7.title: "Feast Recycling x10"
	quest.664DF00DAF0D957A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Flame Comfort Rune&r"
		""
		"&7Flame Comfort Rune toughens skin when wearer on fire, granting certain amount of &aresistance&r&7 to various damage types received. However, does nothing about &cflames&r&7 currently burning.&r"
	]
	quest.664DF00DAF0D957A.quest_subtitle: "Fuel Burning Things"
	quest.66B362ABCF6C2B8D.quest_desc: [
		"&7Stone resists change, but energy releasing souls also unstoppable."
		""
		"&7Forcing change with &6Primordial Arcane Energy&r&7 creates stone with practical magical properties. Using &bSacred Arcane Energy&r&7 as catalyst forms &5Tainted Stone&r&7, stone that dissolves surrounding magic."
	]
	quest.66B362ABCF6C2B8D.quest_subtitle: "Arcane Saturation"
	quest.66B362ABCF6C2B8D.title: "Soul Stone"
	quest.66D8D31B50D06630.quest_subtitle: "Hero of the Village...?"
	quest.66E6753DF809DA3D.quest_desc: ["After placing pattern, can select and start auto-crafting within terminal."]
	quest.66E6753DF809DA3D.quest_subtitle: "Assembly Line Work"
	quest.66EA89C1E75509EB.quest_subtitle: "&6\"Once this step is taken, there's no turning back\""
	quest.66EA89C1E75509EB.title: "&cAdditional Suffering"
	quest.66F8BBB3BC24A7FF.quest_desc: [
		"&dThis rope entwined with eerie aura can capture the souls of most creatures..."
		""
		"&5Perhaps paired with a spawner, they can be resurrected?&r"
	]
	quest.66F8BBB3BC24A7FF.quest_subtitle: "Origin Ball"
	quest.67A539CCFEDE8EBC.quest_subtitle: "Stage 2"
	quest.67F1B7217A46DF7E.quest_desc: [
		"&eSeems to have faint screams echoing."
		"&6Low consumption brings long-lasting power."
		""
		"⚡ Speed: 1.0x | ♨ Temperature: 3000 | ⏳ Consumption: 0.1"
		""
		"&aTip&r&7: &f♨ &r&7Temperature determines the material grade that can be processed, ⚡ Speed affects processing time, ⏳ Consumption represents fuel durability."
	]
	quest.67F1B7217A46DF7E.quest_subtitle: "Burning Souls"
	quest.680583B3F5EF1CC2.quest_desc: [
		"&6Caustic Catalyzer&r"
		""
		"&7&cInfernal Fire&r&7 and &bAzure Water&r&7 violently combine, this combination usually driving change and destruction. Caustic Catalyzer increases &aTuning Strength&r&7 of &eCauldron System&r&7 when destabilization risk rises, i.e., trading impending violent reaction for powerful force.&r"
	]
	quest.680583B3F5EF1CC2.quest_subtitle: "Destabilizing Flaming"
	quest.6806A98E4CD7F885.quest_desc: [
		"&2Players can store enchantment books in it to convert into corresponding enchantment experience, which can be used to split or merge enchantment books."
		""
		"&cRetrieving enchantment books consumes corresponding enchantment experience, with exponential growth as levels increase."
		""
		"&2This mechanism reduces equipment modification times; a top-tier equipment might only need 1 modification instead of 4-5, significantly saving experience."
		""
		"&7Can be harvested barehanded, using a pickaxe speeds it up. Can be upgraded to Alexander Library through infusion."
		""
		"&eMining and upgrading will not lose stored enchantments."
	]
	quest.6806A98E4CD7F885.quest_subtitle: "Right here, may you find the books you seek"
	quest.68780331B0515EB6.quest_desc: [
		"&6Reckless Fist Oath&r"
		""
		"&7Impulse in soul makes you act without thought.&r"
		"&7-&cSpell Bullets&r&7 fire immediately after charging complete&r"
		""
		"&7Impulse infused into form and soul.&r"
		"&7-&aSpell&r&7 charge time halved&r"
	]
	quest.68780331B0515EB6.quest_subtitle: "Never Hesitate"
	quest.68780331B0515EB6.title: "Reckless Fist Oath"
	quest.68954EBEC12D958D.quest_subtitle: "Stage 3"
	quest.68EF2FB94A761FFD.quest_desc: [
		"&aI often hear term "
		"wisdom"
		", referring to what others call experience."
		""
		"&6Its link to soul not strong, but it's part of soul, collectible and reusable for enchanting and repair."
		""
		"&eMost don't know it can also condense physical form."
		""
		"I've heard rumors they drop from ores, but &6most reliable source is small ore clusters at soul dissipation sites&f, experience left by souls engraved onto rock."
	]
	quest.68EF2FB94A761FFD.quest_subtitle: "Experience Substance"
	quest.6A03DEB0CCE71AF2.quest_desc: [
		"&6Armor Plate&r"
		"&7A consumable used to increase a familiar's &aarmor value&r&7. There are 3 tiers, each with a usage limit."
	]
	quest.6AC481C1ADA516D4.quest_desc: [
		"&7When creature dies, its soul dissipates. Basic theory, proven by many instances."
		""
		"&7Also said occasionally this energy remains in creature's form upon death, explaining their reactant drops. But this claim unproven."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7But now, with &5Scythe&r&7 in hand, proving easy. When soul shatters, its energy collides with remaining physical shell, even if contact extremely brief."
		""
		"&4This collision can create brand-new reactants, simply destroying form cannot produce. This phenomenon seems to drive powerful reaction, causing certain change."
		""
		"&7I've discovered multiple reactants born from this process, detailed below."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7In summary:"
		"&7Zombie flesh congeals into &2Decaying Essence&r"
		""
		"&7Skeleton bones crystallize into &8Chilly Bone Stone&r"
		""
		"&7Phantom wings twirl into &bAstral Fabric&r"
		""
		"&7Whirlwind essence continues as &eGale Condensed Core&r"
		""
		"&7Enderman magic solidifies into &5Twisted Energy Flow&r"
		""
		"&7Illager bones corrode into &#AA4AFFShadow Soul"
		""
		"&7Various mages' energy sanctifies into &dLight Soul"
	]
	quest.6AC481C1ADA516D4.quest_subtitle: "Leaking Magic"
	quest.6AE8CFDBDC8CF939.quest_subtitle: "Crafting Supplies"
	quest.6AF6ADCEE5546549.quest_desc: [
		"&7Before this, I limited Soul Magic to self-enhancement and material creation."
		"&7But now, I'll influence world."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7To initiate Totem Magic, need to engrave &dSoul Arcane Energy&r&7 into &6Rune Wood Logs&r&7, forming &bSigils&r&7 representing that energy."
		"&7If sigil not needed, can remove with axe."
		"&7I already have concept: prepare &eTotem Base&r&7 of rune wood, then engrave specific sigil combinations onto &6Totem Poles&r&7 above it to activate &5Soul Rituals&r&7."
		""
		"&7Various rituals' functions differ, but patterns exist, can be categorized."
		"&7Soul Rituals either affect nearby creatures' &csouls&r&7, or affect surrounding material world's &dArcane Structure&r&7."
		"&7Both ways showcasing Soul Arcane Energy's power use certain "
		"&bRitual"
		"Site"
		"&r"
		"&7"
		", i.e., guided &eEnergy Sparks&r&7 woven by totems."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Signal Totem Control"
		"&7Totems' nature determines their &cchaos&r&7; when multiple rituals coexist, order of effect activation extremely difficult to keep consistent."
		"&7Inspired by Signal Crafting research, I designed solution."
		""
		"&7Normally, Soul Rituals only activate after collecting sufficient energy from world's spontaneous arcane flow."
		"&7For &bSignal Totem Base&r&7, this energy remains in "
		"&ereserved"
		"&r"
		"&7"
		" state until receiving &credstone pulse&r&7."
		"&7When organizing multiple rituals, can use &6Redstone Observer&r&7 to find exact time point rituals can activate."
		""
		"&7Timing pulse to Signal Totem Base may be difficult."
		"&7Note: continuous signal unnecessary; base's internal circuit only recognizes pulse at signal start."
	]
	quest.6AF6ADCEE5546549.quest_subtitle: "&6Miracle Manifested in World"
	quest.6AF6ADCEE5546549.title: "Totem Magic"
	quest.6B475F80CCD29781.quest_subtitle: "Crafting Supplies"
	quest.6B82BD57F8A68CEE.quest_subtitle: "Familiar Summoning Ritual"
	quest.6B97738CD8E10A57.quest_desc: [
		"&6Self-Maintenance Treaty"
		"&7Hunger is losing self.&r&cLow hunger values drastically accelerate health decline"
		"&7Feast, enjoy food, cleanse soul.&r&aFood restores more saturation&r&aConsuming food clears negative effects"
	]
	quest.6B97738CD8E10A57.quest_subtitle: "Maintain Self"
	quest.6B97738CD8E10A57.title: "Self-Maintenance Treaty"
	quest.6BF48D5C9D1B191A.quest_desc: [
		"&7To compensate for inconvenience of terminal networks' lack of portability, I developed Portable Terminal."
		""
		"Although single storage capacity limited, larger disk capacity allows more items accommodated."
	]
	quest.6BF48D5C9D1B191A.quest_subtitle: "Portable Space"
	quest.6C0395DDA06A6B98.quest_subtitle: "For Casting Plates"
	quest.6CF68E9E0A3CB0E7.quest_desc: [
		"&7Natural Quartz, aptly named, is naturally occurring &6Nether Quartz&r&7 equivalent. Most uses same as Nether Quartz."
		""
		"&eQuite rare&r&7, found deep underground, often forming &6geodes&r&7."
	]
	quest.6D571AC85912D827.quest_desc: [
		"&6Rune Substrate&r"
		"&7The foundation for crafting all other runes. A small amount can be found in some &bvanilla structures&r&7, and they are more common in &cIron Magic&r&7 structures. Each type of mage drops one rune of the same type upon death (except for the Necromancer).&r"
	]
	quest.6D571AC85912D827.quest_subtitle: "Arcane Materials"
	quest.6D7E037569A98460.quest_desc: [
		"&6High Priest Treaty"
		"&7Extremely invasive control brings harm.&r&cAfter being hit, interaction distance gains enter cooldown&r&cDuring gain cooldown, movement speed reduced"
		"&7Whole world is yours.&r&aBlock interaction distance increased by one-fifth, entity interaction distance increased by one-tenth"
	]
	quest.6D7E037569A98460.quest_subtitle: "Extend Self Thin"
	quest.6D7E037569A98460.title: "High Priest Treaty"
	quest.6DFFACFA9209ECA1.quest_subtitle: "Arcane Materials"
	quest.6E0EE5297B295288.quest_subtitle: "&eAll neutral creatures will become hostile to you"
	quest.6E0EE5297B295288.title: "&e\"Impure Body No Longer Possesses Purity\""
	quest.6E25E82DBD18D2C8.quest_subtitle: "&cThe world will fall into eternal night"
	quest.6E25E82DBD18D2C8.title: "&c\"Eternal Journey Under Lightless Long Night\""
	quest.6E995B7F0867CE19.quest_subtitle: "Familiar Summoning Ritual"
	quest.6EFBE085639D2967.quest_desc: [
		"&7&ePattern Base&r&7 can be used to make various weapon component bases. Though less convenient than reusable blueprints, they're cheap and easy to operate.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7&ePatterns&r&7 are similar to blueprints but only usable once. &eBlueprints&r&7 can be used infinitely. If you don't yet have paper or blue dye to synthesize blueprint paper, patterns are a good alternative.&r"
		""
		"&7Patterns require &ePattern Boards&r&7. Pattern boards require &eKnives&r&7 or &eDaggers&r&7 and &eStone Anvils&r&7 to make. Place logs on stone anvil, then right-click with knife. Sometimes other mods' knives may work. You might not have knife blueprint yet, so first craft a &cCrude Knife&r&7.&r"
	]
	quest.6F1B0D7041FBCD4B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Boulder Protection Rune&r"
		""
		"&7Boulder Protection Rune's ability similar to namesake ritual, grants wearer &bBoulder Protection&r&7 effect at half potency, slightly reducing received &adamage&r&7, enhanced when unarmored.&r"
	]
	quest.6F1B0D7041FBCD4B.quest_subtitle: "Guardian Pulse"
	quest.6F5E956AAA173600.quest_subtitle: "For Casting Ingots"
	quest.6F6ACDE9BCEFD6A5.quest_desc: [
		"&6Cloud-Leaper Treaty"
		"&7What you rely on will eventually destroy you.&r&cFalldamage doubled"
		"&7Gravity—most difficult force to defy.&r&aStrong wind's propulsion increased, granting Soaring&r&aSoaring state enhances aerial mobility"
	]
	quest.6F6ACDE9BCEFD6A5.quest_subtitle: "Fly Over All Things"
	quest.6F6ACDE9BCEFD6A5.title: "Cloud-Leaper Treaty"
	quest.6F7065E85A4EE4DA.quest_desc: ["Can be used to trace my crafted item records, quite practical for someone as forgetful as me."]
	quest.6F7065E85A4EE4DA.quest_subtitle: "I'll Always Stone Sword You....Forever..."
	quest.6F7643BD60F5534F.quest_subtitle: "Big Spoon"
	quest.6F7DF3491AA2E9DF.quest_desc: [
		"&6Parasitic Treaty"
		"&7Your vulnerabilities still cannot be ignored.&r&cReceived healing reduced by four-tenths"
		"&7Excess confidence infused into consciousness, pain no longer important.&r&aHarvesting souls grants damage absorption"
	]
	quest.6F7DF3491AA2E9DF.quest_subtitle: "Steal Shield to Support Self"
	quest.6F7DF3491AA2E9DF.title: "Parasitic Treaty"
	quest.701467707AD4CCE8.quest_subtitle: "For Casting Gems"
	quest.70195B5ED5D18F70.quest_desc: [
		"&6Sky-Splitter Treaty"
		"&7Blood feud repaid with destruction.&r&cReceived knockback doubled"
		"&7Gravity—strongest force imposed on others.&r&aReceiving falldamage automatically attacks nearby creatures&r&aDealing falldamage attacks target regardless of distance"
	]
	quest.70195B5ED5D18F70.quest_subtitle: "Strike Down All Things"
	quest.70195B5ED5D18F70.title: "Sky-Splitter Treaty"
	quest.712A04EBF3733C96.quest_desc: [
		"&7Material Grader can grade most materials supported by Silent Gear, with different grades correspondingly enhancing components and equipment made."
		""
		"&3Grade differences affect many material parameters. Grading levels include: E, D, C, B, A, S, SS, SSS, Dream."
		""
		"&eThis device requires catalyst to operate: grader's second input slot is for catalyst. Each grading consumes catalyst and increases average grading level based on catalyst's own grade. Simply put, higher quality catalyst yields higher possible final grading level."
		""
		"&7Graded materials placed back into grader will be re-evaluated. If higher grade obtained, overwrites original; if same or lower grade, no change, but catalyst still consumed."
	]
	quest.712A04EBF3733C96.quest_subtitle: "Upgrade!"
	quest.713CA5306C2B86A2.quest_desc: [
		"&6Redstone Link&r"
		""
		"&7Place two Redstone Links facing each other. Hold a &eCopper Wire Spool&7 and right-click each link in turn; a powered connection will form between them. The spool is consumed, and an empty spool is returned. Once connected, energy can flow between them.&r"
		""
		"&8If either Redstone Link is broken, the connection severs, dropping four Copper Wires.&r"
		""
		"&7One pull, one link, one line—energy flows.&r"
	]
	quest.727E7E58CDD35234.quest_desc: [
		"&7To compensate for limitations of single material performance, I developed &6Alloy Furnace&r&7."
		""
		"&7This device can fuse multiple input items, supporting up to four component combinations. Final &ematerial parameters&r&7 vary based on input item types and proportions&r"
		""
		"&7&eBased on main component&r&7 (first item in placement) and each item's &erarity&r&7 for comprehensive calculation.&r"
	]
	quest.7306BEC7A3E98304.quest_subtitle: "Undead"
	quest.731473A765D3B6B6.quest_desc: [
		"&7When searching for traces of &dArcane Energy&r&7 everywhere, most commonly found is &bEthereal Air Energy&r&7."
		"&7All &eweather phenomena&r&7 carry faint imprint of Ethereal Air Energy; but essentially, they lack soul form, only &8residual memory&r&7 of their impact on world."
		"&7Their influence dissipated, but with little effort can restore."
		""
		"&7Everywhere retains these &bGale Memories&r&7, lost gale's power, only drifting about."
		"&7However, infusing with &eEthereal Air Energy&r&7 can reweave these memories using &dArcane Energy&r&7 flow, restoring them."
		"&7Thus again able to influence world."
		"&7Based on existing uses, using &6Wind Bombs&r&7 and &aGale Condensed Cores&r&7, I found two new applications for this effect."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Gale Activator"
		"&7Wind Bombs carry scattering memory. Chaotic nature, thus releases upon impact."
		"&7When activated by redstone, Gale Activator weaves &bGale&r&7 pushing all surrounding things outward."
		"&7Artisan's Claw can configure effect's strength and specific form."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Wind Tunnel Device"
		"&7Gale Condensed Cores captured from strong winds, more powerful, directional."
		"&7When activated by connected Gale Activator, Wind Tunnel Device continuously weaves upward-blowing &eWind Column&r&7, moving most objects and creatures."
		"&7Artisan's Claw can configure effect's distance and direction."
	]
	quest.731473A765D3B6B6.quest_subtitle: "Generate Airflow"
	quest.731473A765D3B6B6.title: "Gale Weaving"
	quest.73689A06F7BF9EB3.quest_desc: ["Can be used to make custom accessories"]
	quest.73689A06F7BF9EB3.quest_subtitle: "Jewelry Polishing"
	quest.737AC021C2A2CF1D.quest_desc: [
		"&2During journeys, you often encounter well-enchanted but unusable weapons, truly a pity."
		""
		"&6This Disassembly Tome can transfer half (rounded up) of random enchantments from equipment to the book via anvil, consuming enchantment count × 10 levels of experience to convert into an enchantment book, while the original equipment is destroyed."
		""
		"&eCan also be reused on already marked equipment to refresh the enchantment combination to be extracted."
	]
	quest.737AC021C2A2CF1D.quest_subtitle: "Recycle"
	quest.73E6FF96B1846AF3.quest_desc: [
		"&6Fortification Treaty"
		"&7Grand exterior inseparable from weary nature.&r&cSoul shield recovery rate halved"
		"&7Compressed form's soul shield, grand yet precise.&r&aIncreases soul shield capacity&r&aSoul shield stability increased by half"
	]
	quest.73E6FF96B1846AF3.quest_subtitle: "Stand Firm Against"
	quest.73E6FF96B1846AF3.title: "Fortification Treaty"
	quest.7458C276CADE77AC.quest_subtitle: "Better Defense Methods"
	quest.746B034A029684EA.quest_desc: [
		"&6Smart Filter&r"
		"&7Controls device output and input filtering with higher complexity.&r"
		"&7Right-click to open the configuration GUI. Mark items in the top inventory; bottom buttons from left to right: Blacklist/Whitelist, Match/Ignore NBT, Clear, Confirm.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7If a marked filter contains information (like a List Filter or Attribute Filter), it reads the internal markers and uses logic operations to produce the filtering logic. (Different marks within the same filter are OR logic; a filter using a blacklist applies NOT logic.)&r"
		"&7Example: List Filter A marks iron sword and gold sword using a blacklist. Attribute Filter B marks 'not full durability'. List Filter C marks Filters A and B using a blacklist. Then Filter C's logic is: NOT( NOT(IronSword OR GoldSword) OR NOT(FullDurability) ), which simplifies to (IronSword OR GoldSword) AND FullDurability.&r"
		"&7A filter can contain another filter, allowing for more complex item filtering.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Attribute Filter&r"
		"&7The Attribute Filter can filter based on some '&eattributes&r&7' of items, making it more flexible than regular filters. Used in automation, it can achieve more intelligent effects than regular filters (though regular filters are still irreplaceable).&r"
		"&7Hold and use an Attribute Filter to open its configuration GUI. To add a filter condition, place a reference item. The GUI's middle will then display all '&eattributes&r&7' of that item. Use the mouse wheel to select. After selection, click the [ &a+&r&7 ] or [ &c+!&r&7 ] button on the right to add the attribute as a positive (matching) or negative (excluding) filter. Positive filters match items with that attribute; negative filters match items without it. Multiple conditions can be added to one Attribute Filter. The bottom left of the GUI lets you set the matching logic (AND/OR) for multiple tags.&r"
	]
	quest.746B034A029684EA.title: "Filters"
	quest.74747FBE5CBB77EF.quest_subtitle: "Arcane Materials"
	quest.7494DCB39DEAF4F5.quest_desc: [
		"&7This should be considered improved terminal. I removed its disk-dependent design, sacrificing some functionality for maximum storage space."
		""
		"Need sneak right-click terminal network to bind; after binding, can remotely access contents anytime; sneak right-click controller replenishes energy."
	]
	quest.7494DCB39DEAF4F5.quest_subtitle: "Remote Storage"
	quest.74F6BCC9482F2FD6.quest_desc: [
		"&6Reflection Treaty"
		"&7Your heart only &cstruggle&r&7 remains.&r&cDisables natural soul shield recovery"
		"&7One transformation, new refutation mechanism.&r&aDealing magic damage restores soul shield&r&aGreatly increases soul shield capacity&r&aSoul shield recovery doubled"
	]
	quest.74F6BCC9482F2FD6.quest_subtitle: "Double Return"
	quest.74F6BCC9482F2FD6.title: "Reflection Treaty"
	quest.7501056B288C71E1.quest_subtitle: "Food Value > 8"
	quest.750FC99EE02F979D.quest_desc: [
		"&7To compensate for limitations of single material performance, I developed Sewing Machine."
		""
		"This device can fuse multiple input items, supporting up to four component combinations. Final crystallized material parameters vary based on input item types and proportions."
		""
		"&eComprehensive calculation based on main component (first item in placement) and each item's rarity."
	]
	quest.750FC99EE02F979D.quest_subtitle: "No Need to Sew in Dark Room"
	quest.7535B9010BCF5E06.quest_desc: [
		"&6Flame Embrace Rune&r"
		""
		"&7Flame Embrace Rune's ability similar to namesake ritual, grants burning wearer &bFlame Embrace&r&7 effect at half potency, extinguishing &cflames&r&7 providing &aconstant healing&r&7.&r"
	]
	quest.7535B9010BCF5E06.quest_subtitle: "Extinguishing Pulse"
	quest.75EB87C487763166.quest_desc: [
		"&7After further research, discovered &bRelease Ritual&r&7 produced &6Soul Tree&r&7 has become another species, completely different from original &eRune Tree&r&7. Growth process different, traits different..."
		"&7"
		"&7Seems &dSoul Scar&r&7 creating it not limited to color and magical properties. Most notable differences form and leaf color. Soul Tree more slender, thinner than Rune Tree. Unlike Rune Tree's bright orange-yellow leaves, its leaves sickly purplish-red. But uses roughly same."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Soul Tree Research: Growth"
		"&7Similar to &8Rot&r&7, its saplings accept &dSoul Arcane Energy&r&7 and common fertilizers like bone meal, results roughly similar."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Soul Tree Research: Rot"
		"&7Another significant difference impact on surroundings. For example, it reproduces &bNon-Directional Ritual&r&7 with its growth energy, transmuting surroundings into rot. If planting this tree, best designate safe controlled area."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Soul Tree Research: Resin"
		"&7Soul Tree's viscous sap veins seem easier to accumulate fullness than Rune Tree. Resulting resin effects similarly corrupted. &cCursed Resin&r&7 doesn't restore my vitality, but enhances it, increasing my attack power and providing damage resistance."
	]
	quest.75EB87C487763166.quest_subtitle: "Twisted Tree Species"
	quest.760AED607B00C7CA.quest_desc: [
		"&6Magic-Devouring Treaty"
		"&7Soul resides within form for reason.&r&cAll damage received becomes magic damage&r&cSoul shield stability halved"
		"&7Part of your soul escapes body, used to attract arcane energy.&r&aShattering souls yields extra arcane energy&r&aHarvesting souls enhances most magical attributes"
	]
	quest.760AED607B00C7CA.quest_subtitle: "Escape Self"
	quest.760AED607B00C7CA.title: "Magic-Devouring Treaty"
	quest.7655A85408A81AA1.quest_desc: [
		"If you are fortunate enough to encounter a wild familiar, you may be able to gain its assistance by offering Arcane Essence."
		""
		"&eAlternatively, you can summon familiars using a summoning ritual."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Basic Familiar Mechanics&r"
		"&7Familiars can be tamed using &bArcane Essence&r&7. Right-click a familiar with a stick to set it to &astay in place&r&7, keeping it stationary and non-aggressive. Tamed familiars can be &asummoned/dismissed&r&7 by selecting the corresponding familiar in the familiar selection interface. This interface can be opened via a keybind, after which you can use the summon/dismiss shortcuts to control the selected familiar. Upon achieving the advancement '&cLearning Necromancy&r&7', familiars will avoid death at the cost of consuming &emana&r&7, but they will still die if your mana is depleted.&r"
	]
	quest.7655A85408A81AA1.quest_subtitle: "Finding Familiars"
	quest.7655A85408A81AA1.title: "Eternal Companion"
	quest.768F736B2B18FA1B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Keen Eye Oath&r"
		""
		"&7Perception in soul makes you prepare.&r"
		"&7-&cSpell Bullet&r&7 recovery rate halved&r"
		""
		"&7Arcane-seeking eye infused into soul.&r"
		"&7-&eWand Projectiles&r&7 will &atrack&r&7 targets&r"
	]
	quest.768F736B2B18FA1B.quest_subtitle: "Hundred-Pace Penetration"
	quest.768F736B2B18FA1B.title: "Keen Eye Oath"
	quest.7779D406142005D6.quest_desc: [
		"&6Research: Void Salt"
		"&7After passing through &dCrying Well&r&7, &8Curse Ash&r&7 transformed into substance I call "
		"&8Void"
		"Salt"
		"&r"
		"&7"
		". This dark powder chemically similar to Curse Ash, but contains no carbon, can no longer be called "
		"ash"
		"."
		"&7"
		"&7Seems composed of unknown unstable metal, bonded with corrosive substance I cannot identify. Beyond physical level also quite puzzling. Carbon life's foundation, but carbon-removed substance... seems moving? Couldn't confirm in experiments, but almost certain this substance possesses some life, and moves."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Reexamination: Void Salt"
		"&7&cNonexistence&r&7 producing &aexistence&r&7 is manifestation of &8Shadow Arcane Energy&r&7 existence. Perhaps &creally&r&7 alive... but its life defined by void, not material existence. Extending further, perhaps more complex life in void?"
	]
	quest.7779D406142005D6.quest_subtitle: "Clues to Soul's Essence"
	quest.779B259771323E1B.quest_desc: [
		"&7Defeating the King of the Dead will unlock the following ores:&r"
		"&7"
		"&#67B1E5Gobber&r&7"
		"&#C9C8E1Zenarite&r&7"
		"&#757369Runic Fragments&r&7"
		"&#7EE344Chlorophyte Ore&r&7"
		"&#770808Fearstone&r&7"
		"&#DD660ASolar Core&r"
	]
	quest.779B259771323E1B.quest_subtitle: "The Mansion is About to Collapse"
	quest.77A67AF0D408E4DC.quest_desc: [
		"&6Cauldron Enhancement"
		"&7&bSoul Cauldron&r&7 possesses deep potential, but most unrealized. Various &dCores&r&7 made from &6Alchemical Mineral Dust&r&7 can activate its potential, I call this process "
		"&6Enhancement"
		"&r"
		"&7"
		"."
		"&7"
		"&7Each &dEnhancement&r&7 has unique effect, placing in &bSoul Catalyzer&r&7, or up to four in Soul Cauldron activates. Using multiple same enhancements stacks effects."
		"&7"
		"&7For practical enhancement operation, specially modified tuning fork. Holding &6Tuning Fork&r&7 allows viewing cauldron's unique echoes and its enhancements. Moreover, using Tuning Fork on cauldron allows selecting attribute to enhance, but other attributes slightly decrease."
	]
	quest.77A67AF0D408E4DC.quest_subtitle: "Adjust Tuner"
	quest.77A67AF0D408E4DC.title: "Cauldron Enhancement"
	quest.77CA1E58A49F362C.quest_desc: [
		"&eBasic fuel, found everywhere."
		"&6Average consumption, but low power and speed."
		""
		"⚡ Speed: 0.5x | ♨ Temperature: 1500 | ⏳ Consumption: 0.2"
		""
		"&aTip&r&7: &f♨ &r&7Temperature determines the material grade that can be processed, ⚡ Speed affects processing time, ⏳ Consumption represents fuel durability."
	]
	quest.77CA1E58A49F362C.quest_subtitle: "Classic Fuel"
	quest.783683CB8A00E9B7.quest_desc: [
		"&6Aura Enhancement"
		"&7Arcane Pillar combines &6Soul Wood&r&7 and &eRune Wood&r&7 in manufacturing, making it extremely adept at guiding &dSoul Arcane Energy&r&7. Supplying &dSouls&r&7 releases energy stored in souls."
		"&7"
		"&7Totem design precisely avoids normal soul consumption. Ritual activation inevitably forms &dechoes&r&7, sequence matching &dSouls&r&7 constituting totem; this property brings negligible burden. Acceptable for passive effects, but severely limits effect strength. &bArcane Pillar&r&7 mitigates this limitation, allowing &6Totem Magic&r&7 to exert full power."
	]
	quest.783683CB8A00E9B7.quest_subtitle: "Advanced Obelisk"
	quest.783683CB8A00E9B7.title: "Aura Enhancement"
	quest.784CD820CEC6F25B.quest_desc: [
		"Move mouse to top-left corner of quest selection box, find arrow, click for following view:"
		"{image:kubejs:textures/gui/ftb_kjs3.png width:120 height:80 align:center}"
		""
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"Click again to see what prerequisite quests exist; selecting one automatically jumps to prerequisite quest"
		"{image:kubejs:textures/gui/ftb_kjs4.png width:120 height:80 align:center}"
		"You can also use right arrow at top-right corner of quest to view dropdown menu listing all dependent quests."
	]
	quest.784CD820CEC6F25B.quest_subtitle: "&mHow can I complete this damn quest"
	quest.784CD820CEC6F25B.title: "View Prerequisites"
	quest.789A0AD70CA77553.quest_desc: [
		"&7People often use &6Gold&r&7 as foundation for mystical research, its natural magic conductivity quite useful. Soul Arcane Energy no exception. Using &bSacred Energy&r&7 enhances gold's magic conductivity."
		""
		"&7Divine Gold's physical properties similar to gold. Infusing alloy with pure arcane energy enables smooth conduction of other arcane energies; &6Divine Gold&r&7 with this property perfect conductor my research needs. Can also make several fashionable item stands."
	]
	quest.789A0AD70CA77553.quest_subtitle: "In Harmony"
	quest.7924CE833E734123.quest_desc: [
		"&7Soul Rituals both &ccomplex&r&7 and &asimple&r&7, this contradiction has its logic."
		"&7Simple fixed effects, yet rooted in &dArcane Energy flow&r&7—thus ritual range judgment quite difficult."
		""
		"&7Created a &6Wand&r&7 as "
		"&bTuning"
		"Fork"
		"&r"
		"&7"
		" for ritual energy."
		"&7Holding it resonates with world's arcane energy flow, directly seeing &eTotem's influence range&r&7."
		""
		"&7Interestingly, this wand can also "
		"&bcalibrate"
		"&r"
		"&7"
		" sigils to active state, even sigils not in totem, holding wand to interact."
		"&7As far as I know, this effect only exists on &8visual level&r&7."
		"&7But even if not very useful, they're &6beautiful&r&7 enough."
	]
	quest.7924CE833E734123.quest_subtitle: "Insight into Rituals"
	quest.7924CE833E734123.title: "Totem Resonance"
	quest.7964EFBEAA0F5D57.quest_desc: ["&7Click &a√&r&7 to unlock next quest"]
	quest.7964EFBEAA0F5D57.quest_subtitle: "As you can see, this is a quest"
	quest.7964EFBEAA0F5D57.title: "Guidance"
	quest.79B12E63C90B3C61.quest_desc: [
		"Can provide 3000°C temperature, requires an Electric Furnace to function properly"
		""
		"&eNot just one per forge... multiple can be placed in the same furnace to provide fuel consumption"
	]
	quest.79B12E63C90B3C61.quest_subtitle: "Sustained Output"
	quest.79B7BF074539AA91.quest_desc: [
		"&6Smart Fluid Pipe&r"
		"&7Has a filter slot where items can be marked or filters inserted. (Use bucketed or bottled fluids for marking.)&r"
		"&7Only allows fluids matching the condition to pass.&r"
		"&7When using Smart Fluid Pipes, try to place them close to the fluid source. Otherwise, there is a chance that other types of fluid might be expelled first, causing the pipe to become &cclogged&r&7.&r"
	]
	quest.79C9A1EC8B99C973.quest_subtitle: "Arcane Materials"
	quest.7A1141EE7A34D62F.quest_desc: [
		"&6Void Form Resistance Oath&r"
		""
		"&7Oath blunts malice strike's edge.&r"
		"&7-Restoring &cmalice protection&r&7 reduces &cmalice critical&r&7 damage&r"
		""
		"&7Corrosive patterns engraved into malice soul-retention.&r"
		"&7-&6Malice Critical&r&7 charges &amalice protection&r&7&r"
	]
	quest.7A1141EE7A34D62F.quest_subtitle: "Confined to Slaughter"
	quest.7A1141EE7A34D62F.title: "Void Form Resistance Oath"
	quest.7A3C6671435E2BA9.quest_desc: [
		"&eA furnace that requires materials to be placed inside to power devices."
		""
		"&eCan input fuel through fluid pipes, etc."
		"&r"
		"Although materials need to be placed for combustion, as the grade of input materials increases, released heat also significantly increases, still having irreplaceable roles in specific processes."
	]
	quest.7A3C6671435E2BA9.quest_subtitle: "Thermal Smelting"
	quest.7A4449338F885205.quest_subtitle: "Stage 2, unlocks Stage 3 after kill"
	quest.7A63B4E0381D9BA4.quest_desc: [
		"&6Patience Reward Treaty"
		"&7Long pain worse than short pain.&r&cBuffered damage becomes magic damage, strength increased by one-fifth when released"
		"&7Disperse impact, slow damage.&r&aBuffers half of damage received, converting to damage over time&r&aBuffered damage cannot cause death"
	]
	quest.7A63B4E0381D9BA4.quest_subtitle: "Dilute Suffering"
	quest.7A63B4E0381D9BA4.title: "Patience Reward Treaty"
	quest.7AF858E2ECF74FAD.quest_subtitle: "Stage 1"
	quest.7B470F04445F5D8B.quest_desc: [
		"&7I can now discern composition of &cMalicious Lead&r&7, facilitating use design. Just as &8Shadow Arcane Energy&r&7 peculiar, its alloy with metal also has special properties. &eDeepslate Orichalcum&r&7 degraded, producing Malicious Lead; this &cpewter&r&7 craves external action. It craves erosion, disassembly, elimination of human development."
		"&7"
		"&7This property indeed has mundane uses—as weapon further damaging armor while harming and shattering souls; its occult uses not negligible. Malicious Pewter not inert magically, nor absorbs magic. Rather magic seems unable to &cform&r&7 around it, symbolizing decline of knowledge pursuit."
		"&7"
		"&7This metal quite tough, quite sharp, but wearing &canti-magic suit&r&7 definitely creates problems... also brings new abilities. Already have general idea making armor set with it; this set utilizing metal's abilities should be extremely powerful."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Malicious Fortress Armor"
		"&7&cMalicious Pewter&r&7 repels magic, so from mage's perspective, wearing it strange practice. But I &aam also&r&7 a mage, Fortress Armor I created immensely powerful."
		"&7"
		"&7Armor beneath Malicious Pewter plates opposite &6Soul-Stained Steel Armor&r&7—my soul not protected, but arcane flow ruined by this metal. It twists arcane energy outward, disrupting incoming damage. Wearing full Fortress Armor, my soul ultimately receives damage reduced to half original."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7This armor affects not just incoming magic. Wearer's own arcane circuits also affected. Their original trajectory toward soul disrupted, stolen, processed twisted. In arcane energy's dissolution, energy still remains. Armor reacts to this energy, enhancing accordingly."
		"&7"
		"&7Two key points in this effect. First, armor's magic absorption process should be called "
		"&cMalice"
		"Conversion"
		"&r"
		"&7"
		". It's interception of arcane energy flowing to soul and absorption of obtained energy. Second, armor weaves stolen energy, giving it new form and intent. This process's effect should be named "
		"&6Malice"
		"Protection"
		"&r"
		"&7"
		"."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7Malice Protection effectively powerful shield directly negating almost all damage types. As armor continuously absorbs magic, Malice Protection's capacity, even recovery rate and recovery gain grow, varying by absorbed attributes. So far in research, Malicious Fortress Armor's strongest ability undoubtedly this."
	]
	quest.7B470F04445F5D8B.quest_subtitle: "Evolution No More"
	quest.7B6F7BDF000CF379.quest_desc: [
		"&6Fused Consciousness&r"
		""
		"&7Future hides many mysteries... but you can glimpse part in advance.&r"
		"&7Input iron blocks into &eCrying Well&r&7 to create &bAnomalous Components&r&7. Input complete components into &eCrying Well&r&7 to create Fused Consciousness.&r"
	]
	quest.7B6F7BDF000CF379.quest_subtitle: "Blueprint of Past and Future Everything"
	quest.7B8819152EE73E21.quest_desc: [
		"&6Life Fruit&r"
		"&7A consumable used to increase a familiar's &ahealth&r&7. There are 3 tiers, each with a usage limit.&r"
	]
	quest.7B8819152EE73E21.title: "&6Life Fruit&r"
	quest.7BACE6601BC4DFED.quest_desc: ["Once emeralds are stored inside, they will never be lost..."]
	quest.7BACE6601BC4DFED.quest_subtitle: " Prevent Loss"
	quest.7C74D47B9ED97737.quest_desc: [
		"&7Security Manager is a block that can store security cards"
		""
		"You can configure what permissions each player (bound to security card) has"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&eWhen no security cards on network, every player can access all permissions."
		""
		"&6Start inserting security cards to define player permissions."
		""
		"&ePlayers without configured security cards can still do everything in network (all permissions)."
		""
		"&6To configure "
		"global"
		" permissions for all unconfigured players, configure security cards not bound to players and insert into Security Manager."
		""
		"&eOperators on server have access to all permissions."
		""
		"&6Security Manager placer can always open its GUI and change security settings, regardless of permissions."
	]
	quest.7C74D47B9ED97737.quest_subtitle: "No Access Permissions"
	quest.7C7A1613FB9C97E8.quest_subtitle: "Surely you two aren't mutually farming this on purpose?"
	quest.7C7C7734793AB866.quest_desc: [
		"&6Prismarine Focusing Lens&r"
		""
		"&7Sometimes simplicity is answer. Prismarine Focusing Lens refracts not light but arcane energy, greatly reducing &cdestabilization risk&r&7 of &eSoul Focus&r&7 process. But note: stability only prevents catalysts from extra damage.&r"
	]
	quest.7C7C7734793AB866.quest_subtitle: "Stabilize"
	quest.7CACDAC57F697371.quest_subtitle: "Ore Sniffer"
	quest.7CDF0A87C605E833.quest_subtitle: "Familiar Summoning Ritual"
	quest.7CE0C7EC4D46C170.quest_subtitle: "Familiar Summoning Ritual"
	quest.7D0410D74877C78A.quest_desc: [
		"As shown, you can respectively place Controller, Storage Terminal, Storage Blocks together for linking, while powering Controller"
		""
		"{image:kubejs:textures/gui/refinedstorage1.png width:180 height:100 align:center}"
		""
		"Size and quantity of linked storage blocks determine your item storage capacity"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"You can also use cables to link them; then all blocks connected by cables are calculated"
		""
		"{image:kubejs:textures/gui/refinedstorage2.png width:180 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.7D0410D74877C78A.quest_subtitle: "Basic Tutorial"
	quest.7D0410D74877C78A.title: "Tips: Basic Usage"
	quest.7D2FD37CB2502689.quest_subtitle: "Legendary Meat Shield"
	quest.7D61EDF0B7F33C80.quest_desc: ["Has orientation; when placed by player, faces clicked block face; only network on facing direction separates from networks accessed by other faces"]
	quest.7D61EDF0B7F33C80.quest_subtitle: "Equivalent to cable, but controllable via redstone signal"
	quest.7D6295CE0F8D8951.quest_desc: [
		"&6Alternator&r"
		""
		"&7A machine that converts rotational stress into electric current, the opposite of the &eElectric Motor&7 which converts electricity back into rotation. It accepts stress input on one end and outputs energy on the other.&r"
		""
		"&7Requires at least &c32 RPM&7 to start working and has an internal energy buffer of &c5 kFE&7.&r"
		""
		"&7Through it, you can convert mechanical kinetic energy into &eelectrical energy&7, which is easier to store and transmit over long distances, then use Electric Motors to drive machinery again. Note that some energy is always lost in the two conversions.&r"
	]
	quest.7DC30B49569B363E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Oakwood Might Rune&r"
		""
		"&7Oakwood Might Rune's ability similar to namesake ritual, grants wearer &bOakwood Might&r&7 effect at half potency, providing fixed amount of &adamage boost&r&7, enhanced when empty-handed.&r"
	]
	quest.7DC30B49569B363E.quest_subtitle: "Strengthen Pulse"
	quest.7DDA9820D328CC3F.quest_subtitle: "Beloved Kin"
	quest.7E11D3149C613671.quest_subtitle: "Fluid Cast into Items"
	quest.7E59A0E6979C8FF1.quest_desc: [
		"&6Blazing Treaty&r"
		""
		"&7Fire's nature undeniable.&r"
		"&7-Forcibly extinguishing fire causes self to receive &cinfernal fire arcane impact&r"
		""
		"&7Nothing can rival blazing fire.&r"
		"&7-Causing &efire effects&r&7 on enemies more powerful&r"
	]
	quest.7E59A0E6979C8FF1.quest_subtitle: "Add Fuel to Fire"
	quest.7E59A0E6979C8FF1.title: "Blazing Treaty"
	quest.7EB97CBE6483FCF7.quest_desc: ["But I still have to remind you, dorm supervisors will only spawn when you maintain regular sleep patterns...."]
	quest.7EB97CBE6483FCF7.quest_subtitle: "Sleep Well"
	quest.7EE5C7DD9EA8C66F.quest_subtitle: "Arcane Materials"
	quest.7EF077D05E3E3B7E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Unyielding Rune&r"
		""
		"&7Unyielding Rune stabilizes wearer's posture, negating all &cknockback&r&7.&r"
	]
	quest.7EF077D05E3E3B7E.quest_subtitle: "Withstand Unbearable Things"
	quest.7F2C0291CE6F6B66.quest_desc: [
		"&#FF66CCLust - Corrosion&r&7"
		"&7Normal attack multiplier is &#00AA001.0 times&r&7. When attacking a target with &#FF66CC\"Rose\"&r&7, attack multiplier increases to &#00AA001.1 times&r&7; when attacking a target with &#CC0000\"Bloodstained Rose\"&r&7, attack multiplier increases to &#00AA001.2 times&r&7.&r"
		""
		"&#00FFAA[Upon hitting an attack]&r&7 If the target does not have &#FF66CC\"Rose\"&r&7 or &#CC0000\"Bloodstained Rose\"&r&7, grant it 1 stack of &#FF66CC\"Rose\"&r&7. If the target already has a Bleeding effect, instead grant 1 stack of &#CC0000\"Bloodstained Rose\"&r&7."
		""
		"&#00FFAA[Upon hitting an attack]&r&7 If the target has 5 stacks of &#FF66CC\"Rose\"&r&7, consume all stacks, and grant yourself 1 stack of &#FFAA00Damage Boost&r&7."
		""
		"&#00FFAA[Upon hitting an attack]&r&7 If the target has 10 stacks of &#CC0000\"Bloodstained Rose\"&r&7, consume all stacks, grant yourself 3 stacks of &#FFAA00Damage Boost&r&7, and deal 1 instance of bleeding damage to the target based on its current bleeding level."
	]
	quest.7F53C2C16D225E49.quest_subtitle: "Can break blocks or fluids in front, while also absorbing front drops"
	quest.7F578E1D8C765465.quest_desc: [
		"&7Soul Rituals mostly have similarities. Simple rituals manifest effects by seeking &dRitual Sites&r&7, while more complex rituals—seeking to influence world without specific target—manifest effects through solidified &dRitual Sites&r&7."
		"&7"
		"&7Solidified Ritual Sites wander in direction indicated by totem when formed. I measured movement speed precisely four blocks per second, can activate carried effects eight times before dissipating."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7Tainted Stone uniquely negatively affects magic. It interferes with arcane flow, ultimately completely dispersing arcane energy. Without special structural form, only interference nature needs attention. Ritual Sites flying over &cTainted Stone&r&7 don't activate effects, thus don't dissipate."
		"&7"
		"&7Finally, Ritual Sites untouchable, thus massless, unaffected by gravity, can pass through any solid matter."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7&bRitual Anchors&r&7 are instruments guiding and enhancing wandering Ritual Sites. Embedding &dSoul Arcane Energy&r&7 establishes flight path, affecting all passing Sites. Path's arcane etching technology inherently sensitive, thus Ritual Anchors cannot work when affected by redstone."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Site's Speed"
		"&7Embedding &bEthereal Air Energy&r&7 into &bRitual Anchor&r&7 grants Site speed boost, accelerating its movement in world. Each Site can accept this effect twice, each doubling speed."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Site's Strength"
		"&7Embedding &bAzure Water Energy&r&7 into &bRitual Anchor&r&7 grants Site strength boost, enhancing efficacy interacting with certain Ritual Anchor etchings. Each Site can accept this effect twice, each doubling strength."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Site's Effect"
		"&7Embedding &bEarthen Earth Energy&r&7 into &bRitual Anchor&r&7 grants Site effect boost, enhancing strength of each activation's produced effect. Each Site can accept this effect twice, each doubling effect."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Site's Journey"
		"&7Embedding &bInfernal Fire Energy&r&7 into &bRitual Anchor&r&7 grants Site journey boost, reaching further before dissipating. Each Site can accept this effect twice, each doubling journey."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Repair Site"
		"&7Embedding &bSacred Energy&r&7 into &bRitual Anchor&r&7 causes Site to continuously repair itself, extending existence, reaching further. Each Site can accept this effect four times."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Revive Site"
		"&7Embedding &bEvil Energy&r&7 into &bRitual Anchor&r&7 causes Site to sacrifice existing elemental gains to immediately repair itself. Limit same as Sacred Energy."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Guide Site"
		"&7Embedding &bPrimordial Energy&r&7 into &bRitual Anchor&r&7 changes Site's flight path, no consumption, no side effects. Primordial Energy is pure energy without direction; its effects naturally relatively ordinary, but appropriate."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Split Site"
		"&7Embedding &bOccult Energy&r&7 into &bRitual Anchor&r&7 causes Site to split, becoming two unrelated but functionally identical Sites. Each Site can accept this effect four times. Copied Sites single-colored, cannot copy again."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Ritual Research: Elemental Gains"
		"&7Site is primitive arcane construct, no specialization, thus quite limited. Using &bRitual Anchors&r&7 to transmit &eElemental Arcane Energy&r&7 solves this, but need detail specific functions."
		"&7"
		"&7When Ritual Site flies over Ritual Anchor embedded with &bEthereal Air&r&7, &bAzure Water&r&7, &bEarthen Earth&r&7, &bInfernal Fire&r&7 patterns, receives elemental gain. Within same group, only first two acceptances effective. Also, Site's simple construction means maximum four gains acceptable."
		"&7"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Ritual Research: Site Revival"
		"&7Site is primitive arcane construct; my prototype only required etched effect and mobility. Later, key functionality added self-sustenance. Not self-recovery like living beings, but counts as self-sustaining."
		"&7"
		"&7When receiving &cEvil Energy's&r&7 command, Site forcibly self-sacrifices. Abandons all existing elemental gains. Speed least important, thus abandons speed gain first. Next strength gain, then effect gain. Journey gain most important, only abandoned when no other gains."
	]
	quest.7F578E1D8C765465.quest_subtitle: "Moving Arcane Energy"
	quest.7F578E1D8C765465.title: "Site Management"
	quest.7FD6941949B8C8F4.quest_desc: [
		"&6Mechanical Crafter&r"
		"&7A processing component capable of automatically crafting items.&r"
		"&7Stress Usage: &c2 su/RPM&r"
		""
		"&6Usage&r"
		"&6Item Crafting&r"
		"&7The Mechanical Crafter can execute '&eAuto-Crafting&r&7' and '&6Powered Crafting&r&7' recipes.&r"
		"&7'Auto-Crafting' recipes automatically adapt to all vanilla crafting table recipes. 'Powered Crafting' recipes are special recipes added by Create.&r"
		""
		"&6Placement and Adjustment&r"
		"&7When using Mechanical Crafters to craft an item, place multiple crafters in the shape of the target item's recipe to form a &eCrafting Structure&r&7.&r"
		"&7Then, use a Wrench to adjust the internal paths within the crafting structure so the crafters' crafting paths connect.&r"
		"&7After the paths connect, you must set an &aItem Exit&r&7; otherwise, crafting cannot complete.&r"
		""
		"&6Material Input and Powering&r"
		"&7Players can right-click the front of a Mechanical Crafter with items to insert directly, or input items from any side via logistics components. The Mechanical Crafter is also a valid target for the Mechanical Arm.&r"
		"&7The Mechanical Crafter needs stress input via a gear on its side to operate. It can transmit power, so a crafting structure only needs power in one place.&r"
		""
		"&6Operation&r"
		"&6Triggering&r"
		"&7When all Mechanical Crafters in a crafting structure are filled, it automatically starts. To force-start an unfilled structure, give a redstone signal to any crafter.&r"
		"&7Players can install '&eCrafter Covers&r&7' on crafters. A covered crafter cannot store items but is considered filled. When all other crafters are filled, the structure automatically starts.&r"
		""
		"&6Starting Crafting&r"
		"&7During operation, materials on the crafting structure move along the paths step by step from the ends toward the exit. Each step takes &c1000/RPM·Tick&r&7.&r"
		"&7When all materials reach the end, they take the time of one more step to craft the product, which is then ejected.&r"
		"&7If the end crafter points to a container, the product is stored there.&r"
		"&7If the recipe is invalid, all materials are ejected in the final step.&r"
		""
		"&6Linking&r"
		"&7Hold a Wrench and right-click the seam between two Mechanical Crafters facing the same direction to link them. When items are input to one linked crafter, they are distributed evenly among all linked crafters.&r"
		"&7Right-click the same seam again with a Wrench to unlink.&r"
		""
		"&6Crafting Speed&r"
		"&7Crafting speed is mainly determined by the Mechanical Crafter's RPM, but not exclusively.&r"
		"&7The number of steps required also affects speed. This depends on the path arrangement of the crafting structure. Using more optimized paths reduces steps, thus increasing efficiency.&r"
		""
		"&8This manuscript page is sticky, making you wonder what its owner crafted it with.&r"
	]
	quest.7FF37718528D1FB5.quest_desc: ["&6Compared to the previous two tomes, the Extraction Tome appears particularly precious—it can completely strip the enchantment energy from items without any damage.&r"]
	quest.7FF37718528D1FB5.quest_subtitle: "Recycle... Don't Recycle! Reuse!"
	quest.7FFEDC8A8DA45A2F.quest_desc: [
		"# &6Font Preferences &r"
		""
		"### &eAvailable Fonts &r"
		"&fModpack provides two fonts by default:"
		"&7- Storage path: &e\\kubejs\\assets\\ &r"
		"&7- &6ChironGoRoundTC &r (default font)"
		"&7- &6Maple_UI.ttf &r"
		""
		"### &bFont Switching Method &r"
		"1. Press &4Ctrl + K &r to open Modern UI control interface"
		"2. Click &ePreferences &r"
		"3. &eSwipe right &r in the interface"
		"4. Select your preferred font"
		""
		"### &3Custom Fonts &r"
		"&7- Can download other font files yourself"
		"&7- Call directly after placing font files in any directory"
		"&7- &aAll default fonts are free for commercial use, no copyright risks &r"
		""
		"&7- Default uses &6ChironGoRoundTC .ttf &r font"
	]
	quest.7FFEDC8A8DA45A2F.quest_subtitle: "Don't like the modpack font!"
